(16, 'hot-water-heat-pump', 2, 'Hot Water Heat Pump', '7', '7c9b5f71-26bb-4a2e-b45e-999f99da5e07.webp', '<p>Discover variety of Hot Water Heat Pump price in Nepal. We provide renowned brand Midea heat pump in Nepal with various options suitable for you.\r\n</p><ul><li>Heat Pumps Absorb heat from the air and transfer it to heat your water.\r\n</li><li>Energy efficient heat pumps which consumes less cost than conventional electric water heaters.\r\n</li><li>User friendly and easy to use system.</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, '2024-04-26 09:58:45', '2026-03-27 00:08:12', 'Hot Water Heat Pump', NULL, NULL, 18, NULL, 0),
