(26, 'air-purifier-nepal', 1, 'Air Purifier', '5', '327c750e-510e-4a87-b0a5-8212fb3f7fe2.webp', '<p>Dr Care Air Purifier is a high-quality air purification system that is designed to provide clean and fresh air in Kathmandu, Nepal. With the increasing pollution levels in the city, it is essential to have an air purifier that can filter out harmful pollutants and particles from the air.</p><p>It uses advanced HEPA (High-Efficiency Particulate Air) filters that can capture 99.97% of airborne particles as small as 0.3 microns. It also has an activated carbon filter that can remove harmful gases and odours from the air, making it fresher and cleaner to breathe.</p><p>In addition to its effective air-cleaning capabilities, It is also energy-efficient and operates quietly, making it a convenient and practical addition to any indoor space.</p><p>It comes with easy-to-use controls and has a low maintenance requirement, which makes it a hassle-free air purification solution.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 1, '2024-09-06 11:29:10', '2026-03-27 00:08:28', NULL, NULL, NULL, 36, NULL, 0),
