y spangle composed of Aluminium (55%), Zinc (43.4%) and a touch of silicon (1.6%). Great mechanical strength and 7 times more resisted to corrosion than common galvanized steel.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sealing Materials<span>&nbsp;</span></strong>: For perfect waterproof finish and proper ventilation of collectors casing, all materials used (EPDM, polyurethane sealant) resist to extreme weather conditions and temperature changes.</td></tr></tbody></table>', NULL, '254412d5-f728-485e-9869-8be199f25248.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-29 06:21:56', '2025-10-06 23:23:36', '288715', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 105, 0),
(30, 'closed -loop-thermosiphon-solar-water-heater-500-ltrs.', 'Closed Loop Thermosiphon solar water heater : 500 Ltrs.', 2, 10, 19, NULL, '<p><strong>Model No. :<span>&nbsp;</span></strong>500MAX600</p><p><strong>Closed Loop Thermosiphon solar water heater : 500 Ltrs.</strong></p><p>500 Ltrs. Thermosiphon solar water heater with 3 collectors, Pressurized System, Closed Loop System, enameled, Closed Loop, 10 Bar, 9006 external cover / 3Kw-220V / 2 Mg anode rods / with Port for Inlet and Otlet for Heat Pump, 1980X1010X86mm alum. selective Absorber / Copper water frame 9xΦ8×0,4mm + 2xΦ22×0,7mm / Rock fiber 40mm / Low iron glass 3,2mm /Alum. Frame RAL9006 / 4 exits, support structure for flat roof installation, accessories for support structure for flat roof installation/40°, connections’ set for inox tubes/ 12Lt thermal fluid, Ports for Heat Pumps Φ20</p><p>&nbsp;<br></p><p><strong>Make : Solarflame MAX</strong></p>', NULL, NULL, '<p><strong><u>Technical Specifications</u></strong></p><p><strong>Thermosyphon closed loop solar systems “Solar Flame MAX” with the following benefits:</strong><br>✓ Large range of versions (49 systems), certified according to SOLAR KEYMARK.<br>✓ Compact system setup, for easy transport and installation.<br>✓ Customized design, for exclusive OEM versions.</p><p><strong>Tank:</strong><br>➢ Glass-dual enameled (according to DIN4753, part 3) double walled (with large jacket heat exchanger) boilers, with optimized heat insulation and durable external cover for maximum protection in seaside areas.</p><p><strong>The collectors:</strong><br>Superb efficiency rating collectors “Solar Flame FMAX” (η0,a=83% according to EN12975 Standard) series with:<br>➢ High selective PVD absorber coating, for fast and high temperature production.<br>➢ Water frame entirely made of copper.<br>➢ Tempered Hail-resistant solar low iron glass.<br>➢ Maximum heat transfer between the absorber sheet and the copper water frame, thanks to optimized laser welding technology.<br>➢ Incident angle modifier Kθ =0.96 at 50° ensures maximum radiation absorption throughout the day.<br>➢ High quality, recyclable materials ensure a long service life and high environmental compatibility.</p><p><strong>The support structures:</strong><br>➢ Support structures with high endurance and easy installation on flat or inclined tiled surfaces.<br>➢ Easy and safe installation due to special high quality and reliable accessories included in the connections’ kit.</p><p><strong>Thermal Solar Collector :</strong></p><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Overall Dimensions<span>&nbsp;</span></strong>: 1980 x 1010 x 86 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Frame of the collector :</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Aluminium profile powder coated for maximum protection in seaside areas.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Absorber surface :</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Aluminium surface with blue titanium high selective treatment with absorbence and low emission (Alpha = 95%, beta = 4%), laser welded on the copper water frame.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Transparent Cover :</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Security-Tempered prismatic solar glass for maximum protection against extreme weather conditions and temperature changes.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Header of water frame :<span>&nbsp;</span></strong>Copper tubes dia 22mm, which is welded to the vertical tubes with hard silver solder. Each water frame is tested at the pressure of 15 bars. Headers are punched with upper expansion for perfect fitting with vertical tubes and minimum pressure drop in the collector.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Thermal insulation :<span>&nbsp;</span></strong>40mm thock layer of prepressed black mineral wool special for solar panels for minimum thermal loss. Rockwool insulation thermal conductivity : 0=0.035 W/m<span>&nbsp;</span><sup>o</sup>K (EN13162) and heat capacity 0.84 kJ/kgK.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Back Cover :</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Aluzinc 0.4mm thick. Aluzinc stands for aluminium and zinc, fused in almost equal proportions, as a coating for the steel sheet that is coated with a silvery spangle composed of Aluminium (55%), Zinc (43.4%) and a touch of silicon (1.6%). Great mechanical strength and 7 times more resisted to corrosion than common galvanized steel.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sealing Materials<span>&nbsp;</span></strong>: For perfect waterproof finish and proper ventilation of collectors casing, all materials used (EPDM, polyurethane sealant) resist to extreme weather conditions and temperature changes.</td></tr></tbody></table>', NULL, 'b8dc7ec2-bb6f-489f-b6a6-206a647feb09.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-29 06:24:49', '2025-10-06 23:22:06', '454825', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 103, 0),
(31, 'hybrid-system-combo-heat-pump-thermal-solar-collector', 'Hybrid System – Combo Heat Pump + Thermal Solar Collector', 2, 10, 7, NULL, '<p><strong>Model No. :<span>&nbsp;</span></strong>EH 260</p><p><strong>Scope of Supply :</strong></p><p><strong>1. Hot Water Heat Pump with solar coil :</strong></p><p>Make &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; :&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Climer, Spain</p><p>Model&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; :&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; EH 260</p><p>Heat Pump Output&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; :&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1.841 Kw</p><p>Electrical Heater&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; :&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1.5&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Kw</p><p>Heat Pump Input&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; :&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 0.496 Kw</p><p>Electrical&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; :&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 230 V, 1pH, 50 Hz</p><p>COP&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; :&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3.7</p><p>Water Tank Capacity&nbsp; :&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 260 Ltrs.</p><p>MOC Tank&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; :&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Stainless Steel</p><p>Coil MOC&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; :&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Stainless Steel</p><p><strong>2. Thermal Solar Collector with modular powder coated support structure – 2 Nos.</strong></p><p><strong>3. Solar Pump Station :<span>&nbsp;</span></strong>RESOL FlowSol S</p><p>Consists of : Wall Mounting Bracket, Insulation, Drain Valve, Ball with integrated non-return valve, Fill valve, Pump, Pressure Guage, Flowmeter, Safety Valve 6 Bar.)</p><p><strong>4. Solar Controller :<span>&nbsp;</span></strong>RESOL Delta Sol AL with 2 sensors</p><p><strong>5. De-aerator Valve – 1 No. :<span>&nbsp;</span></strong>Tiemme, Italy</p><p><strong>6. Copper Pipings with EPDM insulation and fittings</strong></p><p><strong>7. Installation, Testing &amp; Commissioning.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;<br></p><p><strong>Make : Solarflame MAX</strong></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '6f67466e-8ce5-47f3-95fb-4fcc8236ff0b.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-04-29 06:27:13', '2024-10-27 03:29:35', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 102, 0),
(34, 'electrical-fireplace-yf-2801era', 'Electrical Fireplace – YF-2801ERA', 2, 10, 14, NULL, '<p><strong>Model No. :<span>&nbsp;</span></strong>YF-2801ERA</p><p>A 24” electrical fireplace for giving comfort and feeling as of real wood-fired fireplace. The False Flame in the electric fireplace resembles the natural flame, and the pulsating flame gives space vitality and design sense.</p><p><strong>Advantages :</strong><br>Elegant look<br>Comfortable</p><p><strong>Features :</strong><br>Built-in style fireplace with Log flame effect<br>Flat tempered glass<br>Flame can be turned on even with heating off<br>6 Levels temperature settings<br>Automatic overheating protection<br>4-level lightness adjustable<br>The heating temperature detection sensor<br>Adjustable timing device, which can be chosen from 30 mins to 9 Hrs<br>Digital display and LED flame<br>Manual and remote control<br>High (2000W) /Low (1000W) thermostat setting allows energy and electricity savings<br>Working silently, with rapid, wide-spread, and even airflow transfer.</p>', '<p><strong>Warranty:</strong><span>&nbsp;12&nbsp;months</span><br><br><span>1. Warranty : &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>2. Actual product may vary as in picture displayed.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>3. Manufacturer may change the specifications at any time.</span><br></p>', NULL, '<p><strong>Electricals :</strong><br>Power &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; : 2000 W<br>Volt &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; : 220V, 1pH<br>Frequency&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 50 Hz<br>IP &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; : IP24</p><p><strong>Physical :&nbsp;</strong><br>Size&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;: 732 * 163 * 390 mm<br>Nett Weight&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; : 14.9 Kgs.<br>Gross Weight&nbsp; &nbsp;: 17.9 Kgs</p>', NULL, 'e1c688f7-014c-4377-87e8-6435a5da5063.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-29 06:43:44', '2024-12-13 10:25:27', '33200', NULL, 'Hot', NULL, NULL, 'https://bit.ly/4fmSUQ6', NULL, 'https://meroepasal.com/product/the-heating-expert-electrical-fireplace-yf-2801era/', 15, 0),
(35, 'infrared-heater-nepal-18d', 'Infrared Heater (THE-FIHP18D)', 2, 10, 14, NULL, '<p><strong>Model No. :<span>&nbsp;</span></strong>Infrared Heater Nepal THE-FIHP18D</p><p>Heaters for indoor and outdoor use are perfect for your living room, kitchen and more. Choose from an array of styles and heating options to bring your space to life. Infrared Heaters are comfortable sun-like heating for outdoor and indoor applications. An infrared heater heats the objects rather than heating the air. It can be used with Stand or on a Ceiling or on Wall Mounted.</p><p><u><strong>Advantages :</strong></u></p><ul><li>Comfortable</li><li>Good for Health</li><li>No Smell</li><li>Noiseless</li><li>No Transformation</li></ul><p><u><strong>Features :</strong></u></p><ul><li>High-end design, unique structure, slim model.</li><li>Over-heat safety protection.</li><li>Curved shape aluminium heating element.</li><li>Wall mounted over 1.5-meter hanging height and have wide radiant warm flow.</li><li>A wide temperature setting range of &nbsp;5 C – 45 C</li><li>24H timer control</li><li>Big Attractive LED Display</li><li>Remote controller</li></ul><p>Check out&nbsp;<a href="https://www.sigmatechnologies.com.np/product/infrared-heater-nepal-2/">Infrared Heater (THE-FIHP20D)</a></p><p>We Provide professional and quality heaters for your home and offices at competitive prices.</p><p>Heating Expert Nepal offers high-quality infrared heating products that are designed to efficiently heat your residential and commercial property. We offer ductless heat pumps, geothermal units, solar energy pumps and other energy-efficient technologies.</p>', '<p><strong>Warranty:</strong><span>&nbsp;12&nbsp;months</span><br><br><span>1. Warranty : &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>2. Actual product may vary as in picture displayed.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>3. Manufacturer may change the specifications at any time.</span><br></p>', '<p><br></p>', '<p><strong>Coverage Area :</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Approx. 13 – 18 m<sup>2</sup></p><p><strong>Electricals :</strong><br>Power&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 1800 W<br>Volt&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 220V, 1pH<br>Frequency&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 50 Hz</p><p><strong>Physical :</strong><br>Size &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 1200 * 150 * 63 mm<br>Nett Weight&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 7.5 Kgs.<br>Gross Weight&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 8.5 Kgs<br>Pack Size&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 1300 * 200 * 105mm</p>', NULL, 'd3cc2ce6-3af9-48d4-9e15-488f929bdb48.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-29 06:45:48', '2025-07-14 01:41:15', '24500', NULL, 'Hot', '10', NULL, 'https://www.daraz.com.np/products/i118804348.html?spm=Seller_NP.24863640.table_online_product.13.76862a979koVOf', NULL, 'https://meroepasal.com/product/the-heating-expert-ceiling-or-wall-mounted-far-infrared-heater-the-fihp18d/', 14, 0),
(36, 'napkin-vend-30', 'Napkin Vending Machine – VEND 30', 2, 8, 10, NULL, '<p>Model: VEND-30<br><br>Vend 30, Vend 60 and Vend 90<br><br>Sanitary Napkin Vending Machine – NapiVend is a coin-operated sanitary napkin vending machine available in three different models according to the number of napkins that may be loaded inside the vending machine namely Vend 30, 60, and 90. The sanitary napkins can be easily loaded into the NapiVend and it requires very low maintenance. The highlight of this product is that it does not require an operator for the daily use of the machine.<br><br>This machine vends a napkin when you drop a coin in it. The NapiVend comes with a coin rejection option and it could be calibrated to variable coin sizes of any currency. NapiVend has been designed considering all safety factors and foolproofed from all possible failure modes. NapiVend has been designed to operate under battery backup for more than a week.<br><br>Where to Use?<br>Girl’s Schools, Colleges, Hostels<br>Hospitals, Hotels, Shopping Malls, Complexes<br>Corporate Offices, Factories<br>Airways, Railways, and Bus Stations<br>Public Toilets, Theme Parks, Highway Toilets, Petrol Bunks<br></p>', NULL, NULL, '<table><tbody><tr><th>MODEL</th><td>Vend 30</td><td>Vend 60</td><td>Vend 90</td></tr><tr><th>ELECTRICAL RATING</th><td>230 V AC, 50 Hz, 10 Watts</td><td>230 V AC, 50 Hz, 10 Watts</td><td>230 V AC, 50 Hz, 10 Watts</td></tr><tr><th>STORAGE CAPACITY</th><td>30 napkins</td><td>60 napkins</td><td>90 napkins</td></tr><tr><th>BATTERY SPEC.</th><td>12 V, 7 Ah</td><td>12 V, 7 Ah</td><td>12 V, 7 Ah</td></tr><tr><th>DIMENSION (L x W x H)</th><td>750 x 175 x 375 in mm</td><td>750 x 175 x 525 in mm</td><td>750 x 175 x 720 in mm</td></tr><tr><th>WEIGHT kgs</th><td>15 kgs</td><td>22 kgs</td><td>32 kgs</td></tr></tbody></table>', NULL, '04bee54d-3e25-4aa7-bf87-c01f42f501c0.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-29 06:46:27', '2024-10-27 03:29:35', '42375', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 101,