(37, 'infrared-heater-nepal-20d', 'Infrared Heater (THE-FIHP20D)', 2, 10, 14, NULL, '<p>With the infrared heater, you can enjoy the warmth in your home. The infrared heater is made for all types of uses, indoor and outdoor.</p><p>Infrared Heaters are comfortable sun-like heating for outdoor and indoor applications. This heats the objects rather than heating the air. It can be used with Stand or on a Ceiling or Wall Mounted.</p><p>Our Infrared Heater is the most recommended heating tool for houses or other indoor areas of Nepal. It has an adjustable thermostat that enables you to set its temperature according to your requirements. Especially, it’s ideal for cold areas such as houses, shops, hotels etc.</p><p><u><strong>Advantages :</strong></u><br>Comfortable<br>Good for Health<br>No Smell<br>Noiseless<br>No Transformation</p><p><u><strong>Features :</strong></u><br>High-end design, unique structure, slim model.<br>Over-heat safety protection.<br>Curved shape aluminium heating element.<br>Wall mounted over 1.5-meter hanging height and have wide radiant warm flow.<br>A wide temperature setting range of &nbsp;5 C – 45 C<br>24H timer control with WIFI and Body Sensor<br>Big Attractive LED Display<br>Digital Remote controller</p><p>Check out<span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.sigmatechnologies.com.np/product/infrared-heater-nepal/">Infrared Heater (THE-FIHP18D)</a></p><p>Heating Expert Nepal offers high-quality infrared heating products that are designed to efficiently heat your residential and commercial property. We offer ductless heat pumps, geothermal units, solar energy pumps and other energy-efficient technologies.</p>', '<p><strong>Warranty:</strong><span>&nbsp;12&nbsp;months</span><br><br><span>1. Warranty : &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applies from the date of tax invoice. An original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty cl