(42, 'ceiling-infrared-panel-heater-tas-iph-1000', 'Wall Panel Heater (ECONO – 400)', 2, 10, 14, NULL, '<p><strong>Model No. :<span>&nbsp;</span></strong>ECONO – 400</p><p>The ECONO-HEAT eHeater™ wall panel heater is constructed from asbestos-free fibre-cement board with element wire laminated between the two boards. A two metre length cable is joined to the element wire in a custom-designed housing in one corner.</p><p>NATURAL CONVECTION TECHNOLOGY Heat is mainly generated behind the heater in the space between the panel and the wall, which leads to an efficient up-draught of heat circulated into the room (the heated air comes out from behind the heater at the speed of 0.7m per second!). This principle of natural convection means that about 90% of the heat in the room comes from the back of the panel, while only 10% is radiated from the front. Convection heating (room heater) is far more effective than radiated heating (space heater).</p><p><u><strong>Features and Benefits :</strong></u><br>Economical – Inexpensive to acquire, inexpensive to run<br>Effective – Only 400 Watts heats a room of approximately 8m2<br>Energy saving – Save up to 50% on your heating costs<br>(save up to 70% when compared to a 1000 Watt heater)<br>Eco-friendly – Contains no harmful chemicals or metals<br>Safer – Non-flammable. Non-combustible<br>Whole room heater as opposed to other space heaters. Uses natural and efficient convection technology to heat a whole room<br>Can be painted to suit the décor of the room<br>Silent, ultra slim and compact design. Out-of-the-way wall mounting design<br>Safer for children and pets – no exposed elements, gas, fans or flames<br>No drying of the air. No oxygen burnt up<br>Works silently during operation<br>Offers warm, silky background heat<br>Quick and easy to install with the new patented<br>Econo-Kit (hard and soft walls)<br>Discreet On/Off switch<br>Leading the new generation of GREEN products in heating appliances<br>International safety standards approved<br>Three year warranty<br>Low thermal conductivity prevents injury if accidentally touched.<br>Safer for children and pets.<br>No exposed element wires, gas or fans.<br>No drying of the air.Digital Thermostat with remote control as optional.</p>', '<p><strong>Warranty:</strong><span>&nbsp;12&nbsp;months</span><br><br><span>1. Warranty : &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>2. Actual product may vary as in picture displayed.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>3. Manufacturer may change the specifications at any time.</span><br></p>', '<p>*Within Kathmandu Valley : NPR 1,000/-<br>Outside Kathmandu Valley : NPR 1,000/-<br>(In major cities only)</p><p>Installation costs does not cover any matrials not in scope of supply.<br>Lifting and placement of goods has to be done by client.</p>', '<p>Coverage Area : Approx. 8 – 12 m2</p><p><strong>Electricals :</strong><br>Power&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 1000 W<br>Volt&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 220V, 1pH<br>Frequency&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 50 Hz</p><p><strong>Physical :</strong><br>Size &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 600 * 1200 * 20 mm<br>Nett Weight&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 4.3 Kgs.</p>', NULL, 'b777e7a8-aa35-4a59-9253-9795231917cf.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-04-29 07:01:31', '2024-10-27 03:29:35', '8200', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 99, 0),
(43, 'lcd-thermostat-with-digital-display-with-remote', 'LCD Thermostat with digital display with remote', 2, 10, 14, NULL, '<p><strong>Model No. :<span>&nbsp;</span></strong>E2000EE</p><p>LCD Thermostat with digital display with remote</p>', NULL, NULL, '<p><span>25A max.</span></p>', NULL, '333dcc7b-3c9f-481d-8d62-ab7039a71a70.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-04-29 07:03:47', '2024-10-27 03:29:35', '6000', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 98, 0),
(44, 'midea-25-l-storage-water-geyser-d25-20fy-white', 'Midea 25 L Storage Water Geyser (D25-20FY, White)', 2, 10, 13, NULL, '<p>Midea 25 L Storage Water Heater is packed with Whirlflow Technology, 9 Minutes Faster Heating, 4 Times Lifespan-Extended Magnesium Rod &amp; Anti-bacterial Material to offer you the best bath experience.</p><ul><li><div>Over Heat Protection</div></li><li><div>Anti- Dry Heating Protection</div></li><li><div>Anti- High-Pressure Protection</div></li><li><div><p>IPX4 Water-proof Body</p></div></li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '<h3>Midea 25L Electric Geyser D25-20FY</h3><ul><li>Capacity: 25L</li><li>Rated Power: 2000 Watts</li><li>Voltage: 230 V</li><li>Frequency: 50 Hz</li><li>Current: 8.69 A</li><li>Thermostat: Yes</li><li>Temperature Range: 30-75 °C (Max : 101 °C)</li><li>Maximum Working Pressure: 8 Bar</li><li>Temperature Indicator: Yes</li><li>Heating Indicator: Yes</li><li>Power Indicator: Yes</li><li>Over Heat Protection: Yes</li><li>Max Temperature: 101</li><li>Power Cable Length: 1 Mtrs</li><li>Type of Mounting: Vertical</li><li>Standard Mount: Hand Mount</li><li>Water Connection Size: 1/2″</li><li>Mount Accessory: Mounting Plate, Bulgy Screw</li></ul>', NULL, '8f80e12f-ad0f-4f87-8979-62d7ddd8f0b6.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-29 07:06:17', '2024-10-27 03:29:35', '16800', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 97, 0),
(45, 'midea-instant-electric-geyser-dsk45q', 'MIDEA INSTANT ELECTRIC GEYSER DSK45Q', 2, 10, 13, NULL, '<h2>MIDEA INSTANT ELECTRIC GEYSER DSK45Q</h2><ul><li>Auto cut off the power if there is leakage on the line and heater</li><li>Cuts off current flow in the event of any current leakage</li><li>Auto-checking of the internal circuit to detect any possible current leakage</li><li>Anti-scald, least corrosion on the element, last longer lifetime</li><li>Shower temperature can be selected according to personal preference</li><li>Strong &amp; durable non-conductive material for further insulation against electric shock</li></ul><h3>Product Specifications: Midea Instant Electric Geyser DSK45Q</h3><ul><li>Colour: White</li><li>Adjustable Pump: No</li><li>Shower set: Multi-spray hand Shower. Rotating Shower Head, 5 patterns</li><li>Voltage: 230 V</li><li>Frequency: 50 Hz</li><li>Rated Power: 0-3300 Watt</li><li>Power Control: “Stepless control from 0-3300W adjustable.”</li><li>Max Outlet Water Temperature,℃: 55°C</li><li>Max Temperature,℃: 95°C</li><li>Heating elements material: Copper</li><li>Rated pressure: 10 Bar</li><li>Water Connection size: 1/2″</li><li>Minimum Flow Rate: 1.2 L/min</li><li>Minimum inlet Pressure: 0.3 Bar</li><li>Maximum inlet Pressure: 3 Bar</li><li>Waterproof class: IP25</li><li>Temperature adjustable: Yes</li><li>Indicator light display: LED</li><li>Precise Thermal Cut-out: Yes</li><li>Anti Dry-heating Protection: Yes</li><li>Built-in Auto low Sensor: Yes</li><li>Japan JST Connector: Yes</li><li>Overheat Protection (Anti-Scalding protection): Yes</li><li>Auto Thermal cut-off: Yes</li><li>Manual reset Thermostat: Yes</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '<div><div><h3>Midea 25L Electric Geyser D25-20FY</h3><ul><li>Capacity: 25L</li><li>Rated Power: 2000 Watts</li><li>Voltage: 230 V</li><li>Frequency: 50 Hz</li><li>Current: 8.69 A</li><li>Thermostat: Yes</li><li>Temperature Range: 30-75 °C (Max : 101 °C)</li><li>Maximum Working Pressure: 8 Bar</li><li>Temperature Indicator: Yes</li><li>Heating Indicator: Yes</li><li>Power Indicator: Yes</li><li>Over Heat Protection: Yes</li><li>Max Temperature: 101</li><li>Power Cable Length: 1 Mtrs</li><li>Type of Mounting: Vertical</li><li>Standard Mount: Hand Mount</li><li>Water Connection Size: 1/2″</li><li>Mount Accessory: Mounting Plate, Bulgy Screw</li></ul></div></div><section><div><div><h2>Related Products</h2></div></div></section>', NULL, 'cfe0a28b-8f10-46fd-9166-9e529efe70bf.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-29 07:08:39', '2024-10-27 03:29:35', '15600', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 96, 0);
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "slug", "title", "user_id", "brand_id", "category_id", "summary", "description", "warranty", "specification", "installation", "download", "image", "seo_title", "seo_description", "seo_keyword", "status", "created_at", "updated_at", "price", "sale_price", "type", "stock", "shops", "daraz_link", "hardware_pasal_link", "mero_pasal_link", "order", "order_status") VALUES
(46, 'air-source-all-in-one-hot-water-heat-pump-150l', 'All-in-One Hot Water Heat Pump – 150L', 2, 6, 37, NULL, '<h3>All-in-One Hot Water Heat Pump – 150L</h3><p>Heat pump water heaters use electricity to move heat from one place to another instead of generating heat directly. Therefore, they can be two to three times more energy efficient than conventional electric resistance water heaters. To move the heat, combo heat pumps work like a refrigerator in reverse.</p><p>Heat pumps offer<span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.energy.gov/energysaver/heat-pump-water-heaters" rel="noopener external noreferrer">economical heating in residential and commercial settings</a>, they can also provide a total solution for domestic heating and hot water supply.</p><div><div><div><div><p>An air-to-water heat pump can provide domestic hot water with quiet operation in -25°C low ambient temperature.</p><p>High efficiency and wide operating range allow proper selections under numerous utilization conditions according to the actual needs. Intelligent control and flexible maintenance bring convenience both to users and service providers.</p></div></div></div></div><h5>Products Description for Combo Heat Pump 150L:</h5><ul><li>R134A refrigerant, environmentally friendly.</li><li>Higher water temperature output up to 75 ℃.</li><li>External condenser coil, safer &amp; more reliable.</li><li>Adopt enamelled inner tank.</li><li>High-pressure protection.</li><li>Defrost automatically.</li><li>With sterilization function.</li><li>Full automatic operation.</li><li>With an auxiliary electric heater.</li><li>Simple style, modern square appearance.</li><li>Large screen, touch button.</li></ul><h3><a href="https://www.energy.gov/energysaver/heat-pump-water-heaters" rel="noopener external noreferrer">How Do They Work?</a></h3>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '75e63ab3-00d6-42ca-ae0a-0800ed8cbfc8.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-29 07:12:01', '2025-10-07 23:32:37', '165000', NULL, 'Hot', '10', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, 0),
(47, 'midea-hot-water-heat-pump-rsj-15-190', 'All-in-One Midea Heat Pump : RSJ-15/190', 2, 3, 37, NULL, '<p><strong>Model No. :<span>&nbsp;</span></strong>RSJ-15/190</p><p>Midea Air-sourced heat pumps absorb heat from the air and transfer it to heat your water. They run on electricity but are roughly three times more efficient than conventional electric water heaters. When used in the right climate conditions they save energy, save money and reduce greenhouse gas emissions.</p><p>Midea hot water heat pump work on the same principle as your refrigerator, but instead of pumping heat out of the fridge to keep it cool, they pump heat into the water. Electricity is used to pump a refrigerant around the system, which picks up heat from the air and transfers it to the water.</p><p><strong>Brand New</strong></p><p>150 Litre – suitable for 1-3 person home (NPR 165,000.00)</p><p><a href="https://www.sigmatechnologies.com.np/product/midea-hot-water-heat-pump-rsj-35-300/">280 Litre – suitable for 3-5 person home (NPR 246,000.00)</a></p><p><strong>Advantages :</strong></p><ul><li>A-rated energy efficiency</li><li>Running ambient temperature -20~43°C</li><li>Water output temperature 38~70°C</li><li>8 key LCD display panel</li><li>Automatic weekly disinfection function</li></ul><p><strong>Remark:</strong></p><ul><li>The test conditions: outdoor temperature 15/12°C(DB/WB), initial water temperature in the units is 15°C, terminal water temperature is 45°C.</li><li>Sound pressure value test conditions: four sides of the unit, distance is 1m, and height is 1m + half of the unit’s height.</li><li>The above data test reference standard EN16147:2011; EN60379:2004; EN12103:2011; (EU)No:812:2013; (EU)No:814:2013.</li><li>The specifications may be changed for product improvement without notice.</li></ul><p><strong>Application :</strong></p><ul><li>Suitable for a house with 3-4 persons.</li><li>For Residential/Restaurants/Kitchen</li></ul>', '<p><strong>Warranty:</strong>&nbsp;12&nbsp;months</p><p>1. Warranty :<br>– Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.<br>– Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.<br>2. Actual product may vary as in picture displayed.<br>3. Manufacturer may change the specifications at any time.</p>', NULL, '<p><strong>Specifications</strong></p><table><tbody><tr><td>Heat Pump Output</td><td>1.5 Kw</td></tr><tr><td>Electrical Heater</td><td>2 Kw</td></tr><tr><td>Heat Pump Input</td><td>0.43 Kw</td></tr><tr><td>Max. Input Current</td><td>2.3 amp</td></tr><tr><td>Electrical</td><td>220 – 240 V, 1pH, 50 Hz</td></tr><tr><td>COP</td><td>3.5</td></tr><tr><td>Water Tank Capacity</td><td>190 Ltrs.</td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;<br></p>', NULL, 'fb63680e-a6bd-48dd-8857-4d882735a206.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-29 07:16:01', '2025-10-07 23:32:19', '200000', '0', 'Hot', '10', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, 0),
(48, 'midea-hot-water-heat-pump-rsj-35-300-300ltrs-electric-water-heater', 'Midea Hot Water Heat Pump - RSJ-35/300 | 300 Ltrs. Electric Water Heater', 2, 3, 37, NULL, '<p><strong>Midea All-in-One Heat Pump Model No. :<span>&nbsp;</span></strong>RSJ-35/300</p><p><strong>RSJ-35/300 with Coil</strong></p><p>Midea Air-sourced heat pumps absorb heat from the air and transfer it to heat your water. They run on electricity but are roughly three times more efficient than conventional electric water heaters. When used in the right climate conditions they save energy, save money and reduce greenhouse gas emissions.</p><p>Midea hot water heat pump works on the same principle as your refrigerator, but instead of pumping heat out of the fridge to keep it cool, they pump heat into the water. Electricity is used to pump a refrigerant around the system, which picks up heat from the air and transfers it to the water.</p><p><strong>Brand New</strong></p><p>280 Litre – suitable for 3-5 person home (NPR 246,000.00)</p><p><strong>Advantages :</strong></p><ul><li>Optional built-in heat exchanger, compatible with solar thermal or boilers.</li><li>25Pa air flow pressure enables ducted length up to 10m.</li><li>A rated energy efficiency. Running ambient temperature -20~43°C.</li><li>Water output temperature 38~60°C.</li><li>9 key LCD display panel.</li><li>Automatic weekly disinfect function.</li></ul><p><strong>Remark:</strong></p><ol><li>The test conditions: outdoor temperature 15/12°C(DB/WB), initial water temperature in the units is 15°C, terminal water temperature is 45°C.</li><li>Sound pressure value test conditions: four sides of the unit, distance is 1m, and height is 1m + half of the unit’s height.</li><li>The above data test reference standard EN16147:2011; EN60379:2004; EN12103:2011; (EU)No:812:2013; (EU)No:814:2013.</li><li>The specifications may be changed for product improvement without notice.</li></ol><p><strong>Application :</strong></p><ul><li>Suitable for a house with 3-5 people.</li><li>Suitable for integrating with thermal solar and making a hybrid system.</li><li>For Restaurants/Kitchen.</li></ul>', '<p><strong>Warranty:</strong><span>&nbsp;12&nbsp;months</span><br><br><span>1. Warranty : &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>2. Actual product may vary as in picture displayed.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>3. Manufacturer may change the specifications at any time.</span><br></p>', '<p><br></p>', '<p><strong>Specifications</strong></p><table><tbody><tr><td>Heat Pump Output</td><td>3 Kw</td></tr><tr><td>Electrical Heater</td><td>3 Kw</td></tr><tr><td>Heat Pump Input</td><td>0.83 Kw</td></tr><tr><td>Max. Input Current</td><td>6.5 amp</td></tr><tr><td>Electrical</td><td>220 – 240 V, 1pH, 50 Hz</td></tr><tr><td>COP</td><td>3.6</td></tr><tr><td>Water Tank Capacity</td><td>300 Ltrs.</td></tr><tr><td>MOC Tank</td><td>Stainless Steel</td></tr><tr><td>Coil MOC</td><td>Stainless Steel</td></tr></tbody></table>', NULL, 'af396650-ac8d-4f98-b26f-48413b5f7ece.webp', 'Midea Hot Water Heat Pump - RSJ-35/300 | 300 Ltrs. Electric Water Heater', 'Discover the Midea Hot Water Heat Pump (RSJ-35/300) with a capacity of 300 liters, perfect for energy-efficient heating. Ideal for homes and businesses, this electric water heater delivers reliable hot water performance while reducing energy costs.', NULL, 1, '2024-04-29 07:18:38', '2025-11-21 00:58:48', '246000', '0', 'Hot', '10', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 0),
(49, 'packaged-hot-water-heat-pump-500l', 'Packaged Hot Water Heat Pump 500L', 2, 6, 37, NULL, '<p><strong>Model No. :</strong><span>&nbsp;INWH54SFSGL5007B</span></p><p>It provides a low-carbon source of hot water in a more compact, quieter, more efficient and easier-to-install unit. For<span>&nbsp;</span><span>Residential or Commercial</span><span>&nbsp;</span>with small to medium hot water demands. The Heating Expert offers a packaged hot water heat pump with a capacity of<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>500 litres</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>rated at<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>7 BAR</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>for high-pressure applications. Combining Environmentally friendly refrigerant R410A is used.</p><p><span>Package</span><span>&nbsp;</span>– Packaged Hot Water Heat Pump comes with 500L Tank &amp; Innmotek’s Heat Pump<span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://sigmatechnologies.com.np/product/split-heat-pump-water-heater-imwh-0054-s">IMWH-0054-S</a>.</p><p><span>Optional</span><span>&nbsp;</span>– The customer can also add PV Solar Water Heater for increasing the efficiency of the heat pump.</p><p>Where space is at a premium, the<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>INWH54SFSGL5007B</strong>&nbsp;comes into its own.</p><p><strong>Features :</strong></p><ul><li>Environmentally friendly refrigerant R410A is used.</li><li>Max. water output temperature: 60°C.</li><li>Automatic startup and shutdown, automatic defrost.</li><li>Close refrigerant circuit, easy for plumber installation.</li><li>Built-in water pump.</li><li>New touch-style key wired controller KJR-51/BMKE-A is used for easy operation.</li><li>Products adopted double-wall heat exchanger is optional.</li></ul><p><strong>Application :</strong></p><ul><li>Suitable for a house with 6-10 people.</li><li>Suitable for Integrating with existing or new thermosiphon thermal solar.</li><li>Suitable for replacing electrical heaters in existing solar water heaters.</li></ul><p>This 500-litre hot water heater for the electric power heat pump is designed to save you up to 50% on your heating costs. This model is ideally suited where you want to run up to 90 litres of water per day at 60°C so there’s no need to buy another unit, just expand your existing heating system!</p><p>Innmotek’s Heat Pump<span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://sigmatechnologies.com.np/product/split-heat-pump-water-heater-imwh-0054-s">IMWH-0054-S</a></p><p>FireSlab''s Hot Water Storage Tank</p>', '<p><strong>Warranty:</strong><span>&nbsp;12&nbsp;months</span><br><br><span>1. Warranty : &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applies from the date of tax invoice. An original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>2. Actual product may vary as in the picture displayed.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>3. Manufacturer may change the specifications at any time.</span><br></p>', '<p><br></p>', '<p><strong>Hot Water Storage Tank Specifications</strong></p><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Technical Specification</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Model</strong></td><td>THEGL5007B</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capacity</strong></td><td>500L</td></tr><tr><td><strong>MOC</strong></td><td>Stainless Steel</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Test Pressure</strong></td><td>10.5 &nbsp;Bar</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Working Pressure</strong></td><td>7 &nbsp;Bar</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Net Weight</strong></td><td>126 Kg</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>733 * 1820 mm</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Water Outlet</strong></td><td>DN20</td>