td><strong>Electricals</strong></td><td>20V, 150Hz</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Expansion Valve</strong></td><td>Electronic</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Air Flow Direction</strong></td><td>Horizontal</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Water Pressure Drop (Kpa)</strong></td><td>45</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ambient Temp</strong></td><td>-15～43 ℃</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Noise (dB)</strong></td><td>52</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Water connection(mm)</strong></td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dimensions</strong></td><td>986mm * 420mm * 798mm</td></tr></tbody></table>', NULL, 'ce874680-5f98-40c6-8841-0c335e55aa5f.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-29 07:27:32', '2025-10-07 23:34:09', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 7, 0),
(52, 'swimming-pool-heat-pump-the-021-sp', 'Swimming Pool Heat Pumps – THE-021-SP', 2, 6, 44, NULL, '<p><strong>Swimming Pool Heat Pumps – DC Inverter</strong></p><p>Heat Pumps are high-performance, energy-efficient pool heaters that quietly and economically maintain your ideal water temperature.</p><p>Don’t let cool water temperatures limit your swimming enjoyment. Our heat pumps allow you to swim comfortably throughout your swim season – all while consuming less energy than gas heaters to lower your operating costs by up to 70%.</p><p>Dependable swimming pool temperature control is a crucial feature of enjoyable swimming. For a swim to be refreshing and invigorating the pool water must be the right temperature for the swimmer, regardless of the influence of seasonal weather.</p><p><strong>Winter heating</strong></p><p>During winter, swimming pools continually evaporate water and radiate heat. The combination of these factors causes heat loss which must be replaced through a heater if comfortable water temperatures are to be maintained.</p><p><strong>Summer cooling</strong></p><p>During summer, swimming pools are subjected to massive solar gain. Coupled with high ambient humidity which prevents pools from cooling through evaporation, swimming pool water can become uncomfortably hot unless dynamically cooled. Pool coolers based on the heat pump technology principle can help.</p><p>A&nbsp;<strong>swimming pool heat pump</strong>&nbsp;can quickly become an ace-up-the-sleeve for pool operators today.</p><p>By lowering energy consumption and, consequently, providing<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>economic and environmental savings</strong>, opting for a swimming pool heat pump is a wise investment that also helps pool operators comply with current regulations and standards.</p><p><strong>Features:</strong></p><ol><li>R32 refrigerant, environmentally friendly.</li><li>Titanium heat exchanger, corrosion resistance.</li><li>High-pressure protection function.</li><li>Defrost automatically, intelligent and fast.</li><li>With water flow switch.</li><li>With DC INVERTER.</li></ol><p><a href="https://www.fluidra.com/projects/how-to-reduce-swimming-pool-running-costs/" rel="noopener external noreferrer"><strong>How to reduce swimming pool running costs?</strong></a></p><p><a href="https://www.fluidra.com/projects/pool-cooling-and-heating-systems/" rel="noopener external noreferrer"><strong>Water pool temperature: Why is it important?</strong></a></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '5faacacf-6b70-4da9-abe0-30701c9db151.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-29 07:29:19', '2024-12-13 10:25:27', '246300', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 8, 0),
(56, 'wood-fired-fireplace-craftsbury', 'Wood Fired Fireplace (CRAFTSBURY)', 2, 6, 34, NULL, '<p>Simple and elegant, the new Craftsbury wood-burning stove from Hergom is perfectly suited to both classic and contemporary interiors. Its sleek lines and curved legs are paired with a robust cast iron body, which features an attractive textured pattern on the side panels, making the Craftsbury a design feature in its own right. EcoDesign Ready, this stove is the perfect heating source for country, city, and suburban homes, from cottages to apartments, townhouses to period properties.</p><p>The new Hergom Craftsbury is a great option for those who want an easy installation with plenty of sustainable benefits. It comes equipped with an external air inlet suitable for direct air connection as well as an advanced secondary air combustion system for more heat with less wood, resulting in higher efficiency and less smoke. There’s even a large, removable ash pan for quick and convenient ash removal without fuss.</p><h2>Craftsbury features</h2><ul><li>Made from Cast Iron</li><li>Cast White Internals</li><li>Top or Rear Flue Connection</li><li>Optional Direct Air</li><li>Air wash system</li><li>Ecodesign</li><li>Defra Approved</li><li>Suitable for 12mm hearth</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'e7b888d2-4027-41f0-9c46-eb62783a5488.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-04-29 07:37:15', '2026-03-22 00:54:23', '317995', NULL, 'Hot', '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24, 0),
(57, 'wood-fired-fireplace-e30-l', 'Wood Fired Fireplace (E30-L)', 2, 6, 34, NULL, '<p>The Hergom E30 Large Stove is an efficient and stylish wood burning stove designed to provide exceptional heat output and a beautiful focal point in any room. Made in Spain with high-quality materials, this stove features a sleek and modern design that will complement any home decor.</p><p>With its large size and powerful heating capabilities, the Hergom E30 is perfect for heating larger spaces up to 2,500 square feet. The stove has a heat output range of 12,000 to 45,000 BTUs per hour, allowing you to adjust the heat output to your desired level of warmth and comfort. The large firebox is capable of accommodating logs up to 24 inches long, which means less time spent on cutting and preparing wood.</p><p>The Hergom E30 is designed for ease of use and maintenance. It features a simple, yet effective air control system that allows you to easily adjust the flame and heat output. The stove is also equipped with a removable ash pan and an air wash system that helps to keep the glass clean, allowing you to enjoy the view of the flames without the need for constant cleaning.</p><p>In addition to its impressive heating capabilities, the Hergom E30 is also a stunning addition to any home. The stove is crafted from high-quality cast iron, which not only provides durability and longevity but also gives it a classic, timeless look that will never go out of style. The stove is available in a range of finishes, including black, brown, and ivory, allowing you to choose the perfect colour to match your home’s decor.</p><p>Overall, the Hergom E30 Large Stove is a powerful and stylish wood-burning stove that is sure to provide warmth, comfort, and beauty to your home for many years to come.</p><h4>Features</h4><ul><li>Dedicated Woodburner</li><li>2022 Ecodesign ready</li><li>Suitable for 12mm non-combustible hearth</li><li>Airwash system</li><li>Direct air kit option</li><li>Cast iron internal – white</li><li>Black stove body</li><li>11kw nominal</li><li>6.5-13.3kw range</li><li>The top outlet only&nbsp; – 200mm dia</li><li>600mm log</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'a557e091-a3d2-4fd7-ac2c-63c765c098de.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-29 07:39:21', '2026-03-22 00:54:50', '413480', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 25, 0),
(58, 'wood-fired-fireplace-im-wfs-5510448', 'Wood Fired Fireplace (IM-WFS-5510448)', 2, 6, 34, NULL, '<p><strong>Model: IM-WFS-5510448 (Wood Fired Fireplace)</strong></p><p>Introducing our Wood Fired Fireplace, the perfect addition to your home in Nepal! Crafted from high-quality materials, this fireplace is designed to provide warmth and comfort while also adding a touch of rustic charm to your living space.</p><p>With its rustic and traditional design, the Wood Fired Fireplace Nepal adds a touch of elegance and sophistication to any living space. It is perfect for cosying up on cold nights and enjoying the natural warmth of a wood-burning fire. NB-WS2 fireplace is designed with sturdy construction, ensuring that it is safe and secure to use.</p><p>This wood-fired fireplace is perfect for those who are looking for an eco-friendly heating solution. By using wood as a fuel source, the fireplace is a sustainable alternative to electric or gas heating. Wood Fired Fireplace is also easy to maintain and clean, which makes it a convenient option for busy homeowners.</p><p>Installation is a breeze, with clear instructions and all necessary hardware included. Plus, the size of the fireplace means it can be installed in almost any room, making it a versatile choice for homes of all sizes.</p><p>Whether you are looking to add warmth to your home or create a cosy ambience, the Wood Fired Fireplace in Nepal is the perfect solution. It is a beautiful and functional addition to any living space, and it is sure to be a conversation starter with guests.</p><p>So why settle for a basic heating solution when you can have the warmth, comfort, and style of our Wood Fired Fireplace? Invest in your home and your comfort today with this stunning addition to your living space.</p><h4><strong>Features</strong></h4><ul><li>True fire, multifuel</li><li>CE approved</li><li>Factory direct and low price</li><li>Special high-temperature glass fireplace door, closed combustion</li><li>Clear glass with window air wash</li><li>Cast iron quality and fireproof line</li><li>Classic and contemporary combined styling</li><li>Built-in ash cleaning-box</li></ul><p>Check out our bigger size:<span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.sigmatechnologies.com.np/product/wood-fired-fireplace-helix-nepal/">Wood Fired Fireplace (Helix)</a></p>', '<p><strong>Warranty:</strong><span>&nbsp;12 months</span><br><br><span>1. Warranty : &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applies from the date of the tax invoice. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty is applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>2. Actual product may vary as in the picture displayed.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>3. Manufacturer may change the specifications at any time.</span><br></p>', '<p><br></p>', '<p>Rating Power: 8kW</p><p>Eficiency: 82%</p><p>Dimension(WxHxD in mm): 550 x 1042 x 401</p><p>Net Weight: 110 kg</p><p>Gross Weight: 130 kg</p><p>Heat Area: 60 – 90 m²</p><p>Fuel: Wood</p>', NULL, '5a2fb730-63f6-43da-a6d1-7816c087c8c6.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-29 07:43:25', '2024-12-13 10:25:27', '122040', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 20, 0),
(59, 'wood-fired-fireplace-helix-nepal', 'Wood Fired Fireplace (HELIX)', 2, 6, 34, NULL, '<p>Introducing the Helix Wood Fired Fireplace, an exquisitely crafted piece of Nordic-inspired design that will bring warmth and style to your home. This fireplace is made using the finest quality materials and traditional techniques.</p><p>The Helix Wood Fired Fireplace is the perfect addition to any living space, whether you are looking to create a cosy atmosphere in your living room or want to add a touch of rustic charm to your outdoor patio. With its sleek and modern design, this fireplace will complement any decor and become a focal point in your home.</p><p>But this isn’t just any fireplace – the Helix Wood Fired Fireplace is built to last, and is designed to burn wood efficiently and cleanly, reducing your environmental footprint. With its innovative helix-shaped chimney, this fireplace provides maximum heat output and helps to circulate warm air throughout the room.</p><p>So if you’re looking for a high-quality, eco-friendly fireplace that combines style and functionality, look no further than the Helix Fireplace. Order yours today and experience the warmth and beauty of this stunning piece for yourself!</p><p><strong>Features</strong></p><ul><li>Large, high-quality, Japanese-made viewing glass</li><li>Clean, contemporary design with hidden controls and handles</li><li>3.5mm Steel Firebox Construction w/robotic seam welding</li><li>Vermiculite firebox liners maximise burn efficiency</li><li>Handy, built-in wood storage pedestal</li><li>Tested and approved to AS/NZS 4012/4013&nbsp;and 2918 safety standards</li></ul><p>Check out our smaller size:<span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.sigmatechnologies.com.np/product/wood-fired-fireplace-nb-ws2/">Wood Fired Fireplace (NB-WS2)</a></p>', '<p><strong>Warranty:</strong><span>&nbsp;12 months</span><br><br><span>1. Warranty : &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applies from the date of the tax invoice. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty is applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>2. Actual product may vary as in the picture displayed.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>3. Manufacturer may change the specifications at any time.</span><br></p>', '<p><br></p>', '<p>Rating Power: 8 kW</p><p>Efficiency: 70%</p><p>Dimension: 608 x 443 x 1185 mm</p><p>Net Weight: 120 kg</p><p>Gross Weight: 140 kg</p><p>Heat Area: Approx 1500 Sq. Ft</p><p>Fuel: Wood</p><br>', NULL, 'c0ddf90a-641c-4fbc-8517-2b155e4ff86d.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-29 07:53:52', '2025-12-11 05:06:53', '212440', NULL, 'Hot', '10', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 23, 0),
(60, 'bend-90-degree-acc-03', 'Bend 90 Degree – ACC – 03', 2, 6, 18, NULL, '<p><strong>Model No. :&nbsp;</strong>ACC-03</p><p>Bend 90 oC – 150 mm dia, carbon steel, thickness 0.6 mm.</p>', '<p><strong>Warranty:</strong><span>&nbsp;12 months</span><br><br><span>1. Warranty : &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>2. Actual product may vary as in picture displayed.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>3. Manufacturer may change the specifications at any time.</span><br></p>', NULL, '<p><span>90 Degree</span></p>', NULL, 'a8ae2e4c-8bbe-42cc-a4dd-9b5153d8f929.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-29 07:56:21', '2024-10-27 03:29:35', '5040', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 95, 0),
(61, 'bend-45-degree-acc-02', 'Bend 45 Degree – ACC – 02', 2, 6, 18, NULL, '<p><strong>Model No. :&nbsp;</strong>ACC-02</p><p>Bend 45 oC – 150 mm dia, carbon steel, thickness 0.6 mm.</p>', '<p><strong>Warranty:</strong><span>&nbsp;12 months</span><br><br><span>1. Warranty : &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>2. Actual product may vary as in picture displayed.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>3. Manufacturer may change the specifications at any time.</span><br></p>', NULL, '<p><span>45 Degree</span></p>', NULL, '1b791820-31c7-459a-a46c-31187570a8cb.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-29 07:59:01', '2024-10-27 03:29:35', '3675', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 94, 0),
(62, 'chimney-carbon-steel-pipe-acc-01', 'Chimney Carbon Steel Pipe – ACC – 01', 2, 6, 34, NULL, '<p><strong>Model No. :&nbsp;</strong>ACC-01</p><p>Chimney – 150 mm dia, carbon steel pipe, thickness 0.6 mm.</p>', '<p><strong>Warranty:</strong><span>&nbsp;12 months</span><br><br><span>1. Warranty : &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>2. Actual product may vary as in picture displayed.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>3. Manufacturer may change the specifications at any time.</span><br></p>', NULL, '<p><span>Size: 1 Mtr.</span></p>', NULL, 'ee0c7a58-444b-4ad8-8a19-1dcc46c5e832.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-29 08:00:46', '2025-10-12 06:04:22', '7680', NULL, NULL, '10', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 93, 0),
(63, 'ranger-with-stand', 'Solostove Ranger with Stand', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>Solo stove</strong></p><p><strong>Ranger and Stand</strong></p><p>The most compact fire pit in the Solo Stove collection. The Ranger is perfect for smaller spaces, city dwellers, and for those who live life on the go! The Ranger sets up and starts quickly allowing you to have a no-trace fire in more places than just the backyard. The double-wall design creates a burst of hot air over the fire reducing the smoke without the use of batteries and fans.</p><p>The Ranger is fueled by chunk wood or small logs and offers all the benefits of a wood-burning fire without the smoke or the campfire smell sticking to your clothes. It also comes with a durable carry case with handles for easy transport!</p><p>The Ranger is 15” in diameter, 12.5” tall, and weighs 15 lbs. The Ranger Stand is also included.</p><p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul><li>Portable</li><li>Chunk Wood</li><li>Low Smoke</li><li>Durable</li><li>Stainless Steel</li></ul>', '<p><strong>Warranty :</strong></p><ul><li>Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.</li><li>Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.</li></ul>', NULL, '<p><strong>Product Specs:</strong></p><ul><li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li><li>Fuel: Logs up to 12 inches long</li><li>Diameter: 15 inches</li><li>Height: 12.5 inches</li><li>Weight: 6.8 kg</li></ul>', NULL, '6bb5f890-dd87-4df2-a252-9ff54cc9c55e.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-29 08:29:04', '2025-07-14 03:21:12', '63998', NULL, 'Hot', '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39, 0),
(64, 'bonfire-with-stand', 'Solostove Bonfire with Stand', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>Solostove</strong></p><p><strong>Bonfire and Stand</strong></p><p>Enjoy the roaring, smokeless flame in Bonfire together with Stand, our most recommended fire pit accessory. Our Signature 360° Airflow Design™ creates a super efficient secondary burn that’s not only mesmerizing to watch, but a joy to sit around and make memories.Ready to enjoy the mesmerizing, smokeless flame in Bonfire but worried about leaving scorch marks on your deck, stained concrete, or grass? Stand is our most recommended accessory for Bonfire. Just place Stand where you want it, set Bonfire on top, and start building your fire! Stand is made with durable 304 stainless steel with rolled edges to keep surfaces protected from scratch marks.</p><p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul><li>Portable</li><li>Log Friendly</li><li>Low Smoke</li><li>Durable</li><li>Stainless Steel</li></ul>', '<p><strong>Warranty :</strong></p><ul><li>Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.</li><li>Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.</li></ul>', NULL, '<p><strong>Product Specs:</strong></p><ul><li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li><li>Fuel: Logs up to 16 inches long</li><li>Diameter: 19.5 inches</li><li>Height: 14 inches</li><li>Weight:&nbsp; 9.07 kg</li></ul>', NULL, 'b2d4e4e9-a43b-48a6-a9cc-6037ed369c48.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-29 08:30:17', '2025-07-14 03:21:30', '83998', NULL, 'Hot', '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40, 0),
(65, 'solostove-yukon', 'Solostove Yukon with Stand', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>Solostove</strong></p><p><strong>Yukon</strong></p><p>Yukon is the ultimate backyard fire pit to fire up your backyard celebrations with the biggest, baddest flame out there.Enjoy Our Signature 360° Airflow Design™ in an extra-large size, creating a mesmerizing secondary burn. That means there’s way less smoke compared to other fire pits. The best part? Nearly everything burns to a fine ash, making Yukon easy to clean.</p><p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul><li>Log Friendly</li><li>Low Smoke</li><li>Durable</li><li>Stainless Steel</li></ul>', '<p><strong>Warranty :</strong></p><ul><li>Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.</li><li>Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.</li></ul>', NULL, '<p><strong>Product Specs:</strong></p><ul><li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li><li>Fuel: Logs up to 22 inches long</li><li>Diameter: 27 inches</li><li>Height: 17 inches</li><li>Weight:&nbsp; 17.23 kg</li></ul>', NULL, 'a6857de3-602d-4e4a-b4e7-503034a06241.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-29 08:32:17', '2025-07-14 03:21:52', '119998', NULL, 'Hot', '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 41, 0),
(66, 'solostove-pi-fire-ranger', 'Solostove Pi Fire Ranger', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p>Model:<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>PIFIRE-RAN (Wood Fired Pizza)</strong></p><p>Bring pizza-making to your nights around the fire with our favorite fire pit topping! Pi Fire combines the best of our Solo Stove Nepal products to bring pizza cooking to your smokeless fire pit.</p><p><strong>Pi Fire is a part of the Pi Fire Pit System and must be used with your Solo Stove fire pit for a safe and complete experience.</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Enhanced Versatility</strong><br>Pi Fire is designed to elevate the fire pit experience. Or, in this case, elevate above the fire pit. Sit around the fire while enjoying s’mores and artisan quality pizza.</li><li><strong>Made to Move</strong><br>From the backyard to the backwoods enjoy wood-fired artisan pizza anywhere your fire pit can go. With built-in handles for easy portability, an included carry case, and a simple setup, Pi Fire is ready for the adventure.</li><li><strong>Make the Outdoors, Yours</strong><br>Pi Fire is compatible with our family of Solo Stove fire pits and with most of our expanding range of accessories, bringing a whole new level of customization to your outdoor cooking experience.</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '3692b3ed-987a-48a2-95db-db35438bb9e2.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-29 08:33:30', '2025-10-07 03:41:29', '39800', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 49, 0),
(67, 'solostove-pi-fire-bonfire', 'Solostove Pi Fire Bonfire', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p>Model:<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>PIFIRE-BON (Wood Fired Pizza)</strong></p><p>Bring pizza-making to your nights around the fire with our favorite fire pit topping! Pi Fire combines the best of our Solo Stove Nepal products to bring pizza cooking to your smokeless fire pit.</p><p><strong>Pi Fire is a part of the Pi Fire Pit System and must be used with your Solo Stove fire pit for a safe and complete experience.</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Enhanced Versatility</strong><br>Pi Fire is designed to elevate the fire pit experience. Or, in this case, elevate above the fire pit. Sit around the fire while enjoying s’mores and artisan quality pizza.</li><li><strong>Made to Move</strong><br>From the backyard to the backwoods enjoy wood-fired artisan pizza anywhere your fire pit can go. With built-in handles for easy portability, an included carry case, and a simple setup, Pi Fire is ready for the adventure.</li><li><strong>Make the Outdoors, Yours</strong><br>Pi Fire is compatible with our family of Solo Stove fire pits and with most of our expanding range of accessories, bringing a whole new level of customization to your outdoor cooking experience.</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '7fdb972c-308a-4d3f-818a-762ab4a4528d.webp', 'Solo Stove Pi Fire Bonfire: Ultimate Outdoor Cooking & Heating | Sigma Technologies', 'Discover the Solo Stove Pi Fire Bonfire, designed for efficient outdoor cooking and warmth. This innovative fire pit enhances any gathering with its unique design and exceptional performance. Perfect for camping, backyard parties, or cozy evenings, the Pi Fire Bonfire brings friends and family together. Available now at Sigma Technologies in Nepal.', NULL, 1, '2024-04-29 08:34:40', '2024-12-13 10:40:14', '51998', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 50, 0),
(68, 'solostove-pi-fire-yukon', 'Solostove Pi Fire Yukon', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p>Model:<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>PIFIRE-YUK-27 (Wood Fired Pizza)</strong></p><p>Bring pizza-making to your nights around the fire with our favorite fire pit topping! Pi Fire combines the best of our Solo Stove Nepal products to bring pizza cooking to your smokeless fire pit.</p><p><strong>Pi Fire is a part of the Pi Fire Pit System and must be used with your Solo Stove fire pit for a safe and complete experience.</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Enhanced Versatility</strong><br>Pi Fire is designed to elevate the fire pit experience. Or, in this case, elevate above the fire pit. Sit around the fire while enjoying s’mores and artisan quality pizza.</li><li><strong>Made to Move</strong><br>From the backyard to the backwoods enjoy wood-fired artisan pizza anywhere your fire pit can go. With built-in handles for easy portability, an included carry case, and a simple setup, Pi Fire is ready for the adventure.</li><li><strong>Make the Outdoors, Yours</strong><br>Pi Fire is compatible with our family of Solo Stove fire pits and with most of our expanding range of accessories, bringing a whole new level of customization to your outdoor cooking experience.</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '44024a74-6a94-4129-97a7-0f400bb67b4f.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-29 08:39:26', '2024-12-13 10:40:14', '69998', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 51, 0);
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "slug", "title", "user_id", "brand_id", "category_id", "summary", "description", "warranty", "specification", "installation", "download", "image", "seo_title", "seo_description", "seo_keyword", "status", "created_at", "updated_at", "price", "sale_price", "type", "stock", "shops", "daraz_link", "hardware_pasal_link", "mero_pasal_link", "order", "order_status") VALUES
(69, 'ranger-cast-iron-grill-cooking-bundle', 'Ranger Cast Iron Grill Top + Hub', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p>Open-fire grilling on the go. Ranger enters grilling mode, while the Cast Iron Grill has wide grates and even heating for perfectly seared steaks and veggies.</p><pre style="background-color: rgb(240, 240, 240); text-align: left; padding: 10px;"><br></pre><p><strong>Enjoy the Ranger Cast Iron Grill with Hub.</strong></p><div>What’s Included</div><div><div><div><div><img src="https://media.solostove.com/transform/a54dd46d-93e5-462f-bd94-c611123ed186/RANGER-CAST-IRON-GRILL?io=transform:fill,width:96,height:96"><p><br></p><p><strong>Ranger Cast Iron Grill</strong></p><div><p>For the perfect sear</p></div></div><div><img src="https://media.solostove.com/transform/1732abfb-8fd8-4efe-bc0c-98b79d09db3f/RANGER-HUB?io=transform:fill,width:96,height:96"><p><br></p><p><strong>Ranger Hub</strong></p><div><p>Elevates your cooking surface</p></div></div></div></div></div><p>&nbsp;<br></p><p><strong>Adaptive</strong><br>The Cast Iron Grill’s wide grates and broad cooking surface can please and feed any crowd. Complement any recipe with the wood-fired flavours of oak, hickory, maple, and more.</p><p><strong>Easy To Use</strong><br>Novice chefs can achieve mastery of open-fire cooking in no time with the Cast Iron Grill’s natural counter to intense heat. It heats up gradually and evenly, then transfers heat steadily to maintain perfect cooking temperatures with a single layer of burning embers.</p><p><strong>Long Lasting</strong><br>The longevity of cast iron is legendary and owed to its ability to season. Non-stick and polymerized, a seasoned Cast Iron Grill is easy to clean for life-long use. Cast Iron Grill wears in without wearing out, creating limitless opportunities to light up for years to come.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '6a97e3ee-d7b4-4f8a-88d4-21fe12c98758.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-29 08:40:58', '2025-07-14 03:26:41', '45998', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 58, 0),
(71, 'mask-burning-machine', 'Mask Burning Machine (Pride)', 2, 8, 10, NULL, '<p>Model: Pride<br><br>Mask Burning Machine is the ultimate solution to discard the used masks in a hygiene way. Improper disposal of masks can create risks to public health and hazards to the environment. Good hygiene practices is to dispose the used masks safely by using our Mask Burning Machine. We are actually proud to say that we are the pioneer who developed Napkin Burning machine for disposing napkins and Napkin Vending machine.<br><br>Throwing the masks anywhere is a big threat to our environment. Nowadays, huge numbers of the masks are not disposed of properly and have instead ended up dumped in the city outside or the sea. The masks are made of polypropylene, it’s a type of plastic and are not going to break down quickly. This exposes the viral borne wastes to the environment, animals and public at large causing diseases.<br><br>Solve the problem of used masks disposal by installing burning machine which shall reduce spread of infection due to unhygienic disposal of masks. Incinerating these masks is the only way to get rid of these problems.<br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'd8d8d77c-eb26-48a8-95f9-97346481495e.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-30 01:12:09', '2024-12-13 10:31:26', '124800', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 91, 0),
(72, 'mask-burning-machine-elite', 'Mask Burning Machine (Elite)', 2, 8, 10, NULL, '<p>Model: Elite<br><br>Mask Burning Machine is the ultimate solution to discard the used masks in a hygiene way. Improper disposal of masks can create risks to public health and hazards to the environment. Good hygiene practices is to dispose the used masks safely by using our Mask Burning Machine. We are actually proud to say that we are the pioneer who developed Napkin Burning machine for disposing napkins and Napkin Vending machine.<br><br>Throwing the masks anywhere is a big threat to our environment. Nowadays, huge numbers of the masks are not disposed of properly and have instead ended up dumped in the city outside or the sea. The masks are made of polypropylene, it’s a type of plastic and are not going to break down quickly. This exposes the viral borne wastes to the environment, animals and public at large causing diseases.<br><br>Solve the problem of used masks disposal by installing burning machine which shall reduce spread of infection due to unhygienic disposal of masks. Incinerating these masks is the only way to get rid of these problems.<br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '9e186b5e-2be6-49fb-a5b7-c91c5417ddac.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-30 01:13:48', '2024-12-13 10:31:26', '52000', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 90, 0),
(74, 'room-air-purifier-r500', 'Room Air Purifier(R500)', 2, 8, 10, NULL, '<p>Indoor air quality is 10 to 100 times more contaminated than outdoor air. Like the food we eat, the water we drink, the air we breath has a higher impact on our health. Sterilizing/disinfecting the indoor air becomes inevitable nowadays due to challenging airborne viruses threat and microbial load present in the air.<br><br>Room Air Purifier, an innovative creation of Faraday Ozone which doses activated oxygen on periodic intervals to maintain good air quality throughout the day and eliminates any kind of bacteria, virus including corona, germs, airborne pathogens and other contaminants present in the air through activated oxygen. It breaks the shell walls of the viruses and makes it ineffective through ozone disinfection technology.<br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'f523c790-9f3d-4ace-ab96-1702fb0a7af4.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-30 01:18:50', '2025-07-14 01:46:47', '86000', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 88, 0),
(75, 'car-air-disinfection-system-instaclean-100', 'Car Air Disinfection System (Instaclean-100)', 2, 8, 10, NULL, '<p>Model- Instaclean 100<br><br>Most of the people invest plenty of time in their car for long commute each day. Regular usage of car, filled with many unseen bacteria, viruses, odour and other contaminants which become more intense if you don’t clean it right away. Faraday features Car Air Disinfection System, which removes all these pollutants from the car and makes your journey better with fresh air.<br><br>High voltage electric energy applied to split the Oxygen molecule. The resulting Oxygen atom seeking ability to attact with other Oxygen molecules which form the Ozone gas. Ozone also called as trioxygen, contains three Oxygen atoms, which is safe and environmentally friendly. Ozone gas kills bacteria, viruses, odours, and other contaminants in the air and disappers rapidy.<br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '71a25873-53e7-42c5-b150-53b56e474cb4.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-04-30 01:21:04', '2024-12-13 10:31:26', '85500', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 87, 0),
(76, 'car-air-disinfection-system', 'Car Air Disinfection System (Instaclean-50)', 2, 8, 10, NULL, '<p>Model- Instaclean 50<br><br>Most of the people invest plenty of time in their car for long commute each day. Regular usage of car, filled with many unseen bacteria, viruses, odour and other contaminants which become more intense if you don’t clean it right away. Faraday features Car Air Disinfection System, which removes all these pollutants from the car and makes your journey better with fresh air.<br><br>High voltage electric energy applied to split the Oxygen molecule. The resulting Oxygen atom seeking ability to attact with other Oxygen molecules which form the Ozone gas. Ozone also called as trioxygen, contains three Oxygen atoms, which is safe and environmentally friendly. Ozone gas kills bacteria, viruses, odours, and other contaminants in the air and disappers rapidy.<br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '275607bb-e228-4a2b-8c77-1d4452a14093.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-30 01:22:45', '2024-12-13 10:31:26', '54800', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 86, 0),
(77, 'veg-and-meat-detoxifier', 'Veg and Meat Detoxifier', 2, 8, 10, NULL, '<p>When you taste a fruit, When you cut vegetables, When you cook a good fish or meat recipe, You wonder how safe all of it is. The biggest invaders at your home are often invisible. Soap and handwash can eliminate bacteria, viruses and toxins. But how do you make vegetables, fruits, fish and meat?<br><br>Presenting Faraday ozodip. A patented ozone-based food detoxifier that cleans and detoxifies the surface of vegetables, fruits, fish and meat quickly.<br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'd2d65734-cb6c-4f63-883e-3d589601d7f2.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-30 01:24:15', '2025-07-14 01:44:24', '12500', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 85, 0),
(82, 'heat-detector-4', 'Heat Detector', 2, 7, 21, NULL, '<p>SHIELD Heat Detector is distinguishable by the low airflow resistant case and uses a single thermistor to sense the air temperature around the detector.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'd231bcdb-12ec-4256-b9a0-326ca761a894.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-04-30 01:55:13', '2024-12-13 10:31:26', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 84, 0),
(85, 'heat-detector-3', 'Heat Detector', 2, 13, 21, NULL, '<p>SHIELD Heat Detector is distinguishable by the low airflow resistant case and uses a single thermistor to sense the air temperature around the detector<br><br>Ideal for environments that are dirty or smoky under normal conditions<br>Well suited for warehouses, loading docks and parking garages<br>Unaffected by wind or atmospheric pressure<br>Remote test feature<br></p>', NULL, NULL, '<table><tbody><tr><th>Detector Type</th><td>Heat</td></tr><tr><th>Working Voltage</th><td>17 – 28 V DC</td></tr><tr><th>Modulation Voltage</th><td>5 – 9 V (peak to peak)</td></tr><tr><th>Maximum Alarm Current LED on</th><td>2.5 mA</td></tr><tr><th>Surge Current</th><td>1.0 mA</td></tr><tr><th>Supervisory Current</th><td>250 μA</td></tr><tr><th>Heat Element Rating</th><td>55°C (SEN-A4013), 90°C (SEN-A4014)</td></tr><tr><th>Test Method</th><td>Hair dryer</td></tr><tr><th>Storage Temperature Range</th><td>-30°C to +80°C</td></tr><tr><th>Operating Temperature Range</th><td>-20°C to +60°C</td></tr><tr><th>Dimensions (diameter x height)</th><td>100 mm x 42 mm</td></tr><tr><th>Weight</th><td>105 g</td></tr></tbody></table>', NULL, 'f5220231-97e8-4d1f-9ede-95807e9032cc.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-04-30 02:11:58', '2024-12-13 10:31:26', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 83, 0),
(93, 'bonfire-cast-iron-grill-cooking-bundle', 'Bonfire Cast Iron Grill Top + Hub', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p>Open fire grilling, in the backyard and beyond. Bonfire enters grilling mode while Cast Iron Grill has wide grates and even heating for perfectly seared steaks and veggies.</p><p><strong>Enjoy the Bonfire Cast Iron Grill with Hub.</strong></p><div>What’s Included</div><div><div><div><div><p><img src="https://media.solostove.com/transform/a54dd46d-93e5-462f-bd94-c611123ed186/RANGER-CAST-IRON-GRILL?io=transform:fill,width:96,height:96"></p><p><strong>Bonfire Cast Iron Grill</strong></p><div><p>For the perfect sear</p></div></div><div><p><img src="https://media.solostove.com/transform/1732abfb-8fd8-4efe-bc0c-98b79d09db3f/RANGER-HUB?io=transform:fill,width:96,height:96"></p><p><strong>Bonfire Hub</strong></p><div><p>Elevates your cooking surface</p></div></div></div></div></div><p>&nbsp;<br></p><p><strong>Adaptive</strong><br>The Cast Iron Grill’s wide grates and broad cooking surface can please and feed any crowd. Complement any recipe with the wood-fired flavours of oak, hickory, maple, and more.</p><p><strong>Easy To Use</strong><br>Novice chefs can achieve mastery of open-fire cooking in no time with the Cast Iron Grill’s natural counter to intense heat. It heats up gradually and evenly, then transfers heat steadily to maintain perfect cooking temperatures with a single layer of burning embers.</p><p><strong>Long Lasting</strong><br>The longevity of cast iron is legendary and owed to its ability to season. Non-stick and polymerized, a seasoned Cast Iron Grill is easy to clean for life-long use. Cast Iron Grill wears in without wearing out, creating limitless opportunities to light up for years to come.</p><p>&nbsp;<br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1bcbbabb-fbfb-45f3-ba8d-24d49990da61.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-30 03:50:15', '2025-07-14 03:28:13', '64998', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 59, 0),
