. Cast Iron Griddle completes the nesting Ranger Cooking System made to store well and go anywhere.</p><p><strong>Yukon Cooking System</strong><br>Cast Iron Griddle and Hub are part of a well-oiled machine made for creating good moments. Trailside suppers and flame-to-table feasts are possible with Yukon and accessories for a complete experience</p></div></div><section><h2><br></h2></section>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'cde6faba-1dae-4d2f-bb0f-c731b6791e51.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-30 03:57:00', '2025-07-14 03:29:35', '79998', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 57, 0),
(98, 'ranger-cast-iron-wok-top-hub', 'Ranger Cast Iron Wok Top + Hub', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p>Open-fire cooking on the go. Custom-moulded for the Ranger Cooking System, the Cast Iron Wok invigorates your wood-fired eats with a fusion of authentic methods and modern aesthetics.</p><p><strong>Enjoy the complete Ranger Cooking System with Wok.</strong></p><div>What’s Included</div><div><div><div><div><img src="https://media.solostove.com/transform/d1121160-a227-4960-bef2-9df235259368/RANG-WOK?io=transform:fill,width:96,height:96"><p><br></p><p><strong>Ranger Cast Iron Wok</strong></p><div><p>For saucy stir-frys</p></div></div><div><img src="https://media.solostove.com/transform/1732abfb-8fd8-4efe-bc0c-98b79d09db3f/RANGER-HUB?io=transform:fill,width:96,height:96"><p><br></p><p><strong>Ranger Hub</strong></p><div><p>Elevates your cooking surface</p></div></div></div></div></div><p>&nbsp;<br></p><p><strong>Adaptive</strong><br>Cast Iron Wok has an incredible range of abilities thanks to its broad, gently sloped design. Simplify your camp kitchen and take on recipes that call for a sauteé, sear, simmer, and more.</p><p><strong>Easy To Use</strong><br>Novice chefs can achieve mastery of open-fire cooking in no time with Cast Iron Wok’s natural counter to intense heat. It heats up gradually and evenly but makes a swift transition to deliver high, steady heat to maintain perfect cooking temperatures for saucy stir-fry.</p><p><strong>Long Lasting</strong><br>The longevity of cast iron is legendary and owed to its ability to season. Non-stick and polymerized, a seasoned Cast Iron Wok is easy to clean for life-long use. Cast Iron Wok wears in without wearing out, creating limitless opportunities to light up for years to come.</p><p><strong>Portable</strong><br>Cleverly designed with portability in mind, everything from packing to assembly is effortless, so you can focus on the trip of a lifetime or crafting wood-fired fare.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '5f3d1296-273a-490e-b779-38