 or crafting wood-fired fare.</p><p><strong>Yukon Cooking System</strong><br>Cast Iron Wok and Hub are part of a well-oiled machine made for creating good moments. Trailside suppers and flame-to-table feasts are possible with Yukon and accessories for a complete experience.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '08818816-ee87-487a-b616-0a1e1a6b3e9c.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-04-30 04:10:05', '2025-07-14 03:29:22', '64998', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 54, 0),
(101, 'ranger-heat-deflector', 'Ranger Heat Deflector', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p>Solo Stove Fire Pits signature heat is redirected for more fireside warmth. The Heat Deflector magnifies your fire pits heat radius to make room for extra company or outdoor comfort in every season.</p><div>What’s Included</div><div><div><div><div><img src="https://media.solostove.com/transform/4fb7034d-6a70-4064-abc2-cc5586354f5f/DEFLECTORRANGER-2?io=transform:fill,width:96,height:96"><p><br></p><p><strong>Ranger Heat Deflector</strong></p><div><p>Capture and redirect Ranger’s signature heat to where it matters the most</p></div></div><div><img src="https://media.solostove.com/transform/a5a8f41c-381c-4dae-8e7d-13711a3f9a2d/leg?io=transform:fill,width:96,height:96"><p><br></p><p><strong>3 Detachable Legs</strong></p><div><p>Rise to the occasion and elevate your fireside warmth with these detachable legs</p></div></div></div></div></div><p>&nbsp;<br></p><p><strong>Effective</strong><br>As hot air rises and scatters, Heat Deflector captures and redirects the warmth to where you need it most. The precision-angle center cone and deflection disc are designed to tame the aimless heat so you can easily find fireside comfort.</p><p><strong>Long-Lasting</strong><br>Constructed from 304 stainless steel, Heat Deflector is built to last a lifetime of good moments alongside your fire pit.</p><p><strong>Adaptive</strong><br>Compatible with most accessories, Heat Deflector adapts to your fire pit experience. Place the deflection disc over your fire pit with Hub, or directly on the flame ring with detachable legs. Detachable legs latch and lock into place without extra tools or accessories so warming up is still as simple as lighting the fire.</p><p><strong>Cohesive</strong><br><span>Stow in Station, handle with Gloves, or refuel with fire pit Tools. Heat Deflector’s collapsible and accessible design compliments your favorite Solo Stove accessories.</span><br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'f226b8b5-da03-4c93-8a32-c8ea446d3870.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 05:39:26', '2025-07-14 03:27:27', '31998', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 82, 0),
(102, 'bonfire-heat-deflector', 'Bonfire Heat Deflector', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p>Solo Stove Fire Pits signature heat is redirected for more fireside warmth. The Heat Deflector magnifies your fire pits heat radius to make room for extra company or outdoor comfort in every season.</p><div>What’s Included</div><div><div><div><div><p><img src="https://media.solostove.com/transform/4fb7034d-6a70-4064-abc2-cc5586354f5f/DEFLECTORRANGER-2?io=transform:fill,width:96,height:96"></p><p><strong>Bonfire Heat Deflector</strong></p><div><p>Capture and redirect Ranger’s signature heat to where it matters the most</p></div></div><div><p><img src="https://media.solostove.com/transform/a5a8f41c-381c-4dae-8e7d-13711a3f9a2d/leg?io=transform:fill,width:96,height:96"></p><p><strong>3 Detachable Legs</strong></p><div><p>Rise to the occasion and elevate your fireside warmth with these detachable legs</p></div></div></div></div></div><p>&nbsp;<br></p><p><strong>Effective</strong><br>As hot air rises and scatters, Heat Deflector captures and redirects the warmth to where you need it most. The precision-angle center cone and deflection disc are designed to tame the aimless heat so you can easily find fireside comfort.</p><p><strong>Long-Lasting</strong><br>Constructed from 304 stainless steel, Heat Deflector is built to last a lifetime of good moments alongside your fire pit.</p><p><strong>Adaptive</strong><br>Compatible with most accessories, Heat Deflector adapts to your fire pit experience. Place the deflection disc over your fire pit with Hub, or directly on the flame ring with detachable legs. Detachable legs latch and lock into place without extra tools or accessories so warming up is still as simple as lighting the fire.</p><p><strong>Cohesive</strong><br>Stow in Station, handle with Gloves, or refuel with fire pit Tools. Heat Deflector’s collapsible and accessible design compliments your favorite Solo Stove accessories.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '22b5bdc8-4fc9-40db-836b-790b6edaf7b5.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 05:40:45', '2025-07-14 03:28:49', '44998', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 81, 0),
(103, 'yukon-heat-deflector', 'Yukon 27″ Heat Deflector', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p>Solo Stove Fire Pits signature heat is redirected for more fireside warmth. The Heat Deflector magnifies your fire pits heat radius to make room for extra company or outdoor comfort in every season.</p><div>What’s Included</div><div><div><div><div><p><img src="https://media.solostove.com/transform/4fb7034d-6a70-4064-abc2-cc5586354f5f/DEFLECTORRANGER-2?io=transform:fill,width:96,height:96"></p><p><strong>Bonfire Heat Deflector</strong></p><div><p>Capture and redirect Ranger’s signature heat to where it matters the most</p></div></div><div><p><img src="https://media.solostove.com/transform/a5a8f41c-381c-4dae-8e7d-13711a3f9a2d/leg?io=transform:fill,width:96,height:96"></p><p><strong>3 Detachable Legs</strong></p><div><p>Rise to the occasion and elevate your fireside warmth with these detachable legs</p></div></div></div></div></div><p>&nbsp;<br></p><p><strong>Effective</strong><br>As hot air rises and scatters, Heat Deflector captures and redirects the warmth to where you need it most. The precision-angle center cone and deflection disc are designed to tame the aimless heat so you can easily find fireside comfort.</p><p><strong>Long-Lasting</strong><br>Constructed from 304 stainless steel, Heat Deflector is built to last a lifetime of good moments alongside your fire pit.</p><p><strong>Adaptive</strong><br>Compatible with most accessories, Heat Deflector adapts to your fire pit experience. Place the deflection disc over your fire pit with Hub, or directly on the flame ring with detachable legs. Detachable legs latch and lock into place without extra tools or accessories so warming up is still as simple as lighting the fire.</p><p><strong>Cohesive</strong><br>Stow in Station, handle with Gloves, or refuel with fire pit Tools. Heat Deflector’s collapsible and accessible design compliments your favorite Solo Stove accessories.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '611739ad-5a6e-43af-bec8-990ca8412306.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 05:41:43', '2025-07-14 03:30:51', '59998', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 80, 0),
(104, 'lite', 'Solostove Lite', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>Solo Stove Lite</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>is for those who are ready to roam ,get a quick pot of water boiling &amp; get back on trail ,weighing less than a pound Lite is a perfect ultra-light camp stove to keep your pack light &amp; ready to go without having to bring along fuel. LITE lets you enjoy an efficient flame using nothing more than sticks &amp; twigs you find along the trail.</p><p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul><li>Light Weight</li><li>Cooks for 1-2 people</li><li>Wood Burning</li><li>Low Smoke</li><li>Stainless Steel</li></ul>', '<p><strong>Warranty :</strong></p><ul><li>Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.</li><li>Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.</li></ul>', NULL, '<p><strong>Product Specs:</strong></p><ul><li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li><li>Fuel: Sticks, twigs, pine cones, and other biomass</li><li>Diameter: 4.25 inches</li><li>Height: 5.7 inches</li><li>Weight: 0.25 kg</li></ul>', NULL, '9c120832-397a-4861-a8a3-40a6abb05392.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 05:42:54', '2025-07-14 03:22:10', '17998', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 42, 0),
(105, 'titan', 'Solostove Titan', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>Solostove</strong></p><p><strong>Titan</strong></p><p>Enjoy a beautiful , primal moment around a flame that’s sure to fan a lasting memory. Solo stove Titan lets you make tasty , hot food in minutes while exploring the world we love. Our Signature 360° Airflow Design™ creates a super-efficient burn using nothing but sticks and twigs as fuel. The lower vent holes draw in air which heats up inside Titan’s double-wall construction. The heated air ignites after leaving the upper vent holes, creating a spectacular secondary burn. That means faster boil times, a hotter fire, and less smoke!</p><p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul><li>Light Weight</li><li>Cooks for 2-4 people</li><li>Wood Burning</li><li>Low Smoke</li><li>Stainless Steel</li></ul>', '<p><strong>Warranty :</strong></p><ul><li>Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.</li><li>Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.</li></ul>', NULL, '<p><strong>Product Specs:</strong></p><ul><li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li><li>Fuel: Sticks, twigs, pine cones, and other biomass</li><li>Diameter: 5.1 inches</li><li>Height: 7.9 inches</li><li>Weight: 0.46 kg</li></ul>', NULL, 'a782cc0c-a4ff-4158-bc0b-b2ba73e256d6.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 05:44:01', '2025-07-14 03:22:49', '21998', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 43, 0),
(106, 'campfire', 'Solostove Campfire', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>Solostove</strong></p><p><strong>Campfire</strong></p><p>Campfire lets you turn good moments at the campsite into lasting memories. Craft a delicious meal (complete with s’mores for dessert) and bask in the glow of a mesmerizing flame all with one portable camp stove.Our Signature 360° Airflow Design™ creates a super-efficient burn using nothing but sticks and twigs as fuel. The lower vent holes draw in air which heats up inside Campfire’s double-wall construction. The heated air ignites after leaving the upper vent holes, creating a spectacular secondary burn. That means more hot dogs, s’mores, pasta, chili, and more without worrying about getting your fire just right.</p><p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul><li>Cooks for 4+ people</li><li>Wood Burning</li><li>Durable</li><li>Low Smoke</li><li>Stainless Steel</li></ul>', '<p><strong>Warranty :</strong></p><ul><li>Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.</li><li>Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.</li></ul>', '<p><br></p>', '<p><strong>Product Specs:</strong></p><ul><li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li><li>Fuel: Sticks, twigs, pine cones, and other biomass</li><li>Diameter: 7 inches</li><li>Height: 9.25 inches</li><li>Weight: 1 kg</li></ul>', NULL, '603a74f8-97cb-4950-ac9d-e3d83e212f28.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 05:45:08', '2025-07-14 03:23:31', '29998', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 44, 0),
(107, 'grill-ultimate-bundle', 'Solostove Grill Ultimate Bundle', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>Solostove</strong></p><p><strong>Grill Ultimate Bundle</strong></p><p>Nothing brings people together like fire and food. Too often, grilling for an outdoor gathering becomes the work of one grill master who spends the majority of their time at the grill and away from the group.Grilling, Reinvented goes beyond just what’s under the lid. Place Solo Stove Grill in the center of the action, and turn your outdoor cookouts into fun, interactive grilling experiences the whole family can enjoy.Easily removable ash pan , charcoal grate &amp; cooking grate make it easy to light &amp; clean every part of the grill.</p><p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul><li>Easy Set-up</li><li>360 degrees airflow design</li><li>Cooks faster</li><li>Burns hotter</li><li>Stainless Steel</li></ul>', '<p><strong>Warranty :</strong></p><ul><li>Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.</li><li>Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.</li></ul>', NULL, '<p><strong>Product Specs:</strong></p><ul><li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel, cold-rolled steel</li><li>Fuel: Charcoal briquettes or lump kiln-dried chunk wood</li><li>Diameter: 22 inches</li><li>Height: 29.4 inches</li><li>Weight: 17.5 kg</li></ul>', NULL, '3345a323-e8b3-4d5c-aaaa-9ed7e6aa000f.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 05:46:11', '2025-07-14 03:25:13', '122000', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48, 0),
(108, 'lite-gear-kit', 'Solostove Lite Gear Kit', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>Solostove</strong></p><p><strong>Lite Gear Kit</strong></p><p>This Bundle lets you enjoy a hot meal on the trail and get moving again . The Kit includes ultra lite camp stove, POT900, Windscreen, Alcohol Burner, Fire Striker.</p><p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul><li>Stainless Steel</li><li>Light Weight</li><li>Wood Burning</li><li>Low Smoke</li><li>Cooks for 1-2 people</li></ul>', '<p><strong>Warranty :</strong></p><ul><li>Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.</li><li>Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.</li></ul>', NULL, '<p><strong>Product Specs:</strong></p><ul><li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li><li>Fuel:<span>&nbsp;</span><span>Sticks, Twigs, Pine Cones and Other Biomass</span></li><li>Weight: 0.25 kg</li></ul>', NULL, '7c587f93-6d2a-4fd9-aa02-ae6c88493c64.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 05:47:11', '2025-07-14 03:22:28', '42786', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 61, 0),
(109, 'titan-gear-kit', 'Solostove Titan Gear Kit', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>Solostove</strong></p><p><strong>Titan Gear Kit</strong></p><p>This Bundle includes everything you need to fuel your hiking, backpacking, and culinary adventures. Enjoy the great outdoors and a tasty meal without weighing down your pack . The Pack includes Titan Portable camp stove, POT1800, Windscreen, Tripod.</p><p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul><li>Stainless Steel</li><li>Light Weight</li><li>Wood Burning</li><li>Low Smoke</li><li>Cooks for 2-4 people</li></ul>', '<p><strong>Warranty :</strong></p><ul><li>Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.</li><li>Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.</li></ul>', NULL, '<p><strong>Product Specs:</strong></p><ul><li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li><li>Fuel:<span>&nbsp;</span><span>Sticks, Twigs, Pine Cones and Other Biomass</span></li><li>Weight: 0.47 kg</li></ul>', NULL, '58e7e3b9-3337-4ee4-93c5-5e2d33185986.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 05:48:56', '2025-07-14 03:23:05', '49998', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 63, 0),
(110, 'campfire-gear-kit', 'Solostove Campfire Gear Kit', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>Solostove</strong></p><p><strong>Campfire Gear Kit</strong></p><p>This Bundle has everything you need to cook up hearty chili, pasta, and more right out Kit includes Ultimate ultra-light camp stove, 2 pot set includes 3L &amp; 1.5 L pots, Tripod.</p><p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul><li>Stainless Steel</li><li>Durable</li><li>Wood Burning</li><li>Low Smoke</li><li>Cooks for 4+ people</li></ul>', '<p><strong>Warranty :</strong></p><ul><li>Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.</li><li>Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.</li></ul>', NULL, '<p><strong>Product Specs:</strong></p><ul><li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li><li>Fuel:<span>&nbsp;</span><span>Sticks, Twigs, Pine Cones and Other Biomass</span></li><li>Weight: 1 kg</li></ul>', NULL, '2cc9b13b-71db-4dda-97eb-d1553d1a5d7a.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 05:49:58', '2025-07-14 03:23:44', '55194', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 62, 0),
(111, 'alcohol-burner', 'Alcohol Burner', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>Solostove</strong></p><p><strong>Alcohol Burner</strong></p><p>Sometimes finding dry sticks and twigs on the trail can be a challenge. Be prepare using Alcohol Burner as a backup liquid fuel option. It’s design features a flame regulator and a screw top cap to store fuel directly inside the burner. Use with denatured alcohol or methylated spirits only. Alcohol Burner lets you enjoy your Lite or Titan camp stove when sticks and twigs aren’t available. Just fill it with denatured alcohol, place it inside your camp stove, and light!</p><p>It’s convenient flame regulator allows you to control and douse your flame with ease. Alcohol Burner features a screw top cap and rubber gasket to store liquid fuel directly inside. When you’re on the move, nest it right inside your Lite or Titan to save room in your pack.</p><p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul><li>Lightweight</li><li>Eco-friendly</li><li>No smoke</li></ul>', '<p><strong>Warranty :</strong></p><ul><li>Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.</li><li>Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.</li></ul>', NULL, '<p><strong>Product Specs:</strong></p><p>Diameter: 2.9 inches</p><p>Height: 1.8 inches</p><p>Weight: 100 gms</p><p>Fuel: Denatured Alcohol/Methylated Spirits</p><p>Boil Time: 5-7 minutes to boil 1 l of water</p>', NULL, '09b612bf-71ac-4b5e-8cdf-9ed13b4ba972.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 05:51:00', '2025-07-14 03:32:52', '4998', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 79, 0),
(112, 'survival-fire-striker', 'Survival Fire Striker', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>Solostove</strong></p><p><strong>Survival Fire Striker</strong></p><p>When you want the primal fire starting experience, Fire Striker is a surefire way to the perfect flame. It’s fast-lighting ferrocerium rod sparks twice as hot as a regular match and lasts for up to 15,000 strikes.</p><p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul><li>Hot Spark – 5400 °F</li><li>Works when wet</li><li>Lightweight</li><li>Durable</li></ul>', '<p><strong>Warranty :</strong></p><ul><li>Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.</li><li>Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.</li></ul>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '5edcb3d4-cc27-484c-95d8-3aad0bc27e69.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 05:52:11', '2025-07-14 03:32:38', '4998', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 78, 0),
(113, 'starters-16-packs', 'Starters-16Packs', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>Solostove</strong></p><p><strong>Starters – 16 Packs</strong></p><p>Saving newspapers, magazines, toilet paper rolls, and even dryer lint to help light your Solo Stove is a lot of work. Enjoy these non-toxic, 100% recycled hardwood starters as a safe and efficient way to get a roaring flame in minutes. Building a fire in your Solo Stove fire pit, grill, or camp stove has never been easier. Just place throughout your wood kindling, light, and enjoy!</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '3ef7e7aa-f228-45c1-9042-73cc7fae844f.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 05:53:29', '2025-07-14 03:24:52', '2998', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 47, 0),
(114, 'starter-packs', 'Starter Packs', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>Solostove</strong></p><p><strong>Starter Packs</strong></p><p>Crumpled newspaper won’t start a fire in the rain. Now, there’s an easier way to warm up in inclement weather. Meet our non-toxic, earth-friendly, weather-proof fire starter that outlasts the most extreme conditions. Each pack comes with 20 Starter Packs. Perfect for the trail or the backyard, Starter Packs are reliable, fast, and durable. All you need is one match– Starter Packs will light every time they come in contact with a flame. Store them for up to 30 years, and always at a safe distance from any heat sources.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '21ea0c70-ce69-457a-953f-394b68ca4dba.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 05:54:42', '2025-07-14 03:24:34', '2998', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 46, 0);
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "slug", "title", "user_id", "brand_id", "category_id", "summary", "description", "warranty", "specification", "installation", "download", "image", "seo_title", "seo_description", "seo_keyword", "status", "created_at", "updated_at", "price", "sale_price", "type", "stock", "shops", "daraz_link", "hardware_pasal_link", "mero_pasal_link", "order", "order_status") VALUES
(115, 'northern-lights-color-pack', 'Northern Lights Color Pack', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>Solostove</strong></p><p><strong>Northern Lights Color Pack</strong></p><p>Take your Flame to the next level with a pop of color. Toss a color pack into your fire pit and watch the flames dance between blue, green, purple and yellow. Contains 10 color packs. Burns for upto an hour. Color Packs are perfect for the nights you need a little extra something to put your fire over the top. Pro tip: toss in two for an over the top color changing light show. Color Packs are not food safe, so make sure you roast your marshmallows before adding a Color Pack to your fire.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2e4087f1-8105-4a71-8a87-c6aa68c09f55.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 05:56:50', '2025-07-14 03:24:16', '5998', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 45, 0),
(116, 'bundle-sticks-tools', 'Bundle Sticks + Tools', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>Solostove</strong></p><p><strong>Bundle Sticks + Tools</strong></p><p>This Bundle includes the best roasting sticks out there and the last fire pit tools you will ever have. Roasting Sticks perfectly designed ste of four and the angled poker and log grabber let you stoke and add logs inside your fire pit without even leaving your chair .</p><p><strong>STICKS FEATURES:</strong></p><ul><li>Stainless Steel</li><li>Dual Pronged</li><li>Twists Apart</li><li>4 Piece Set</li></ul><p><strong>TOOLS FEATURES:</strong></p><ul><li>Stainless Steel</li><li>2 Piece Set</li><li>Angled Poker</li><li>Angled Grabber</li><li>Easy to hang</li></ul>', '<p><strong>Warranty :</strong></p><ul><li>Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.</li><li>Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.</li></ul>', NULL, '<p><strong>Product Specs:</strong></p><p><strong>Sticks:</strong></p><ul><li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li><li>Design: Two-piece</li><li>Length: 36 inches</li><li>Weight: 1.7 kgs</li></ul><p><strong>Tools:</strong></p><ul><li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li><li>Length: 36 inches</li><li>Weight: 2.2 kgs</li></ul>', NULL, '7beb3aee-18bc-4049-870b-fabb41c14344.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 06:05:43', '2025-07-14 03:32:15', '27996', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 77, 0),
(117, '11867', 'Roasting Sticks', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>Solostove</strong></p><p><strong>Roasting Sticks</strong></p><p>Roasting sticks come in a pack of four with a protective case , made with durable SS304 stainless steel . Sticks are dual-pronged and twist apart at the middle to make storing in the included case easy and fit inside your dishwasher a breeze. Sticks also features a hollow channel throughout the rod to prevent heat disbursment from the flame to the handle.</p><p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul><li>Stainless Steel</li><li>Dual Pronged</li><li>Twists Apart</li><li>4 Piece Set</li></ul>', '<p><strong>Warranty :</strong></p><ul><li>Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.</li><li>Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.</li></ul>', NULL, '<p><strong>Product Specs:</strong></p><ul><li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li><li>Design: Two-piece</li><li>Length: 36 inches</li></ul>', NULL, 'f4a542f7-3f6c-4b1f-aab0-0a3e80e5f106.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 06:06:49', '2025-07-14 03:31:57', '13998', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 76, 0),
(118, 'ranger-shield', 'Ranger Shield', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>Solostove</strong></p><p><strong>Ranger Shield</strong></p><p>Shield is the perfect tool for giving you complete peace of mind when enjoying time around your Ranger. Especially useful if you have kids or pets, Shield protects from sparks, embers, or hot ashes flying out.Shield’s two-piece design allows you to remove the upper section with the included tools and add more wood to your fire. You can also rest your roasting sticks along Shield’s grooved rim, letting you craft the perfect s’more.</p><p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul><li>Durable</li><li>Stainless Steel</li><li>Safe</li><li>Grooved Rim</li><li>Removal Tools</li></ul>', '<p><strong>Warranty :</strong></p><ul><li>Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.</li><li>Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.</li></ul>', NULL, '<p><strong>Product Specs:</strong></p><ul><li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li><li>Design: Two-piece</li><li>Diameter: 9.5 – 13.25 inches</li><li>Height: 2.75 inches</li><li>Weight: 1.8 kg</li></ul>', NULL, 'e92aeded-7470-4289-97d7-ca1c76dd13d6.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 06:08:02', '2025-07-14 03:27:16', '23998', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 75, 0),
(119, 'bonfire-shield', 'Bonfire Shield', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>Solostove</strong></p><p><strong>Bonfire Shield</strong></p><p>Shield is the perfect tool for giving you complete peace of mind when enjoying time around your Bonfire. Especially useful if you have kids or pets, Shield protects from sparks, embers, or hot ashes flying out.Shield’s two-piece design allows you to remove the upper section with the included tools and add more wood to your fire. You can also rest your roasting sticks along Shield’s grooved rim, letting you craft the perfect s’more.</p><p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul><li>Durable</li><li>Stainless Steel</li><li>Safe</li><li>Grooved Rim</li><li>Removal Tools</li></ul><p><br></p>', '<p><strong>Warranty :</strong></p><ul><li>Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.</li><li>Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.</li></ul>', NULL, '<p><strong>Product Specs:</strong></p><ul><li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li><li>Design: Two-piece</li><li>Diameter: 12.625 – 19 inches</li><li>Height: 3.75 inches</li><li>Weight: 2.3 kg</li></ul>', NULL, '97bdd53d-17fe-4610-9b4a-fd253879d13c.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 06:09:02', '2025-07-14 03:29:00', '33998', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 74, 0),
(120, 'yukon-shield', 'Yukon Shield', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>Solostove</strong></p><p><strong>Yukon Shield</strong></p><p>Shield is the perfect tool for giving you complete peace of mind when enjoying time around your Yukon. Especially useful if you have kids or pets, Shield protects from sparks, embers, or hot ashes flying out. Shield’s two-piece design allows you to remove the upper section with the included tools and add more wood to your fire. You can also rest your roasting sticks along Shield’s grooved rim, letting you craft the perfect s’more.</p><p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul><li>Durable</li><li>Stainless Steel</li><li>Safe</li><li>Grooved Rim</li><li>Removal Tools</li></ul>', '<p><strong>Warranty :</strong></p><ul><li>Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.</li><li>Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.</li></ul>', NULL, '<p><strong>Product Specs:</strong></p><ul><li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li><li>Design: Two-piece</li><li>Diameter: 27 inches</li><li>Weight: 2.86 kg</li></ul>', NULL, 'd67b15e9-9f8d-4b19-9824-f4fa9580cd7d.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 06:10:05', '2025-07-14 03:30:38', '53998', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 73, 0),
(121, 'ranger-handle', 'Ranger Handle', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p><span>Solo Stove Handle makes moving your Ranger quick &amp; easy , using only one hand. Enjoy a smooth carry from backyard to backcountry and anywhere in between . Just dip , lift , and go. It’s that seemless.</span></p>', '<p><strong>Warranty :</strong></p><ul><li>Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.</li><li>Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.</li></ul>', NULL, '<p><strong>Product Specs:</strong></p><ul><li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li><li>Length: 14.17 inches</li><li>Height: 4.92 inches</li><li>Weight: 0.36 kg</li></ul>', NULL, 'e52e52ca-ca54-4945-b0b5-0a1864a98b85.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 06:11:14', '2025-07-14 03:27:05', '7998', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 70, 0),
(122, 'bonfire-handle', 'Bonfire Handle', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p>The SoloStove Handle makes moving your bonfire quick and easy, using only one hand. Enjoy a smooth ride from the backyard to the backcountry and anywhere in between. Just dip, lift, and go. It’s seamless.</p><h3>Easy To Use</h3><p>Angled and oversized for the most comfortable and secure lift, Handle’s unique design offers ultimate accessibility for any fire caretaker. With Handle’s one-hand carry, your fire pit can be moved to and from your favorite spot.</p><h3>Long Lasting</h3><p>Constructed from 304 stainless steel, the Handle is built to last as long as your fire pit.</p>', NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>Product Specs:</strong></p><ul><li>Height: 15 cm</li><li>Length: 47,5 cm</li><li>Weight: 0.5 kg</li><li>Materials: 304 Stainless Steel</li></ul>', NULL, '068bd0db-5af3-4547-b406-8a4d252c9871.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 06:12:18', '2025-07-14 03:28:38', '8998', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 71, 0),
(123, 'yukon-handle', 'Yukon Handle', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p>The perfect carry. Move your fire pit from the backyard to the backcountry with one fluid motion for simple and seamless transitions.</p><h3>Easy To Use</h3><p>Angled and oversized for the most comfortable and secure lift, Handle’s unique design offers ultimate accessibility for any fire caretaker. With Handle’s one-hand carry, your fire pit can be moved to and from your favorite spot.</p><h3>Long Lasting</h3><p>Constructed from 304 stainless steel, the handle is built to last as long as your fire pit.</p>', NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>Product Specs:</strong></p><ul><li>Height: 7 in | 17,8 cm</li><li>Length: 25 in | 63,5 cm</li><li>Weight: 1.44 lbs | 0.65 kgs</li><li>Materials: 304 Stainless Steel</li></ul>', NULL, 'af0d6154-df83-4c4e-bcbd-ab802ba32604.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 06:13:25', '2025-07-14 03:30:26', '9998', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 72, 0),
(124, 'ranger-lid', 'Ranger lid', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>Solostove</strong></p><p><strong>Ranger Lid</strong></p><p>Lid provides all-purpose utility to your Ranger. Contain leftover ash and embers as an overnight safeguard or convert Ranger to a modern table top.</p><p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul><li>Durable</li><li>Stainless Steel</li><li>Safe</li></ul>', '<p><strong>Warranty :</strong></p><ul><li>Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.</li><li>Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.</li></ul>', NULL, '<p><strong>Product Specs:</strong></p><ul><li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li><li>Width: 15.51 inches</li><li>Weight: 1.15 kg</li></ul>', NULL, '34899844-2fd4-4ee6-86ba-bac08b68e734.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 06:14:26', '2025-07-14 03:26:53', '9998', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 64, 0),
(125, 'bonfire-lid', 'Bonfire Lid', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>Solostove</strong></p><p><strong>Bonfire Lid</strong></p><p>Lid provides all-purpose utility to your Bonfire. Contain leftover ash and embers as an overnight safeguard or convert Bonfire to a modern table top.</p><p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul><li>Durable</li><li>Stainless Steel</li><li>Safe</li></ul>', '<p><strong>Warranty :</strong></p><ul><li>Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.</li><li>Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.</li></ul>', NULL, '<p><strong>Product Specs:</strong></p><ul><li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li><li>Width: 19.43 inches</li><li>Weight: 1.77 kg</li></ul>', NULL, '18e56c62-62bb-4f36-aac2-f0e2f94bef2f.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 06:15:33', '2025-07-14 03:28:27', '15998', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 65, 0),
(126, 'yukon-lid', 'Yukon lid', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>Solostove</strong></p><p><strong>Yukon Lid</strong></p><p>Lid provides all-purpose utility to your Yukun. Contain leftover ash and embers as an overnight safeguard or convert Yukun to a modern table top.</p><p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul><li>Durable</li><li>Stainless Steel</li><li>Safe</li></ul>', '<p><strong>Warranty :</strong></p><ul><li>Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.</li><li>Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.</li></ul>', NULL, '<p><strong>Product Specs:</strong></p><ul><li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li><li>Width: 26.93 inches</li><li>Weight: 4.08 kg</li></ul>', NULL, 'dc036a8d-2059-428d-8f45-e93f544ee945.webp', 'Solo Stove Yukon Lid: Safeguard Ash & Transform Your Fire Pit | Sigma Technologies', 'Enhance your outdoor experience with the Solo Stove Yukon Lid. This versatile lid safeguards ash and embers while transforming your fire pit into a modern tabletop. Perfect for gatherings and outdoor dining, it offers practical utility and stylish design, making your Yukon even more functional. Available now at Sigma Technologies in Nepal.', NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 06:16:37', '2025-07-14 03:30:04', '23998', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 66, 0),
(127, 'pot-4000', 'Pot 4000', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>Solostove</strong></p><p><strong>Pot 4000</strong></p><p>Pot 4000 is made with durable 304 stainless steel, just like your Campfire camp stove. Cook up a hot meal for your small group and nest Campfire inside when it’s time to get moving.t features a lockable silicone-coated lift tab, bail handle to hang from Tripod, double fold-out handles, and volume markings in ounces and milliliters. Pot 4000 holds up to 4000 ml.</p><p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul><li>Durable</li><li>Stainless Steel</li><li>Easy Pouring</li><li>Lightweight</li><li>Markings(oz/ml)</li></ul>', '<p><strong>Warranty :</strong></p><ul><li>Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.</li><li>Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.</li></ul>', NULL, '<p><strong>Product Specs:</strong></p><ul><li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li><li>Volume: 4000 ml</li><li>Diameter: 7.75 inches</li><li>Height: 7.25 inches</li><li>Weight: 0.81 kg</li></ul>', NULL, 'cd6bb80a-2a46-4f95-9d59-e9bd0057d441.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 06:17:40', '2025-07-14 03:31:32', '15998', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 69, 0),
(128, 'pot-1800', 'Pot 1800', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>Solostove</strong></p><p><strong>Pot 1800</strong></p><p>Pot 1800 is made with durable 304 stainless steel, just like your Titan camp stove. Cook up a quick, hot meal for two and nest Titan inside when it’s time to get moving.It features a lockable silicone-coated lift tab, bail handle to hang from Tripod, pour spout, double fold-out handles, and volume markings in ounces and milliliters. Pot 1800 holds up to 1800 ml.</p><p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul><li>Durable</li><li>Stainless Steel</li><li>Easy Pouring</li><li>Lightweight</li><li>Markings(oz/ml)</li></ul>', '<p><strong>Warranty :</strong></p><ul><li>Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.</li><li>Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.</li></ul>', NULL, '<p><strong>Product Specs:</strong></p><ul><li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li><li>Volume: 1800 ml</li><li>Diameter: 5.5 inches</li><li>Height: 6.1 inches</li><li>Weight: 0.35 kg</li></ul>', NULL, '63aae270-372d-4df2-9acf-f3e8df0ee650.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 06:18:50', '2025-07-14 03:31:23', '13998', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 68, 0),
(129, 'solostove-pot-900', 'Pot 900', 2, 11, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>Solostove</strong></p><p><strong>Pot 900</strong></p><p>Pot 900 is made with durable 304 stainless steel, just like your Lite camp stove. Cook up a quick, hot meal on the go and store Lite right inside when it’s time to get moving.It features a lockable silicone-coated lift tab, pour spout, double fold-out handles, and volume markings in ounces and milliliters. Pot 900 holds up to 900 ml.</p><p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul><li>Durable</li><li>Stainless Steel</li><li>Easy Pouring</li><li>Lightweight</li><li>Markings(oz/ml)</li></ul>', '<p><strong>Warranty :</strong></p><ul><li>Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.</li><li>Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.</li></ul>', NULL, '<p><strong>Product Specs:</strong></p><ul><li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li><li>Volume: 900 ml</li><li>Diameter: 4.7 inches</li><li>Height: 4.5 inches</li><li>Weight: 0.22 kg</li></ul>', NULL, 'cd85812b-e5e3-4316-afdf-ca4b3c9d4bfd.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 06:19:52', '2025-07-14 03:31:11', '9998', NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 67, 0),
(130, 'fire-place-eco1', 'Wood Fired Fireplace (ECO1)', 2, 14, 48, NULL, '<p><strong>Himalayan Rocket Stove</strong></p><p><strong>Model: ECO1</strong></p><p>The Eco1 Rocket stove is a marvel of technology &amp; engineering saving both economy &amp; ecology.The himalayan rocket stove uses less than 50% of the wood used in a typical chulha/bukhari &amp; burns so clean that after 10-15 mins you won’t see smoke coming from your chimney pipe. This stove is modular &amp; is made to the highest quality. the external box is made from heavy weight black steel for maximum heat radiance &amp; the internal components use the highest quality SS310 for high temperature operating longevity.</p>', '<p><strong>Warranty:</strong><span>&nbsp;12 months</span><br><br><span>1. Warranty : &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>2. Actual product may vary as in picture displayed.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>3. Manufacturer may change the specifications at any time.</span><br></p>', '<p><br></p>', '<p><span>Weight: 45 kg</span><br><span>Dimensions: 72 × 46 × 47 cm</span><br><span>Decoration: None</span><br></p>', NULL, 'def25fcb-0ad0-4a06-858f-702bea5cc307.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 06:52:03', '2025-07-14 03:34:45', '62500', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 29, 0),
(131, 'wood-fired-fireplace-eco2', 'Wood Fired Fireplace (ECO2)', 2, 14, 48, NULL, '<p><strong>Himalayan Rocket Stove</strong></p><p><strong>Model: ECO2</strong></p><p>The&nbsp;<strong><em>Eco2&nbsp;Rocket Stove&nbsp;</em></strong>is the middle sized unit in our range, standing at 27″ (625mm) height from the floor. The wood feeder system is the same as in Eco1 and the footprint is also the same at 18″ (450mm) wide x 28″ (700mm) long on the base. Add another 5″ (125mm) back for the exhaust hood for the total space required.<br>This stove is recommended for large rooms , smaller guest house dining room &amp; places where good heat is required.</p>', '<p><strong>Warranty:</strong><span>&nbsp;12 months</span><br><br><span>1. Warranty : &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>2. Actual product may vary as in picture displayed.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>3. Manufacturer may change the specifications at any time.</span><br></p>', '<p><br></p>', '<p><span>Weight: 50 kg</span><br><span>Decoration: None</span><br></p>', NULL, 'aeb0c0b4-7ea7-4fe0-9dbd-cb01a5995a7b.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 06:53:42', '2025-07-14 03:35:08', '100000', NULL, 'Hot', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 30, 0),
(132, 'wood-fired-fireplace-eco3', 'Wood Fired Fireplace (ECO3)', 2, 14, 48, NULL, '<p><strong>Model: ECO3 (HRS Rocket Stove)</strong></p><p>The Himalayan Rocket Stove ECO3 is a high-efficiency wood-fired fireplace that is perfect for heating your home, cabin, or outdoor space. This stove is designed with a unique rocket stove design that maximizes combustion efficiency, resulting in a clean and efficient burn.</p><p>The ECO3 model is made from high-quality materials and is built to last. The stove is constructed from heavy-duty steel and features a large firebox that can accommodate logs up to 18 inches in length. The stove also includes a removable ash pan, making cleanup a breeze.</p><p>In addition to its high efficiency and durability, the Himalayan Rocket Stove ECO3 is also incredibly easy to use. The stove features a simple air control system that allows you to easily adjust the temperature and burn rate, giving you complete control over your heating needs.</p><p>One of the standout features of the ECO3 is its SEO Word Wood Fired Fireplace. This innovative design allows for even more efficient combustion, as the stove is able to burn wood at higher temperatures, resulting in a cleaner and more efficient burn.</p><p>Overall, the Himalayan Rocket Stove ECO3 with SEO Word Wood Fired Fireplace is an excellent choice for anyone looking for a high-quality, efficient, and easy-to-use wood-fired stove. Whether you’re looking to heat your home, cabin, or outdoor space, the ECO3 is sure to meet your needs and exceed your expectations.</p><div><p>The&nbsp;<em><strong>Eco3</strong></em><em><strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Rocket Stove&nbsp;</strong></em>is the largest in our range, standing at 33″ (825mm) height from the floor (when standing on its feet). The wood feeder system is the same as in Eco1 and Eco2 and the footprint is also the same at 18″ (450mm) wide x 28″ (700mm) long on the base. Add another 6″ (150mm) at the back for the exhaust hood for the total space required.</p><p>This stove is recommended for larger rooms, guesthouse dining rooms, small halls and places where the maximum heating is required.</p><p><strong><a href="https://www.sigmatechnologies.com.np/product/fireplace-glass-door/">Glass Fire Door</a><span>&nbsp;</span>/<span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.sigmatechnologies.com.np/product-category/heating/stoves-and-fireplaces/page/2/">Hot Water Hamam options</a></strong><span>&nbsp;</span>can be purchased separately and will be added to your package.</p><p>For more sizes click here:<span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.sigmatechnologies.com.np/product/wood-fired-fireplace-eco2/">Rocket Stove Nepal ECO2</a><span>&nbsp;</span>/<span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.sigmatechnologies.com.np/product/fire-place-eco1/">Rocket Stove Nepal ECO1</a></p></div>', '<p><strong>Warranty:</strong><span>&nbsp;12 months</span><br><br><span>1. Warranty : &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>2. Actual product may vary as in picture displayed.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>3. Manufacturer may change the specifications at any time.</span><br></p>', '<p><br></p>', '<p><span>Weight: 55 kg</span><br><span>Dimensions(LxWxH in mm): 700 x 450 x 825</span><br><span>Decoration: None</span><br></p>', NULL, '3b52f936-f3c4-4be7-8d4d-3f43f14de033.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 06:54:54', '2025-07-14 03:35:22', '120000', NULL, 'Hot', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 31, 0),
(133, 'hot-water-hammam-25-ltrs', 'Hot Water Hammam 25 Ltrs', 2, 14, 18, NULL, '<p><strong>Hot Water Hammam 25 Ltrs</strong></p><p>This system uses the waste heat from the exhaust flue to heat up water without interfering with the heating &amp; cooking option on the stove itself . Coming in 25 L these hot water system will heat up the full content of the tank while you are heating or cooking normally &amp; can be used for washing , drinking or even as a heat battery . The 25 L option stores upto 2KWh of energy which means they will continue to heat the room after the fire has gone out.</p>', '<p><strong>Warranty:</strong><span>&nbsp;12 months</span><br><br><span>1. Warranty : &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applies from the date of the tax invoice. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty is applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>2. Actual product may vary as in the picture displayed.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>3. Manufacturer may change the specifications at any time.</span><br></p>', NULL, '<p><span>Weight: 10 kg</span><br><span>Size: 25 Litres</span><br></p>', NULL, '097e6703-7e57-4753-af27-dd64cd0aa10f.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 06:56:05', '2025-10-06 23:29:35', '20000', '19000', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 37, 0),
(134, 'hot-water-hammam-12-ltrs', 'Hot Water Hammam 12 Ltrs', 2, 14, 18, NULL, '<p><strong>Hot Water Hammam 12 Ltrs</strong></p><p>This system uses the waste heat from the exhaust flue to heat up water without interfering with the heating &amp; cooking option on the stove itself . Coming in 12 L these hot water system will heat up the full content of the tank while you are heating or cooking normally &amp; can be used for washing , drinking or even as a heat battery . The 12 L option stores upto 1KWh of energy which means they will continue to heat the room after the fire has gone out.</p>', '<p><strong>Warranty:</strong><span>&nbsp;12 months</span><br><br><span>1. Warranty : &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applies from the date of the tax invoice. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty is applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>2. Actual product may vary as in the picture displayed.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>3. Manufacturer may change the specifications at any time.</span><br></p>', NULL, '<p><span>Weight: 10 kg</span><br><span>Size: 12 Litres</span><br></p>', NULL, '058d77e1-1392-4287-90d2-dc71ebad3c64.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 06:57:25', '2024-12-13 10:26:10', '16000', '15200', NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36, 0),
(135, 'fireplace-deco-tray', 'Fireplace Deco Tray', 2, 14, 18, NULL, '<p><strong>Deco Tray</strong></p><p>The obvious accessory that sets off your Eco rocket stove is a Base Tray to keep the stove off the floor &amp; all the heat &amp; ashes safely contained. The decorated base tray includes an ornate decoration strip around the full perimeter of the tray as well as a special under floor ashtray to catch &amp; tidy up any ashes that might fall out of the door when opening for cleaning or feeding fuel. The base tray also serves to protect your floors from the intense amount of heat generated inside the eco rocket stove . These stoves run much hotter than a typical combustion stove &amp; as a result there is a lot of heat underneath the center of the unit. The base tray keeps this heat above the floor &amp; the extra airflow around the stove helps to warm up the room more quickly.</p>', '<p><strong>Warranty:</strong><span>&nbsp;12 months</span><br><br><span>1. Warranty : &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>2. Actual product may vary as in picture displayed.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>3. Manufacturer may change the specifications at any time.</span><br></p>', '<p><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '5b021730-c40e-4781-b044-513afdad2e17.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 06:59:11', '2024-12-13 10:25:27', '8900', '8459', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 34, 0),
(136, 'fireplace-glass-door', 'Fireplace Glass Door', 2, 14, 18, NULL, '<p><strong>Glass Door</strong></p><p>This is a new fire door kit with the highest quality ceramic glass panel rated for extreme temperatures. The kit is very easy to install onto ECO rocket stove ( ECO 1/2/3 ).</p>', '<p><strong>Warranty:</strong><span>&nbsp;12 months</span><br><br><span>1. Warranty : &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>2. Actual product may vary as in picture displayed.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>3. Manufacturer may change the specifications at any time.</span><br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '789f6bf6-7e19-4d7b-bee4-e6489f70e84b.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 07:00:55', '2024-12-13 10:25:27', '8900', '8459', NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 32, 0),
(137, 'fireplace-pipe-kit', 'Fireplace Pipe Kit', 2, 14, 18, NULL, '<p><strong>Pipe Kit</strong><span><span>&nbsp;</span>set includes 3 * indoor pipe(GI) &amp; a matching elbow for indoor &amp; outdoor . Each length of pipe is 28″ with 2″ overlap.</span><br></p>', NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>Warranty:</strong><span>&nbsp;12 months</span><br><br><span>1. Warranty : &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>2. Actual product may vary as in picture displayed.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>3. Manufacturer may change the specifications at any time.</span><br></p>', NULL, '1e13cda3-7b7f-48c0-b200-b330407b8b2d.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 07:03:09', '2024-12-13 10:25:27', '9000', '8550', NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35, 0),
(138, 'fireplace-simple-tray', 'Fireplace Simple Tray', 2, 14, 18, NULL, '<p><strong>Simple Tray</strong></p><p>The obvious accessory that sets off your Eco rocket stove is a Base Tray to keep the stove off the floor &amp; all the heat &amp; ashes safely contained. The simple base tray has a low edge that runs around the full perimeter of the tray to catch any dirt &amp; ashes that might fall while adding wood or clean the ash tray. The base tray also serves to protect your floors from the intense amount of heat generated inside the eco rocket stove . These stoves run much hotter than a typical combustion stove &amp; as a result there is a lot of heat underneath the center of the unit. The base tray keeps this heat above the floor &amp; the extra airflow around the stove helps to warm up the room more quickly.</p>', NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>Warranty:</strong><span>&nbsp;12 months</span><br><br><span>1. Warranty : &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applies from the date of tax invoicing. Original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>2. Actual product may vary as in picture displayed.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>3. Manufacturer may change the specifications at any time.</span><br></p>', NULL, '50b6b514-3579-4e67-8e49-ab7fdcd108fa.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-05-03 07:04:43', '2024-12-13 10:25:27', '6300', '5989', NULL, NULL, NULL, '#', '#', '#', 33, 0),
(139, 'split-heat-pump-water-heater-imwh-0132-s', 'Split Heat Pump Water Heater : IMWH-0132-S', 4, 6, 37, NULL, '<p><strong>Model No. :</strong><span>&nbsp;IMWH-0132-S</span></p><p>Air-sourced split heat pump in Nepal absorbs heat from the air and transfer it to heat your water. They run on electricity but are roughly three times more efficient than conventional electric water heaters. When used in the right climate conditions they save energy, save money and reduce greenhouse gas emissions.<br>Nepal’s Split Heat Pump works on the same principle as your refrigerator, but instead of pumping heat out of the fridge to keep it cool, they pump heat into the water. Electricity is used to pump a refrigerant around the system, which picks up heat from the air and transfers it to the water.</p><p>The Innmotek’s Split Heat Pump in Nepal is an energy-efficient heating and cooling system designed for use in homes and commercial buildings in Nepal. The Split Heat Pump is an eco-friendly alternative to traditional heating systems as it uses renewable energy from the air, resulting in reduced energy consumption and lower electricity bills. It is also easy to install and maintain, making it a cost-effective solution for homes and businesses in Nepal.</p><p><strong>Features :</strong></p><ul><li>Environmentally friendly refrigerant R410A is used.</li><li>Higher water output temperature: 60°C.</li><li>High-pressure protection.</li><li>Tube in the shell heat exchanger, Hi-COP &amp; safety.</li><li>Automatic startup and shutdown, automatic defrost.</li><li>Close the refrigerant circuit, which is easy to install by a plumber.</li><li>MODBUS communication.</li><li>Built-in circulation water pump.</li></ul><p><strong>Application :</strong></p><ul><li>Suitable for a house with 10-8 people.</li><li>Suitable for Integrating with existing or new thermosiphon thermal solar.</li><li>Ideal for replacing electrical heaters in existing solar water heaters.</li></ul><p>It can be wall hanged. Takes little space.</p><p>Click to learn about our special<span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://sigmatechnologies.com.np/product/packaged-hot-water-heat-pump-500l">Packaged Hot Water Heat Pump System</a></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'db051d77-f04c-4720-ba08-900c520dcb8d.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-09-30 11:27:35', '2025-10-07 23:33:28', NULL, NULL, NULL, '12', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, 0),
(140, 'wood-fired-ecomini-fireplace', 'EcoMini Wood Fired Rocket Stove', 4, 14, 48, NULL, '<p><strong>Himalayan Rocket Stove</strong></p><p><strong>Model: EcoMini</strong></p><p><span>The<span>&nbsp;</span></span><em><strong>“EcoMini”</strong></em><em><strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Rocket Stove<span>&nbsp;</span></strong></em><span>is our latest generation of<span>&nbsp;</span></span><strong>Eco</strong><span>nomical and<span>&nbsp;</span></span><strong>Eco</strong><span>logical combustion engineering. This is the latest version of our combustion heater technology made smaller, lighter and cheaper, but just as<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span><strong>super hot</strong></span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>as ever!! If you want the smallest lightest and hottest stove on the market, this is the unit you have been looking for!</span></p>', NULL, NULL, '<h2>Additional information</h2><table><tbody><tr><th>Weight</th><td>35 kg</td></tr><tr><th>Dimensions</th><td>46 × 33 × 60 cm</td></tr><tr><th>Pipe Kit</th><td><p>None, Pipes – 4500/-</p></td></tr><tr><th>Base Tray</th><td><p>None, Simple Tray – 3000/-, Deco Tray – 4000/-</p></td></tr><tr><th>Hot Water Hamam</th><td><p>None, 12L Hamam, 25L Hamam</p></td></tr></tbody></table>', NULL, '0143bc1a-da1d-4d4f-8861-1c097416f5c1.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-10-02 08:16:28', '2025-10-07 03:39:48', '44770', NULL, 'Promo', '5', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 28, 0),
(141, 'infrared-heater-in-ih-2000-o', 'Infrared Heater (IM-IH-2000-O)', 4, 6, 14, NULL, '<article>\r\n    <p><span>With the infrared heater, you can enjoy the warmth even outdoors. The infrared heater is made for all types of uses, indoor and outdoor.</span></p>\r\n    <p><span>Infrared Heaters are comfortable sun-like heating for outdoor and indoor applications. This heats the objects rather than heating the air. It can be used with Stand or on a Ceiling or Wall Mounted.</span></p>\r\n    <p><span>Our Infrared Heater is the most recommended heating tool for outdoors areas such as Hotels/ Malls, Shopping Commercials, Outdoor Courtyard. It has an adjustable thermostat that enables you to set its temperature according to your requirements. Especially, it’s ideal for cold areas such as houses, shops, hotels etc.</span></p>\r\n    <article>\r\n        <p><span>① Gold graphene lamp, heating energy efficiency is 1.5 times that of ordinary lamp</span></p>\r\n        <p><span>② Hyperboloid sector reflects heat, which is warm and can be equipped with supports</span></p>\r\n        <p><span>③ Three second fast heating, temperature rise without pressure; Large area heating, IP65 waterproof</span></p>\r\n        <p><br></p>\r\n        <p><span><strong>Advantages :\r\n                </strong></span></p>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><span>Comfortable\r\n                </span></li>\r\n            <li><span>Good for Health\r\n                </span></li>\r\n            <li><span>No Smell\r\n                </span></li>\r\n            <li><span>Noiseless\r\n                </span></li>\r\n            <li><span>No Transformation</span></li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n        \r\n        <p><span><strong>Features :</strong>\r\n            </span></p>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><span>High-end design, </span><span>unique structure, </span><span>slim model.\r\n                </span></li>\r\n            <li><span>Over-heat safety protection.\r\n                </span></li>\r\n            <li><span>Curved shape aluminium heating element.\r\n                </span></li>\r\n            <li><span>A wide temperature setting range of  5 C – 45 C\r\n                </span></li>\r\n            <li><span>Digital Remote controller</span></li>\r\n        </ul><br>\r\n    </article>\r\n</article>', '<p><strong>Warranty:</strong><span>&nbsp;12&nbsp;months</span><br><br><span>1. Warranty : &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applies from the date of tax invoice. An original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>2. Actual product may vary as in the picture displayed.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>3. Manufacturer may change the specifications at any time.</span><br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'cc3d3a3b-2e85-4dc8-94df-7406c3fe57f9.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-10-02 15:53:36', '2025-12-05 01:57:52', '15255', NULL, 'Promo', '25', NULL, 'https://bit.ly/48sKBAi', NULL, NULL, 12, 1),
(142, 'patio-infrared-heater-stand-im-ih-3000-p', 'Infrared Patio Heater with Stand (IM-IH-3000-P)', 4, 6, 14, NULL, '<p><strong>IM-IH-3000-P  Infrared Patio Heater with Stand</strong></p><p><strong>Stay Warm and Cozy Outdoors</strong></p><p>Introducing the IM-IH-3000-P Patio Heater, your perfect companion for enjoying outdoor spaces all year round. This high-performance heater is designed to provide efficient and reliable warmth, making it ideal for patios, gardens, and other outdoor areas.</p><p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Powerful Heating:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>With adjustable power settings of 1200W, 1800W, and 3000W, the IM-IH-3000-P ensures optimal warmth for any occasion.</li><li><strong>Carbon Fiber and Halogen Tubes:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Equipped with dual carbon fibre and halogen heating elements, it delivers rapid and consistent heat.</li><li><strong>Adjustable Height:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>The heater’s height can be easily adjusted between 160cm and 210cm to suit your needs.</li><li><strong>Safety First:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Features an anti-dumping protection switch to automatically cut off power in case of accidental tipping.</li><li><strong>Weather Resistant:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>With an IP44 waterproof rating, this heater is built to withstand the elements, ensuring durability and longevity.</li><li><strong>Sleek Design:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>The 74cm  top cover and 45cm base diameter provide stability and a modern aesthetic.</li></ul><p><span>Transform your outdoor experience with the IM-IH-3000-P Patio Heater, combining style, safety, and superior performance. Perfect for any outdoor setting, it ensures you stay warm and comfortable no matter the weather.</span></p>', NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Voltage:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>110V/50Hz (US) or 220V/50Hz (EU/UK/CN)</li><li><strong>Net Weight:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>15.7kg</li><li><strong>Gross Weight:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>19.3kg</li><li><strong>Package Dimensions:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>79cm x 79cm x 37cm</li></ul>', NULL, 'abae4548-cda9-4825-ade3-b505150d51b6.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-10-03 07:29:02', '2025-11-28 02:21:44', '31640', NULL, 'Promo', '15', NULL, 'https://bit.ly/3NEVWUf', NULL, NULL, 9, 0),
(143, 'infrared-concentrated-heater-stand-im-ih-2000-c', 'Infrared Concentrated Heater with Stand (IM-IH-2000-C)', 4, 6, 14, NULL, '<p><strong>IM-IH-2000-C Infrared Concentrated Heater with Stand</strong></p><p><strong>Efficient Heating for Any Space</strong></p><p>The IM-IH-2000-C electric heater is a powerful and efficient heating solution designed to keep you warm and cozy during the coldest months. Its sleek design and multiple power settings make it a versatile addition to any home or office.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Features and Advantages:</strong></p><ul>\r\n<li><strong>Powerful Heating:</strong> With three adjustable power settings (600W, 1300W, and 2000W), you can easily customize the heat output to suit your specific needs.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Energy Efficient:</strong> The quartz tube heating technology ensures rapid heat distribution, minimizing energy consumption and maximizing efficiency.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Adjustable Height:</strong> The telescopic design allows you to adjust the height between 180cm and 210cm, directing heat precisely where you need it most.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Easy to Use:</strong> The simple pull-rope control makes it convenient to operate, even for those who are not tech-savvy.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Safe and Reliable:</strong> Equipped with safety features, including overheat protection, the IM-IH-2000-C provides peace of mind.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Sleek Design:</strong> Its modern and stylish design complements any interior decor, adding a touch of elegance to your space.</li></ul><p><strong>Ideal for:</strong></p><ul>\r\n<li><strong>Living Rooms:</strong> Warm up your living room and create a cozy atmosphere for family gatherings.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Bedrooms:</strong> Enjoy a warm and comfortable sleep, especially during cold nights.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Home Offices:</strong> Stay productive and focused in a well-heated workspace.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Small Spaces:</strong> The targeted heat distribution ensures efficient heating for smaller rooms.</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Voltage:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>220V/50Hz</li><li><strong>Net Weight:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>8.45kg</li><li><strong>Gross Weight:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>9.85kg</li><li><strong>Package Dimensions:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>53cm x 21cm x 53cm</li><li><strong>Top Cover Diameter:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>500mm</li><li><strong>Base Diameter:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>500mm</li></ul>', NULL, 'c7d7c846-6213-4484-8e61-9096362701a6.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-10-03 08:14:35', '2025-10-07 03:36:10', '14125', NULL, 'Promo', NULL, NULL, 'http://bit.ly/3YqOtNo', NULL, NULL, 10, 1);
