(144, 'wood-fire-stove-insert-im-wfs-978459-i', 'Wood Fire Stove Insert (IM-WFS-978459-I)', 4, 6, 34, NULL, '<p><strong>IM-WFS-978459-I Wood Fire Stove Insert</strong></p><p>Elevate your home heating experience with our state-of-the-art Wood Fire Stove Insert. Engineered for efficiency and designed with elegance, this stove insert is the perfect addition to any modern home.</p><p><strong>Unmatched Heating Performance:</strong><br>With a robust rating power of 12KW, our Wood Fire Stove Insert ensures optimal heating for spaces ranging from 150 to 250 square meters. Whether you’re looking to warm up a cozy living room or a larger open-plan area, this stove delivers consistent and powerful heat.</p><p><strong>Sleek and Compact Design:</strong><br>Measuring 974 x 840 x 590 mm, this stove insert is designed to fit seamlessly into your existing fireplace. Its sleek dimensions allow for easy installation without compromising on style or functionality. The modern design complements any interior décor, adding a touch of sophistication to your home.</p><p><strong>Durability and Reliability:</strong><br>Constructed with high-quality materials, this stove insert weighs 152 kg, ensuring stability and longevity. You can rely on its sturdy build to provide warmth and comfort for years to come. The durable construction also means less maintenance and more time enjoying the cozy ambiance of a wood fire.</p><p><strong>Efficient Heating Solution:</strong><br>Our Wood Fire Stove Insert is not just about aesthetics; it’s about performance. The efficient design maximizes heat output while minimizing wood consumption, making it an eco-friendly choice for your home. Enjoy the natural warmth and ambiance of a wood fire, knowing you’re making a sustainable choice.</p><p><strong>Transform Your Living Space:</strong><br>Upgrade your home heating with our Wood Fire Stove Insert and experience the perfect blend of traditional warmth and modern technology. Whether you’re curling up with a book on a chilly evening or entertaining guests, this stove insert creates a welcoming and comfortable environment.</p><hr><p>Make the smart choice for your home heating needs. Choose our Wood Fire Stove Insert and enjoy the benefits of efficient, reliable, and stylish warmth.</p>', NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>Technical Specification:</strong></p><p><strong>Rating Power</strong><span>: 12KW</span><br><strong>Dimensions (LxWxH)</strong><span>: 974 x 840 x 590 mm</span><br><strong>Net Weight</strong><span>: 152 kg</span><br><strong>Heat Area</strong><span>: 150-250 ㎡</span></p>', NULL, 'e863cd05-4a68-4d78-ae0e-d45b1d2f2639.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-10-03 10:45:34', '2026-04-21 04:30:22', '152550', NULL, 'Promo', '10', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 22, 0),
