 of traditional warmth and modern technology. Whether you’re relaxing with family or entertaining guests, this stove creates a welcoming and comfortable environment.</p><hr><p>Choose our Wood Fire Stove for a reliable, efficient, and stylish heating solution that enhances the comfort and beauty of your home</p>', NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>Technical Specification :</strong></p><p><strong>Rating Power</strong><span>: 12KW</span><br><strong>Dimensions (LxWxH)</strong><span>: 974 x 650 x 580 mm</span><br><strong>Net Weight</strong><span>: 140 kg</span><br><strong>Heat Area</strong><span>: 150-250 ㎡</span></p>', NULL, 'b3c88d44-2537-47b6-9f6c-4b0b8bef2409.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-10-03 10:50:06', '2024-12-13 10:25:27', '146900', NULL, 'Promo', '15', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 21, 0),
