(147, 'charcoal-bbq-grill-im-1139', 'Charcoal BBQ Grill (IM-BBQ-1139)', 4, 6, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>IM-BBQ-1139 Charcoal BBQ Grill</strong></p><p>Elevate your outdoor cooking experience with our premium Charcoal BBQ Grill. Designed for both amateur grillers and seasoned BBQ enthusiasts, this grill combines durability, functionality, and style to deliver exceptional grilling performance.</p><p><strong>High-Quality Cooking Grid:</strong><br>The cooking grid is made from SS304 stainless steel, known for its superior resistance to rust and corrosion. This ensures long-lasting durability and easy maintenance, allowing you to enjoy perfectly grilled meals for years to come.</p><p><strong>Generous Cooking Area:</strong><br>With a cooking size of 680 x 325 mm, this grill provides ample space to cook a variety of foods simultaneously. Whether you’re grilling burgers, steaks, vegetables, or seafood, you’ll have plenty of room to prepare delicious meals for family and friends.</p><p><strong>Convenient Side Plate:</strong><br>The side plate, measuring 320 x 240 mm, offers additional space for food preparation and serving. It’s perfect for holding utensils, sauces, and ingredients, keeping everything you need within easy reach while you grill.</p><p><strong>Compact and Sturdy Design:</strong><br>Measuring 1180 x 320 x 900 mm, this grill is designed to fit comfortably in your outdoor space without taking up too much room. Its sturdy construction ensures stability during use, while the sleek design adds a touch of elegance to your backyard or patio.</p><p><strong>Lightweight and Portable:</strong><br>Weighing just 9.1 kg, this charcoal BBQ grill is easy to move and transport, making it ideal for picnics, camping trips, and outdoor gatherings. Despite its lightweight design, it offers robust performance and durability.</p><p><strong>Efficient Charcoal Grilling:</strong><br>Experience the authentic flavor of charcoal grilling with this efficient and easy-to-use BBQ grill. The design allows for optimal heat distribution, ensuring your food is cooked evenly and to perfection every time.</p><hr><p>Upgrade your outdoor cooking setup with our Charcoal BBQ Grill and enjoy the perfect blend of quality, convenience, and style. Whether you’re hosting a summer barbecue or enjoying a quiet evening meal, this grill is your go-to choice for delicious, perfectly grilled food.</p>', NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>Technical Specification :</strong></p><p><strong>Cooking Grid Material</strong>: SS304 Stainless Steel<br><strong>Cooking Size (LxW)</strong>: 680 x 325 mm<br><strong>Side Plate Size (LxW)</strong>: 320 x 240 mm<br><strong>Dimensions (LxWxH)</strong>: 1180 x 320 x 900 mm<br><strong>Net Weight</strong>: 9.1 kg</p>', NULL, 'fa9bbe6b-b72c-4205-bcbb-b103a5367b36.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-10-03 11:12:31', '2024-12-13 10:25:27', '13560', NULL, 'Promo', '15', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 26, 0),
(148, 'charcoal-bbq-grill-nepal-im-1611', 'Charcoal BBQ Grill (IM-BBQ-1611)', 4, 6, 35, NULL, '<p><strong>IM-BBQ-1611 Charcoal BBQ Grill</strong></p><p>Transform your outdoor cooking experience with our versatile and durable Charcoal BBQ Grill. Designed for both casual grillers and BBQ aficionados, this grill offers a perfect combination of functionality, durability, and style.</p><p><strong>Premium Cooking Grid:</strong><br>The cooking grid is crafted from high-quality enamel, providing excellent heat retention and distribution. This ensures your food is cooked evenly, delivering delicious results every time. The enamel coating also makes the grid easy to clean and resistant to rust and corrosion.</p><p><strong>Spacious Cooking Area:</strong><br>With a generous cooking size of 550 x 420 mm, this grill provides ample space to cook a variety of foods simultaneously. Whether you’re grilling burgers, steaks, vegetables, or seafood, you’ll have plenty of room to prepare meals for family and friends.</p><p><strong>Convenient Side Plate:</strong><br>The side plate, measuring 485 x 270 mm, offers additional space for food preparation and serving. It’s perfect for holding utensils, sauces, and ingredients, keeping everything you need within easy reach while you grill. This added convenience enhances your grilling experience, making it more efficient and enjoyable.</p><p><strong>Robust and Stylish Design:</strong><br>Measuring 1240 x 650 x 1150 mm, this grill is designed to be a standout feature in your outdoor space. Its robust construction ensures stability and durability, while the sleek design adds a touch of elegance to your backyard or patio. The grill’s height is ideal for comfortable cooking, reducing the need to bend or stoop.</p><p><strong>Durable and Portable:</strong><br>Weighing 23.8 kg, this charcoal BBQ grill is built to last. Its sturdy construction guarantees long-term reliability, providing you with a dependable grilling solution for years to come. Despite its robust build, the grill is still portable enough to be moved around your outdoor space as needed.</p><p><strong>Efficient Charcoal Grilling:</strong><br>Experience the authentic flavor of charcoal grilling with this efficient and easy-to-use BBQ grill. The design allows for optimal heat distribution, ensuring your food is cooked evenly and to perfection every time. The enamel cooking grid enhances the grilling experience by providing a non-stick surface that is easy to clean.</p><hr><p>Upgrade your outdoor cooking setup with our Charcoal BBQ Grill and enjoy the perfect blend of quality, convenience, and style. Whether you’re hosting a summer barbecue or enjoying a quiet evening meal, this grill is your go-to choice for delicious, perfectly grilled food.</p>', NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>Technical Specification :</strong></p><p><strong>Cooking Grid Material</strong><span>: Enamel</span><br><strong>Cooking Size (LxW)</strong><span>: 550 x 420 mm</span><br><strong>Side Plate Size (LxW)</strong><span>: 485 x 270 mm</span><br><strong>Dimensions (LxWxH)</strong><span>: 1240 x 650 x 1150 mm</span><br><strong>Net Weight</strong><span>: 23.8 kg</span></p>', NULL, '4a9ff46a-09ee-40c6-a22f-90075785b7a6.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-10-03 11:14:40', '2024-12-13 10:25:27', '29380', NULL, 'Promo', '15', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 27, 0),
(149, 'infrared-heater-with-stand-20d', 'Infrared Heater with Stand (THE-FIHP20D)', 4, 6, 14, NULL, '<p>With the infrared heater, you can enjoy the warmth in your home. The infrared heater is made for all types of uses, indoor and outdoor.</p><p>Infrared Heaters with Stands are comfortable sun-like heating for outdoor and indoor applications. This heats the objects rather than heating the air. It can be used with Stand or on a Ceiling or Wall Mounted.</p><p>Our Infrared Heater is the most recommended heating tool for houses or other indoor areas of Nepal. It has an adjustable thermostat that enables you to set its temperature according to your requirements. Especially, it’s ideal for cold areas such as houses, shops, hotels etc.</p><p><u><strong>Advantages :</strong></u><br>Comfortable<br>Good for Health<br>No Smell<br>Noiseless<br>No Transformation</p><p><u><strong>Features :</strong></u><br>High-end design, unique structure, slim model.<br>Over-heat safety protection.<br>Curved shape aluminium heating element.<br>Wall mounted over 1.5-meter hanging height and have wide radiant warm flow.<br>A wide temperature setting range of &nbsp;5 C – 45 C<br>24H timer control with WIFI and Body Sensor<br>Big Attractive LED Display<br>Digital Remote controller</p><p>Check out<span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.sigmatechnologies.com.np/product/infrared-heater-nepal/">Infrared Heater (THE-FIHP18D)</a></p><p>Check out&nbsp;<a href="https://sigmatechnologies.com.np/product/infrared-heater-nepal-20d">Infrared Heater (THE-FIHP20D)</a></p><p>Heating Expert Nepal offers high-quality infrared heating products that are designed to efficiently heat your residential and commercial property. We offer ductless heat pumps, geothermal units, solar energy pumps and other energy-efficient technologies.</p>', '<p><strong>Warranty:</strong><span>&nbsp;12&nbsp;months</span><br><br><span>1. Warranty : &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applies from the date of tax invoice. An original Tax Invoice is required for any warranty claim.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;– Warranty applicable as per manufacturer standard terms of conditions.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>2. Actual product may vary as in the picture displayed.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br><span>3. Manufacturer may change the specifications at any time.</span><br></p>', NULL, '<p><strong>Coverage Area:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Approx. 13 – 18 m<sup>2</sup></p><p><strong>Electricals :</strong><br>Power: 2000 W<br>Volt&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 220V, 1pH<br>Frequency&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 50 Hz</p><p><strong>Physical :</strong><br>Size &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 870 * 160 * 80mm<br>Nett Weight&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 7.5 Kgs.<br>Gross Weight&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 8.5 Kgs<br>Pack Size&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 870 * 160 * 80mm</p>', NULL, '0e544ba9-68d2-4eaf-88ff-64765dfbf25c.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2024-10-27 03:29:12', '2025-07-14 01:39:56', '37200', NULL, 'Hot', '20', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 11, 0),
(155, 'innmotek-air-cooler-im-wc-4642126', 'Innmotek Air Cooler: IM-WC-4642126', 2, 6, 26, NULL, '<ul><li>Air Cooler with stand,</li><li>ABS body with electronic remote control</li><li> Upper &amp; bottom air outlet windows, temperature indicator, detachable water tank</li><li> 4-speed Air Flow: 5000 m^3/h</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '083da8b9-b5ea-46d2-bdee-94925ea5c212.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2024-11-26 05:12:58', '2024-12-13 10:26:08', NULL, NULL, 'Hot', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 38, 0),
(161, 'split-heat-pump-water-heater-imhw-0108-s', 'Split Heat Pump Water Heater : IMHW-0108-S', 1, 6, 37, NULL, '<p><strong>Model No.</strong> : IMHW-0108-S (Innmotek Split Heat Pump)</p><p>Air-sourced split heat pump in nepal absorb heat from the air and transfer it to heat your water. They run on electricity but are roughly three times more efficient than conventional electric water heaters. When used in the right climate conditions, they save energy, save money, and reduce greenhouse gas emissions.<br>Nepal’s Split Heat Pump works on the same principle as your refrigerator, but instead of pumping heat out of the fridge to keep it cool, they pumps heat into the water. Electricity is used to pump a refrigerant around the system, which picks up heat from the air and transfers it to the water.<br></p><p>The Innmotek’s Split Heat Pump in Nepal is an energy-efficient heating and cooling system designed for use in homes and commercial buildings in Nepal. The Split Heat Pump is an eco-friendly alternative to traditional heating systems as it uses renewable energy from the air, resulting in reduced energy consumption and lower electricity bills. It is also easy to install and maintain, making it a cost-effective solution for homes and businesses in Nepal.<br></p><p><strong>Features :</strong><br></p><ul><li>Environmentally friendly refrigerant R410A is used.<br></li><li>Higher water output temperature: 60°C.<br></li><li>High-pressure protection.<br></li><li>Tube in the shell heat exchanger, Hi-COP &amp; safety.<br></li><li>Automatic startup and shutdown, automatic defrost.<br></li><li>Close the refrigerant circuit, easy for a plumber to install.<br></li><li>MODBUS communication.<br></li><li>Built-in circulation water pump.<br></li></ul><p><strong>Application :</strong><br></p><ul><li>Suitable for a house with 10-15 people.<br></li><li>Suitable for integrating with existing or new thermosiphon thermal solar.<br></li><li>Ideal for replacing electrical heaters in existing solar water heaters.<br></li><li>It can be wall-hanged. Takes little space.<br></li></ul><p>Click to know about our special Packaged Hot Water Heat Pump System</p>', NULL, NULL, '<table style="border-collapse:collapse;width: 100%;"><tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Model</td>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">IMHW-0108-S<br></td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Heating Capacity(KW)</td>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">10.8</td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Power Input(KW)</td>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">2.54</td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">COP&nbsp;</td>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">2.25</td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">MAX Power Input (KW)</td>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">2.50</td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Max Current(A)</td>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">15.2</td></tr><tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Refrigerant</td>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">R410A</td></tr><tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Water Pump</td>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Wilo</td></tr><tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Electricals&nbsp;</td>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">20V, 150Hz</td></tr><tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Expansion Value</td>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Electronic&nbsp;</td></tr><tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Air Flow Direction</td>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Horizontal</td></tr><tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Water Pressure Drop (Kpa)</td>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">45</td></tr><tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Ambient Temp</td>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">-15～43 ℃<br></td></tr><tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Noise (dB)</td>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">52</td></tr><tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Water connection (mm)</td>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">20</td></tr><tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Dimensions</td>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">986mm*420mm*798mm</td></tr></tbody></table>', NULL, 'dbc76318-eb24-4cb6-9779-67fab1be508e.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-07-14 01:30:43', '2025-11-28 01:42:24', NULL, NULL, 'Hot', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(162, 'double-stack-parking-system', 'Double Stack Parking System', 1, NULL, 39, NULL, '<p><strong>The dependent stack parking system</strong><br><strong>Doubles up the parking space that matters</strong><br>This mechanical parking system creates parking spaces for two cars, one at the ground level and another on the platform above. The lower car needs to be driven out to use the upper platform. This system guarantees trouble-free parking and retrieval of the vehicle in a multi-level parking setup.</p><p><strong>Key Benefits:</strong></p><ul><li>Ideal for residential buildings and commercial projects<br></li><li>Increases the capacity of underground multi-level parking spaces at hospitals, malls, cinema halls, hotels, etc.<br></li><li>It can also be used as an outdoor mechanical parking system<br></li><li>Provides 2 spaces in the footprint of 1 car<br></li><li>The amount of space used can be reduced by up to 50 percent compared to conventional parking spaces<br></li><li>Leaves space for additional amenities<br></li><li>Accommodates cars safely<br></li><li>Protection from theft and damage<br></li><li>Sequential vertical movement of a platform<br></li><li>Simple key switch controls<br></li><li>Optimal access times</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '<p>Suitable for all passenger cars according to clearance &amp; maximum surface load<br></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;width: 100%;"><tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 44.6246%;">Maximum Weight Carrying Capacity<br></td>\r\n	<td style="width: 55.2048%;">2000-2600 Kg<br></td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n	<td>Allowable Car Height<br></td>\r\n	<td>1.5m – 2.0m<br></td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n	<td>Platform Width<br></td>\r\n	<td>2.0m – 2.7m<br></td></tr></tbody></table>', NULL, 'd64bce1e-4c41-41f3-8695-f7cf2e756f53.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-07-14 04:03:05', '2025-07-14 04:49:03', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(163, '2-level-puzzle-parking-system', '2-Level Puzzle Parking System', 1, NULL, 39, NULL, '<p><strong>Puzzle parking system without a pit</strong><br><strong>Efficient Mechanical Parking System for Ground + One Level</strong><br>The P-210 is a smart mechanical parking system that offers an optimized parking solution for ground level plus one level above, making it ideal for space-constrained areas.<br><br>The entrance to the P-210 is at ground level for easy access. This advanced puzzle parking system arranges cars on two levels, positioned side by side in a structured grid format. The parking spaces move vertically and horizontally, ensuring smooth transportation to the desired position.<br><br>In this puzzle parking system, one level is at ground level while the other is overground, maximizing parking efficiency without requiring a pit. This system can accommodate between 3 and 19 cars and 2-10 grids, providing a highly flexible and space-saving mechanical parking system for various applications.</p><p><strong>Key Benefits:</strong></p><ul><li>Ideal for residential buildings and commercial projects<br></li><li>Increases the capacity of underground parking spaces at hospitals, malls, cinema halls, hotels, etc.<br></li><li>The puzzle parking system efficiently provides 3 spaces in the footprint of 2 cars and can scale up to 19 spaces in the footprint of 10 cars<br></li><li>Leaves space for additional amenities<br></li><li>Accommodates cars safely with protection from theft and damage<br></li><li>Safety gates are available upon requirement<br></li><li>Sequential horizontal and vertical movements of platforms ensure smooth operation in the mechanical parking system<br></li><li>Optimal access times with simple key switch controls<br></li><li>Ground-level access to all parking levels<br></li><li>An independent system that enhances parking efficiency with puzzle parking technology</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '<p>The mechanical parking system is designed to accommodate all passenger cars while ensuring optimal clearance and maximal surface load.<br></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;width: 100%;"><tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Maximum Weight Carrying Capacity<br></td>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">2000-2600 kg<br></td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Allowable Car Height<br></td>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">1.5 m – 2.0 m<br></td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Upper Platform Width<br></td>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">2.2 m – 2.7 m<br></td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Lower Platform Width<br></td>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">2.0 m – 2.4 m<br></td></tr></tbody></table>', NULL, '0755f870-68b3-40b3-b215-7af0c7bcfa3b.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-07-14 04:18:10', '2025-07-14 04:26:07', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(164, '3-level-puzzle-parking-system', '3-Level Puzzle Parking System', 1, NULL, 39, NULL, '<p><strong>Puzzle parking system with 3 parking levels</strong><br><strong>Maximize Space with the P-310 Mechanical Parking System</strong><br>The P-310 is an innovative mechanical parking system that creates more parking spaces in a compact area, making it an ideal solution for urban environments.<br><br>The entrance to the P-310 is at ground level, ensuring easy access. This advanced puzzle parking system efficiently arranges cars on three levels and side by side in a structured grid format. The parking spaces move vertically and horizontally—either down into the pit or up to the third parking level, allowing seamless retrieval of vehicles.<br><br>By optimizing floor area usage, this mechanical parking system accommodates more cars within the same space. The system can scale up to 5-29 cars and 2-10 grids, making it a highly flexible and space-efficient puzzle parking solution.</p><p><strong>Key Benefits:</strong><br></p><ul><li>Ideal for residential buildings and commercial projects<br></li><li>Increases the capacity of underground parking spaces at hospitals, malls, cinema halls, hotels, etc.<br></li><li>The puzzle parking system efficiently provides 5 spaces in the footprint of 2 cars and can scale up to 29 spaces in the footprint of 10 cars<br></li><li>Leaves space for additional amenities<br></li><li>Accommodates cars safely with protection from theft and damage<br></li><li>Safety gates are available upon requirement<br></li><li>Sequential horizontal and vertical movements of platforms ensure smooth operation in the mechanical parking system<br></li><li>Optimal access times with simple key switch controls<br></li><li>Ground-level access to all parking levels<br></li><li>An independent system that enhances parking efficiency using puzzle parking technology.<br></li><li>P-310 Puzzle Parking References</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '<p>The mechanical parking system is designed to accommodate all passenger cars while ensuring optimal clearance and maximal surface load.<br></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;width: 100%;"><tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Maximum Weight Carrying Capacity<br></td>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">2000-2600 kg<br></td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Allowable Car Height<br></td>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">1.5 m – 2.0 m<br></td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Upper Platform Width<br></td>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">2.2 m – 2.7 m<br></td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Lower Platform Width<br></td>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;"> 2.0 m – 2.4 m<br></td></tr></tbody></table>', NULL, '58de32f8-3850-40e9-b7fd-56e6babc01b5.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-07-14 04:33:30', '2025-07-14 04:53:09', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(165, 'tower-parking-system', 'Tower Parking System', 1, NULL, 39, NULL, '<p><strong>The premium fully automatic parking system that takes a vertical approach</strong><br><strong>KLAUS Automatic Parking System – Smart, Space-Saving Solution</strong><br>An automatic parking system from KLAUS Multiparking is the ideal choice when floor space is limited. Instead of expanding outward, this innovative mechanical parking system is designed to be either tall or deep. A lift transports vehicles to a free parking space, where they are securely stored across multiple levels.<br><br>The automatic parking system ensures short access times while utilizing minimal floor space. An additional vehicle turntable inside the entry room eliminates the need to reverse your car. Whether it’s a standard car or an SUV, the system automatically detects the height of the vehicle and assigns the appropriate parking space.<br><br>In addition to standard configurations, customized solutions for varying car dimensions and weights are available. The system can also be adapted to meet individual project requirements.</p><p><strong>Key Benefits:</strong></p><ul><li>Ideal for residential buildings and commercial projects<br></li><li>Increases underground parking capacity at hospitals, malls, cinema halls, hotels, etc.<br></li><li>The space required can be reduced by up to 50% compared to conventional parking<br></li><li>Leaves extra building space for additional parking or more profitable purposes<br></li><li>Reduces construction time<br></li><li>Customizable in both steel and RCC structures<br></li><li>Can fit within the footprint of 3 cars<br></li><li>Extendable up to 25 parking levels<br></li><li>Customizable up to 5 cars per parking level<br></li><li>Offers variable car dimensions and level heights as options<br></li><li>Extended vehicle weighing capacity available as an option<br></li><li>Integrated vehicle turntable for enhanced convenience<br></li><li>Lift-based mechanical parking system for seamless vertical transportation<br></li><li>Eliminates the need for narrow ramps or dark entrances<br></li><li>Ensures optimal access times with a quick parking and retrieval cycle, boasting 99% uptime<br></li><li>Provides a secure environment, protecting cars from theft and damage<br></li><li>Automatic parking system operation via RFID tags and touch screens<br></li><li>Equipped with motion sensors for human safety<br></li><li>Eco-friendly with zero CO₂ emissions during operation<br></li><li>Low operational noise (below 65dB</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '<p>Suitable for all passenger cars based on clearance and maximum surface load</p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;width: 100%;"><tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Maximum Weight Carrying Capacity<br></td>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">2000-2600kg<br></td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Allowable Car Height<br></td>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">1.5 m – 1.7 m<br></td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">Platform Width<br></td>\r\n	<td style="width: 50%;">1.9 m – 2.0 m<br></td></tr>\r\n</tbody></table>', NULL, '57950b5c-c40b-4c73-87a0-7b35ae14bf3e.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-07-14 04:42:28', '2025-07-14 04:53:25', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(166, 'parking-management-elements', 'Parking Management Elements', 1, NULL, 40, NULL, '<p><strong>Boom Barrier, Vehicle Identification, RFID, Access Control, Security Bollards, Ticketing, ANPR Camera &amp; EV Charging Systems</strong></p><p>We provide a comprehensive range of advanced services catering to security, access, and operations, whether for residential colonies, commercial facilities, or public areas. Our systems allow for seamless management of vehicular entry, high security, and modern-day conveniences. <br><br><strong>1. Boom Barriers</strong><br>Boom barriers form one of the basic elements in any access control system, providing a solid physical barrier against entry and exit into an area. Our boom barriers are designed to control the flow of traffic at entry points, parking sites, and toll plazas and offer fast opening and closing speeds with operation suitable for high frequency. They are heavily built with quality materials ensuring resistance to all weather conditions, and can be linked with other access control systems for operation. <br><br><strong>2. Vehicle Identification Systems</strong><br>Our vehicle identification systems offer superior vehicle recognition for secure access control. Leveraging modern technologies, these systems allow entry of authorized vehicles in a short time period, track all their movements, and provide an automatic entry and exit system. This better security system cuts manual interference and improves traffic flow efficiency.<br><br><strong>3. RFID (Radio-Frequency Identification) Systems</strong><br>RFID technology is an efficient means to control vehicle access with a high level of security. Our RFID systems include tags attached to vehicles that communicate with readers placed at the entry points. This allows swift authentication without physical card swiping or ticket presentation. The best uses of RFID for quick and secure access are in residential communities, corporate campuses, and commercial parking lots.<br><br><strong>4. Access-Control Systems</strong><br>Our check-and-balance access control systems are in place to provide centralized management over things that may be allowed to enter and exit your premises. In addition to vehicle control, pedestrian entry may also be controlled at gates and doors using authentication systems such as RFID, biometrics, scanners, and keypads. They include setting access permissions, real-time monitoring, and detailed reporting for a secure and controlled environment, in line with your particular set of security policies.<br><br><strong>5. Security Bollards</strong><br>Security bollards are very important physical barriers; they protect sensitive areas from illegal intrusion or ramming by vehicles. With various options, such as fixed, removable, automatic retractable, or semi-automatic, our bollards form a formidable defense against pedestrian areas, building perimeters, and high-security checkpoints. These are very highly impact-resistant, thus providing strong protection, without interfering with aesthetic considerations.<br><br><strong>6. Ticketing Systems</strong><br>Our ticketing system is in place to ease the entire parking management and revenue collection operation for commercial parking lots, event venues, or public garages. These are automated systems for parking ticket issuing and validation, processing payment, and parsing data for operational analyses. Convenience is key to the user experience with faster entry &amp; exit with the least waiting time, while parking fees are fairly and properly managed.<br><br><strong>7. ANPR Cameras</strong><br>ANPR cameras are intelligent surveillance devices that automatically read and record vehicle license plate details. When integrated with our access control and security systems, the ANPR technology provides automation for vehicle identification, blacklist/whitelist management, and real-time alerting of suspicious vehicles. This has special application in law enforcement, traffic control, and area security at critical points of entry and exit by providing for accurate and verifiable vehicle data.<br><br><strong>8. EV Charging Systems</strong><br>In an age where the electric vehicle is increasingly popular, their chargers become an important amenity for any modern property. We provide the full spectrum of chargers, from slower AC chargers for homes and businesses to fast-charging DC chargers for public and fleet applications. These charging systems are designed for reliability, simple operation, and can be integrated with existing building management systems or parking systems to provide a useful amenity to residents, employees, and visitors.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2221e789-7037-49e4-afbe-1775d6ed8ccd.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-07-14 06:31:22', '2025-07-14 06:31:22', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(167, 'rechargeble-solar-dc-smart-air-cooler-im-wc-3838116', 'Rechargeble Solar/DC Smart Air Cooler( IM-WC-3838116)', 1, 6, 64, NULL, '<p>Stay cool and comfortable anywhere with the ultimate in portable, eco-friendly cooling. The Rechargeable Solar/DC Smart Air Cooler is engineered to provide powerful, refreshing air in any setting, whether you’re at home, off-grid, or simply enjoying the outdoors.</p>', NULL, NULL, '<p>Model : IM-WC-3838116 (SF-60EN)<br>Cooling Area: 20-35 sq.&nbsp;m<br>Control Type: Remote / Touch/ App control<br>Airflow: 4000m3/Hr, 3 speeds.<br>Wind Distance: 12M<br>Working Voltage: 220V/24V<br>Output Power: 200W<br>Water Tank: 25L<br>Product Dimensions(L*W*H): 385*380*1160mm (0.17CBM)<br>N.W/G.W:13.8/14.8KG</p>', NULL, 'fc0ee122-4c45-43cd-904c-d3b998dfb2a9.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-23 03:57:05', '2025-10-07 00:49:35', '36275', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(168, 'air-cooler-im-wc-4642126', 'Air Cooler (IM-WC-4642126)', 1, 6, 64, NULL, '<p>Electronic intelligent remote control, four-speed adjustment. The model is beautiful and elegant, energy saving and power saving vientiane runner, mobile and portable<br><br>Air Cooler with stand, ABS body with electronic remote control, Upper &amp; bottom air outlet windows, temperature indicator, detachable water tank, 4-speed Air Flow: 5000 m3/h</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '4f17cf92-a10a-416d-ba1f-efba4827ce3a.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-23 04:03:13', '2025-10-07 00:50:20', '54240', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(169, 'grease-separator', 'Grease Separator', 1, 6, 42, NULL, '<p>INNMOTEK Grease separators can be found in almost every food service project in India. Hugely customized versions in hotels, restaurants, take-away food establishments, highway rest stops, hospitals, and office buildings, as well as standard in petrol stations, CTNs, and other retail outlets with serving counters, because this unit isn’t typically recessed into the ground. The top cover isn’t designed for traffic loading and will have a sealed, removable cover. This unit has a simple-to-remove cover that is securely fastened and locked down. If necessary, a specially designed sampling point on the outlet can be provided so that water exiting the unit can be tested at any time<br>Recommended for:<br>Hotels, Garage forecourts &amp; Coffee shops</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '129417b2-fc5f-4b03-9ae9-b09a38bf76f7.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-23 04:45:18', '2025-09-23 04:45:18', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(170, 'hamro-pani-wall-mounted-water-dispenser', 'Hamro Pani Wall Mounted Water Dispenser', 1, 6, 69, NULL, '<p>The Wall-Mounted Instant Hot Water Dispenser is a modern and space-saving solution designed for home or office use. Its sleek, wall-mounted design frees up valuable counter space while providing instant access to hot water on demand.<br><br>Five Safety Protection: Prevent water leak, electric leak, dry burning, frost damage and child safety lock, Thick-Film Heating Technology: Fast and precise heating, No repeatedly boiled water, One-Touch Cleaning Function: Ensure fresh and pure water, &nbsp;Food Grade Materials: Safe and healthy, no odor,  Water Outlet with Vapor Separation Design: Prevent steam emission and water splashing, Removable Water Tray, Easy to clean and prevent water accumulation, &nbsp;Silicon Crystal Material Screen Beautiful, eco-friendly, and durable, &nbsp;Boiling Point Adjustment: Adjustable based on different altitudes, Turn off and water stop, No dripping water.</p>', NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p><p>Power Consumption : 220V/50Hz, 2200W<br>Standby Power Consumption: 0.09kW ·h/24h<br>Hot Water Output: 90℃&nbsp; 20L/h <br>Water Inlet Pressure: 0.1MPa-0.4MPa<br>Ambient Temp./Humidity : 4℃~40℃, ≦90%<br>Size(L*W*H)/Weight : 291×137×371mm, 3KG<br>Water source: Drinkable pure water<br>Match: Match RO purifier<br></p>', NULL, '9906a591-7e7b-4409-a87e-82062d16eb96.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-23 05:26:11', '2025-10-07 00:46:28', '31414', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(171, 'hamro-pani-bullet-ice-maker', 'Hamro Pani Bullet Ice Maker', 1, 6, 70, NULL, '<p>The Portable Bullet Ice Maker is a compact and efficient appliance designed to provide a continuous supply of bullet-shaped ice cubes. Its small size makes it perfect for use in home bars, kitchens, RVs, or for special events.<br><br>Piston Compressor: Low Noise, energy efficient, fast cooling, Suitable for Multiple Scenarios: Home, office, dormitory, in-car, camping, 3-Layer Cold Retention Barrier: Food-grade materials, Thick high-density foam layer, ABS resin layer, 3 Convenient Features: Removable and washable ice basket, Portable water addition, Quick drainage port.</p>', NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p><p>Power Consumption : 220V/50Hz,170W<br>Water Tank: 1.4L<br>Ice Shape: Bullet (Small, Big)<br>Refrigerant/Charge: R600a/25g<br>Add Water: Manually add pure water<br>Ice Making Capacity: 12kg/24h<br>Size(L*W*H)/Weight : 225×300×290mm,6.2KG</p>', NULL, 'ff7bf1d4-3b90-4331-a296-13080a0fbd75.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-23 05:31:44', '2025-10-07 00:47:16', '21018', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(172, 'hamro-pani-cube-ice-maker', 'Hamro Pani Cube Ice Maker', 1, 6, 70, NULL, '<p>The Portable Ice Cube Maker is a compact and efficient appliance designed to provide a continuous supply of bullet-shaped ice cubes. Its small size makes it perfect for use in home bars, kitchens, RVs, or for special events.<br><br>Piston Compressor: Low Noise, energy efficient, fast cooling<br>Suitable for Multiple Scenarios: Home, office, shopping mall, small bar<br>3-Layer Cold Retention Barrier:  Food-grade materials, Thick high-density foam layer, ABS resin layer, 3 Convenient Features: Removable and washable ice basket, Portable water addition, Quick drainage port.</p>', NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p><p>Power Consumption: 220V/50Hz,160W<br>Upper WaterTank: 1.8L<br>Ice Shape: Cube<br>Refrigerant /Charge: R290A/20g<br>Add Water: Manually add pure water<br>Ice Making Capacity: 25kg/24h<br>Size(L*W*H)/Weight : 250×300×460mm,9.2KG</p>', NULL, '33b36d68-206c-470a-858a-6bff7633e3ce.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-23 05:38:15', '2025-10-07 00:48:12', '33335', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(173, 'water-ionizers', 'Water Ionizers', 1, 6, 71, NULL, '<p>The water ionizers are&nbsp;countertop units that produce alkaline, acidic, and purified water from tap water. This is the more advanced "luxury" model &amp; standard "home" model, with the main characteristics  being the number of electrolysis plates and the maximum pH/ORP values.&nbsp;<br>Shared features<br>Both models share the following features:&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Plate material:&nbsp;Platinum-titanium plates manufactured by KOBE Steel in Japan.</li><li>Filter:&nbsp;A single activated carbon fiber (ACF) filter, which is NSF-certified and made in the USA. The filter lifespan is approximately 6,000 liters, depending on the quality of the source water.<br></li><li>Cleaning:&nbsp;Both feature a 10-second automatic cleansing cycle after each use of alkaline water to prolong the life of the electrolysis plates.<br></li><li>Interface:&nbsp;A multi-functional LCD screen displays the pH level, ORP, water flow rate, and filter life.<br></li><li>Electrolysis:&nbsp;Continuous electrolysis with a built-in flow meter</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '38e7adde-d5bf-43d2-9d58-8ba32bc0396f.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-23 05:43:14', '2025-10-07 03:35:16', '175150', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(174, 'innmotek-pool-cover', 'Innmotek Pool Cover', 1, 6, 55, NULL, '<p>A swimming pool cover, also known as a solar blanket bubble wrap floating on the water''s surface. These sheets are designed to trap heat from the sun, transmit the heat to the pool, and keep the temperature of the water in the pool warm. Innmotek Pool Cover helps to extend the life of the swimming pool. It also traps heat and prevents it from escaping into the cool night air. They also prevent leaves and other debris from falling into the water, thereby assisting in pool maintenance.<br><br><strong>INNMOTEK QUALITY AND SERVICE</strong><br>Our purpose is to provide world-class products to our customers, supported by best-in-class&nbsp;quality and services. We back our product with research and development to deliver globally leading, high-performing products that last longer at competitive prices. Our efficient production, dispatch, delivery, and sales representation continue to be our defining attributes.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'bbc1a584-bbbf-4afe-8f47-cbd969b8ec9d.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-23 05:53:49', '2025-09-23 05:53:49', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(175, 'innmotek-pool-salt-chlorinator', 'Innmotek Pool Salt Chlorinator', 1, 6, 56, NULL, '<p>Transform your pool care with the Innmotek Pool Salt Chlorinator-no more buying or handling harsh chlorine. It harnesses efficient salt electrolysis to generate fresh, skin-friendly sanitizer automatically, eliminating chemical odors and reducing maintenance. Equipped with intuitive controls, safety alarms, and durable titanium components, it ensures reliable performance and effortless operation. Ideal for modern pool maintenance, the Innmotek Salt Chlorinator keeps water clean, clear, and welcoming, with minimal effort.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '4c37c987-4626-4c8a-a9a8-2919ec8a73cd.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-23 05:59:01', '2025-09-23 05:59:01', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(176, 'robotic-pool-cleaner1', 'Robotic Pool Cleaner', 1, 6, 8, NULL, '<p>Experience effortless pool maintenance with the Innmotek Robotic Pool Cleaner. Equipped with advanced sensors and an intelligent navigation system, it maps your pool layout to deliver fast, efficient cleaning-reducing cleaning time by up to 60%. Its powerful filtration leaves your pool sparkling clear, while energy-efficient operation saves both time and cost. Robust, durable, and intuitive, the Innmotek Cleaner ensures your pool stays pristine with minimal effort.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '7c9d205d-fe60-4d4b-87a2-63f6ac1c7c91.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-23 06:04:42', '2025-09-23 06:04:42', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO "products" ("id", "slug", "title", "user_id", "brand_id", "category_id", "summary", "description", "warranty", "specification", "installation", "download", "image", "seo_title", "seo_description", "seo_keyword", "status", "created_at", "updated_at", "price", "sale_price", "type", "stock", "shops", "daraz_link", "hardware_pasal_link", "mero_pasal_link", "order", "order_status") VALUES
(177, 'midea-esg-inv-m-series-20-kw-pool-heat-pump', 'Midea_ESG-Inv M Series 20 KW Pool Heat Pump', 1, 3, 54, NULL, '<p>The Midea ESG-Inv M Series is a line of high-efficiency, inverter-driven heat pumps designed to heat and cool swimming pool water. The series is part of Midea''s commitment to "Net-Zero" products, incorporating recyclable materials and smart energy management features.&nbsp;<br><strong>Feature:</strong><br></p><ul><li>Heating &amp; Cooling Function<br></li><li>App control &amp; intelligent remote maintenance<br></li><li>Free capacity up to 44% than the rating condition on 27 ℃<br></li><li>No capacity attenuation from 27 ℃ &nbsp;to 15 ℃ &nbsp;in boost mode&nbsp;<br></li><li>Silence mode down to 38dB(A) at 1m distance<br></li><li>Target Temperature Achievement Display (%)<br></li><li>Energy Consumption Indicator<br></li><li>R32 Refrigerant<br></li><li>ABS+ASA coated appearance<br></li><li>Moisture proof<br></li><li>Weather resistant</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>Specification:</strong></p><ul><li>Model: MSC-200D2N8-A<br></li><li>Power supply: 220~240V-1Ph-50Hz<br></li><li>Capacity: 20KW<br></li><li>Net weight: 53KG<br></li><li>Gross weight: 59KG<br></li><li>Net size: 1068mm×523mm×865mm<br></li><li>Carton size: 1190mm×560mm×1000mm</li></ul>', NULL, 'b4abe898-8957-415a-ac06-958b723e3acf.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-23 06:23:01', '2025-09-23 06:23:01', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(178, 'innmotek-50kw-swimming-pool-heat-pump', 'Innmotek 50kw Swimming Pool Heat Pump', 1, 6, 54, NULL, '<p>An Innmotek 50kW swimming pool heat pump is&nbsp;a commercial-grade heating unit designed for large pools or commercial applications. While specific model details can vary, these heat pumps are characterized by high-efficiency operation using environmentally friendly refrigerants, durable construction, and advanced features for consistent temperature control.&nbsp;<br></p><p><strong>General features and technology</strong><br></p><ul><li>Heating and cooling capability:&nbsp;Most models can both heat and cool the pool water, allowing for temperature control year-round.<br></li><li>High efficiency:&nbsp;The 50kW rating refers to the unit''s heating capacity. InnmoTek heat pumps, particularly inverter models, are designed to be energy-efficient. Their Coefficient of Performance (COP) indicates the unit''s efficiency in converting electrical energy into heat energy, resulting in low operating costs.<br></li><li>DC inverter technology:&nbsp;Higher-end InnmoTek models feature DC inverter technology, which allows the compressor and fan speed to adjust continuously. This provides more precise temperature control and higher efficiency compared to older on/off technology.<br></li><li>Titanium heat exchanger:&nbsp;The heat exchanger is constructed from titanium to resist corrosion from pool chemicals like chlorine, ensuring longevity.<br></li><li>Digital controls:&nbsp;A user-friendly digital display and controller allow for easy temperature adjustments and monitoring of the system.<br></li><li>Safety features:&nbsp;Built-in safety features like high-pressure protection and water flow switches prevent damage to the unit.<br></li><li>Quiet operation:&nbsp;Compared to traditional pool heaters, heat pumps operate quietly, making them less disruptive.<br></li><li>Environmentally friendly:&nbsp;Newer models often use eco-friendly refrigerants such as R32 or R410a.&nbsp;<br></li></ul><p><strong>Typical specifications for a 50kW commercial model</strong><br>The exact specifications, particularly the electrical requirements and dimensions, depend on the specific model variation (e.g., non-inverter vs. inverter). Based on similar units, a 50kW model would typically have the following characteristics:&nbsp;<br></p><ul><li>Recommended for pools:&nbsp;Up to 150,000 liters or for commercial pools that need a fast, powerful heating solution.<br></li><li>Power supply:&nbsp;380V (3-phase) power is common for commercial units of this size.<br></li><li>Power input:&nbsp;A 50kW heating capacity unit would likely have an electrical power input of approximately 8 to 10kW, though this is dependent on the COP.<br></li><li>Noise level:&nbsp;Typically operates under 65 dBA.<br></li><li>Water flow rate:&nbsp;A recommended water flow rate is needed to ensure efficient heat exchange.<br></li><li>Size and weight:&nbsp;Dimensions and weight vary, but these are large units, weighing several hundred kilograms.&nbsp;<br></li></ul><p><strong>Ideal applications</strong><br>An&nbsp;INNMOTEK 50kW heat pump&nbsp;is best suited for scenarios that require large-scale, cost-effective, and consistent pool heating:&nbsp;<br></p><ul><li>Commercial pools:&nbsp;Health clubs, hotels, resorts, and wellness centers.<br></li><li>Large residential pools:&nbsp;Expansive backyard pools where a high heating capacity is required.<br></li><li>Indoor swimming facilities:&nbsp;For precise year-round temperature control.<br></li><li>Aquaculture and therapy pools:&nbsp;For specialized heating requirements.&nbsp;</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>Specification:</strong></p><ul><li>Model: MSC-200D2N8-A<br></li><li>Power supply: 220~240V-1Ph-50Hz<br></li><li>Capacity: 20KW<br></li><li>Net weight: 53KG<br></li><li>Gross weight: 59KG<br></li><li>Net size: 1068mm×523mm×865mm<br></li><li>Carton size: 1190mm×560mm×1000mm</li></ul>', NULL, '3040a5c8-0163-49b0-935b-fab564f0c0f9.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-23 06:28:05', '2025-09-23 06:28:05', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(179, 'electric-floor-heating-system', 'Danfoss Electric Floor Heating System', 1, NULL, 66, NULL, '<p><strong>Danfoss Electric Underfloor Heating System with LX Cable and Smart ECtemp Thermostat</strong><br>Experience unparalleled comfort and energy efficiency with our advanced electric underfloor heating solution, featuring the reliable Danfoss LX Cable and the intelligent Danfoss ECtemp Smart Thermostat. This system provides a luxurious warmth that radiates evenly throughout your space, creating a cozy and inviting atmosphere.<br></p><p><strong>Key Components:</strong><br></p><p><strong>Danfoss LX Cable:</strong> This high-quality heating cable is designed for durability and optimal heat distribution. It''s suitable for various floor constructions and ensures efficient warming, making your floors delightfully warm to the touch. The LX Cable is engineered for long-lasting performance and easy installation, providing a consistent and comfortable heating experience.<br></p><p><strong>Danfoss ECtemp Smart Thermostat: </strong>Take control of your comfort with the intuitive ECtemp Smart Thermostat. This intelligent device allows you to manage your underfloor heating system with precision, ensuring optimal energy consumption and personalized warmth.&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Smart Control: Easily program heating schedules to match your lifestyle, ensuring warmth when you need it and energy savings when you don''t.<br></li><li>Remote Access: Control your heating from anywhere using a smartphone app, providing convenience and flexibility.<br>oAdaptive Learning: The thermostat learns your heating patterns and adapts to optimize energy usage, further enhancing efficiency.<br>oStylish Design: Its modern and sleek design seamlessly blends with any interior décor.<br></li></ul><p><strong>Benefits of the System:</strong><br></p><p><strong>Superior Comfort:</strong> Enjoy consistent, gentle heat that eliminates cold spots and drafts, providing a truly comfortable living or working environment.<br></p><p><strong>Energy Efficiency:</strong> The precise control offered by the ECtemp Smart Thermostat, combined with the efficient LX Cable, helps reduce energy consumption and lower heating bills.<br></p><p><strong>Space Saving:</strong> Underfloor heating eliminates the need for radiators, freeing up wall space and offering greater design flexibility.<br></p><p><strong>Healthier Environment:</strong> Reduces air circulation and dust movement compared to traditional heating systems, contributing to better indoor air quality.<br></p><p><strong>Easy Installation &amp; Maintenance: </strong>Designed for straightforward installation and requiring minimal maintenance, ensuring a hassle-free heating solution.<br></p><p>This integrated Danfoss system offers a modern, efficient, and comfortable heating solution for any property, providing warmth exactly where and when you need it.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'be840fdc-7312-4401-9b24-f08a3d427a4f.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-25 23:46:39', '2026-06-12 11:10:24', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(180, 'hydronic-underfloor-heating-system', 'Hydronic Underfloor Heating System', 1, 10, 66, NULL, '<p><strong>Hydronic Underfloor Heating System: Efficient Comfort with PEX Pipes and Heat Pumps</strong><br>Discover the ultimate in home comfort and energy efficiency with a hydronic underfloor heating system. This advanced radiant heating solution circulates warm water through a network of pipes embedded beneath your floor, providing consistent, gentle warmth that rises naturally, enveloping your space in comfort.<br></p><p><strong>How it Works:</strong><br>At the heart of a hydronic system, a heat pump (or boiler) heats water to a controlled temperature. This warmed water is then circulated through a closed loop of durable PEX pipes laid out in a specific pattern within your floor. As the warm water flows, it radiates heat upward through the floor surface, warming objects and occupants directly, rather than just the air. This method creates a stable and comfortable indoor environment with no drafts or cold spots.<br></p><p><strong>Key Components:</strong><br></p><p><strong>Heat Pump: </strong>An incredibly efficient and eco-friendly heat source, an air-to-water or ground-source heat pump extracts heat from the outside environment and transfers it to the water circulating through your underfloor system. Heat pumps are highly efficient at the lower operating temperatures required for underfloor heating, leading to significant energy savings and reduced carbon emissions.<br></p><p><strong>PEX (Cross-linked Polyethylene) Pipes:</strong> These flexible, durable, and corrosion-resistant pipes are the backbone of the hydronic system. PEX pipes (often PEX-A or PEX-AL-PEX with an aluminum core for enhanced stability and heat retention) are ideal for underfloor heating due to their:<br></p><ul><li><strong>Flexibility and Ease of Installation:</strong> Allowing for intricate layouts and quick setup.<br>oDurability: Designed for long-term performance, often lasting 25-50 years.<br></li><li><strong>Corrosion and Scale Resistance:</strong> Ensuring consistent water flow and minimal maintenance.<br>oExcellent Heat Retention: Minimizing heat loss during water circulation.<br></li></ul><p><strong>Manifold:</strong> This central distribution hub receives the heated water from the heat pump and distributes it evenly to individual heating zones or loops within the floor. Manifolds allow for precise control over water flow to different areas, enabling zone-specific temperature management.<br></p><p><strong>Expansion Tank:</strong> An essential safety and performance component, the expansion tank accommodates the thermal expansion and contraction of water within the sealed hydronic system. As water heats up, it expands, increasing pressure. The expansion tank absorbs this increased volume, preventing excessive pressure buildup and protecting system components from damage. It ensures consistent pressure and extends the lifespan of the entire heating system.<br></p><p><strong>Thermostats and Controls:</strong> Smart thermostats (like the Danfoss ECtemp Smart, if integrated) and control systems allow you to program heating schedules, set desired temperatures for different zones, and even control your system remotely via a smartphone app, optimizing comfort and energy usage.<br></p><p><strong>Benefits of Hydronic Underfloor Heating:</strong><br></p><ul><li><strong>Unrivaled Comfort: </strong>Provides a gentle, even heat that warms surfaces and objects, eliminating cold spots and creating a truly comfortable living space.<br></li><li><strong>Exceptional Energy Efficiency:</strong> Operates at lower water temperatures than traditional radiator systems, maximizing the efficiency of heat pumps and leading to significant energy savings.<br></li><li><strong>Improved Indoor Air Quality: </strong>Unlike forced-air systems, hydronic heating does not circulate dust, allergens, or pollutants, making it ideal for individuals with allergies or respiratory sensitivities.<br></li><li><strong>Space-Saving and Aesthetic:</strong> Eliminates the need for visible radiators or vents, freeing up wall space and offering complete design flexibility for interiors.<br></li><li><strong>Quiet Operation: </strong>With no noisy fans or air movement, hydronic systems operate silently, contributing to a peaceful environment.<br></li><li><strong>Long-Term Durability:</strong> Built with robust components like PEX pipes, these systems are designed for longevity and minimal maintenance.<br></li><li><strong>Sustainable Choice: </strong>When paired with a heat pump, hydronic heating offers a highly sustainable and environmentally friendly heating solution.<br></li></ul><p>Embrace the future of home heating with a hydronic underfloor system, delivering luxurious comfort, superior efficiency, and a healthier living environment.<br></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '8d730a6c-ade5-4383-bd9c-a13c0e3d5fee.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-25 23:56:38', '2025-09-25 23:56:38', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(181, 'Fan Coil Units for Cooling & Heating', 'Fan Coil Units for Cooling & Heating', 1, 6, 67, NULL, '<p>Sigma Technologies offers high-performance Fan Coil Units (FCUs) engineered to deliver efficient cooling and heating for diverse applications. Compact, reliable, and versatile, our FCUs provide precise temperature control while maintaining quiet operation and energy efficiency. Designed for seamless integration with central systems, they ensure optimal comfort in residential, commercial, and industrial environments. With advanced filtration options, our units also contribute to healthier indoor air quality. From small spaces to large facilities, Sigma Technologies customizes FCU solutions to meet specific project needs—balancing performance, sustainability, and cost-effectiveness. Experience comfort engineered with precision and backed by innovative technology.<br>We offer below different types of Fan Coil Units (FCUs) in AC as well as DC motor, 2-pipe or 4-pipe types:</p><ul><li>4-Way Cassette<br></li><li>1-Way Cassette<br></li><li>Wall Mounted<br></li><li>Ceiling Mounted<br></li><li>Floor Standing<br></li><li>Ductable</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '3b203ea4-75c1-4388-945e-da79e570e883.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-26 00:11:01', '2025-09-26 00:11:01', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(182, 'radiant-cooling-systems', 'Radiant Cooling Systems', 1, 6, 67, NULL, '<p>Radiant cooling - Smart cooling through floors, ceilings, and coils-comfort redefined.<br>Sigma Technologies specializes in advanced radiant cooling solutions using underfloor, ceiling, and fan coil systems to deliver superior indoor comfort. By cooling surfaces rather than air alone, these systems ensure uniform temperatures, silent operation, and improved energy efficiency. Underfloor and ceiling panels provide seamless integration into modern architecture, while fan coil units add flexibility for diverse applications. Radiant cooling reduces drafts, maintains healthier indoor air quality, and enhances occupant comfort in residential, commercial, and institutional spaces. Sigma Technologies customizes each solution to achieve sustainable performance, cost savings, and long-term reliability-bringing innovation and efficiency to every project.<br>Radiant cooling refers to a temperature-controlled surface that cools indoor temperatures by removing sensible heat through thermal radiation, ensuring comfort for the users of the cooled space.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '8ea78580-4db2-4bdf-a7f5-641ff6d7762e.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-26 00:15:06', '2025-09-26 00:15:06', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(183, 'radiant-heating-systems', 'Radiant Heating Systems', 1, 6, 67, NULL, '<p><strong>Radiant Heating - Seamless warmth, silent performance, and sustainable comfort.</strong><br>Sigma Technologies delivers advanced radiant heating solutions using high-quality radiators and other modern heating methods. From panel radiators to designer models, each system is engineered to provide consistent warmth, energy efficiency, and lasting comfort. Radiators offer a versatile, reliable, and aesthetically pleasing option for residential, commercial, and institutional spaces. Combined with other radiant heating technologies, they ensure silent operation, healthier indoor air, and seamless integration into any architectural style. Sigma Technologies customizes solutions to meet diverse project needs, balancing performance, sustainability, and design flexibility-bringing efficient, comfortable, and future-ready heating systems to every environment.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'c871fbcb-b07c-4bb5-aca4-aaad27cd28ee.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-26 00:20:03', '2025-09-26 00:20:03', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(184, 'grundfos-dpc-aio-panel', 'Grundfos DPC AIO panel', 1, 4, 65, NULL, '<p>The Grundfos DPC AIO panel is&nbsp;a versatile digital pump controller designed for the automatic control and protection of various pumps in water and wastewater applications. The acronym "AIO" refers to the panel''s "All-In-One" functionality, supporting multiple applications and providing comprehensive protection for single- or three-phase pumps.&nbsp;<br></p><p><strong>Key features</strong><br></p><ul><li>LCD display: Shows pump status, operating parameters, and fault information.<br></li><li>Automatic calibration: The panel automatically calibrates to the pump''s electrical details, simplifying installation.<br></li><li>Built-in motor protection: Features safeguard the pump against common electrical issues:</li></ul><ol><li>Dry-run protection: Monitors current draw and shuts down the pump to prevent damage from running without water, even without external floats.<br></li><li>Overload protection: Protects the motor from drawing excessive current.<br></li><li>Under/over-voltage protection: Guards against damage from power fluctuations.<br></li><li>Motor stall protection: Stops the pump if the motor becomes mechanically jammed.<br></li><li>Transient surge protection: Shields the control panel from voltage spikes.<br></li><li>Phase loss protection&nbsp;(for three-phase models): Protects against loss of an incoming or outgoing power phase.</li></ol><ul><li>DIP switch application settings: Allows for easy configuration of the panel for different applications, such as water supply, pressure boosting, or drainage.<br></li><li>Flexible control options: Can be controlled by either level probes/float switches or a pressure switch, depending on the application.<br></li><li>Auto/Manual switch: Provides flexibility for operational control and screen lock functionality in automatic mode.<br></li><li>Memory function: Retains settings after a power failure.<br></li><li>Accumulative run time tracking: Records the total operating hours for maintenance purposes.<br></li><li>Weatherproof casing: Enclosed in a rust-resistant, shockproof, and weather-resistant casing for durability.<br></li><li>RS485 communication&nbsp;(on certain models): Provides Modbus connectivity for integrating the panel into control systems.&nbsp;<br></li></ul><p><strong>Supported applications</strong><br>Depending on the specific model and DIP switch configuration, the DPC AIO panel can be used for:&nbsp;<br></p><ul><li>Water supply and transfer: Filling tanks based on liquid levels.<br></li><li>Pressure boosting: Working with a pressure switch and tank to maintain water pressure.<br></li><li>Drainage and sewage: Emptying sumps or pits based on liquid levels.<br></li><li>Irrigation: Managing water delivery for irrigation systems</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'c753b26f-5d93-4922-85f1-139c280bde20.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-26 00:34:34', '2025-09-26 00:34:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(185, 'grundfos-dpc-dot-panel', 'Grundfos DPC DOT panel', 1, 4, 65, NULL, '<p>The Grundfos DPC DOT panel is&nbsp;an automatic digital pump controller designed for single-phase domestic pumps up to 15 amps. The "DOT" in the name refers to its ease of use, including a "one-touch" calibration feature for quick setup. The panel is suitable for both submersible and monoblock pumps that require a running capacitor.&nbsp;<br>It provides control and protection for various residential applications, such as water transfer, pressure boosting, and tank filling or emptying.&nbsp;<br></p><p><strong>Key features</strong></p><ul><li>One-touch calibration:&nbsp;When connected to a new pump, the controller automatically learns the pump''s parameters, simplifying installation and configuration.<br></li><li>Sensorless dry-run protection:&nbsp;The panel can detect a drop in current that indicates the pump is running without water. It then shuts down the pump without the need for additional float switches in the source.<br></li><li>Automatic and manual modes:&nbsp;An auto/manual switch gives users direct control over the pump''s operation. In automatic mode, it follows programmed logic, while manual mode allows for testing or manual intervention.<br></li><li>Multiple control options:&nbsp;The panel can be controlled by either level probes (for tank filling and emptying) or a pressure switch (for pressure boosting applications).<br></li><li>Comprehensive pump protection:&nbsp;Built-in safeguards protect the pump from common electrical issues:<br>&nbsp;- Overload and pump stalled protection<br>&nbsp;- Under- and over-voltage protection<br>&nbsp;- Transient surge protection<br></li><li>LCD display:&nbsp;Provides a real-time view of the pump''s status, including voltage, current, and fault messages.<br></li><li>Durable construction:&nbsp;Encased in a rust-proof, shock-proof, and weather-proof IP54 ABS enclosure for durability in residential environments.<br></li><li>Memory function:&nbsp;The controller retains all settings and operating modes after a power failure.<br></li><li>Audible and visual alarms:&nbsp;Provide notifications to alert users of faults.&nbsp;<br></li></ul><p><strong>Common applications</strong><br></p><ul><li>Water supply:&nbsp;Automatically fills overhead water tanks from a sump.<br></li><li>Pressure boosting:&nbsp;Works with a pressure switch in hydro-pneumatic systems to maintain constant water pressure.<br></li><li>Drainage and sewage:&nbsp;Empties sumps or pits by controlling a submersible drainage pump.<br></li></ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '33332557-0431-4767-a2b4-27a9f801cece.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-26 00:40:42', '2025-09-26 00:40:42', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(186, 'grundfos-gidpc-single-phase-panel', 'Grundfos GIDPC Single Phase Panel', 1, 4, 65, NULL, '<p>The Grundfos GIDPC (Digital Pump Controller) is&nbsp;a control panel designed to manage and protect single-phase pumps up to 15A. It can be used for a variety of domestic and light commercial applications, including water transfer, drainage, and pressure-boosting systems.<br></p><p><strong>Key features</strong><br></p><ul><li>Pump protection:&nbsp;The panel includes multiple protective functions to extend the life of your pump. These include protection against:<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Dry running (with or without a float switch)<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Overload<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Motor stalling<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Over and undervoltage<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Transient power surges<br></li><li>Built-in intelligence:&nbsp;It is a programmable device with an LCD screen that displays real-time pump running status, voltage, current, and fault information.<br></li><li>Operational flexibility:<br>- Multiple applications:&nbsp;DIP switches allow the user to easily configure the panel for different operating scenarios, such as water supply, drainage, or pressure-boosting.<br>- Auto/Manual mode:&nbsp;A switch allows you to run the pump either automatically, controlled by level sensors or a pressure switch, or manually.<br>- Power recovery:&nbsp;The panel has a memory function that allows it to resume its previous operating state after a power outage.<br></li><li>Alarm system:&nbsp;The system provides both visual and audio alarms to indicate faults.<br></li><li>Monitoring and communication:&nbsp;The GIDPC logs the last five fault records and can store the total running hours of the pump. It also has RS-485 Modbus communication for integration with other systems.<br></li><li>Easy setup:&nbsp;The panel features "one-touch" or push-button calibration for pump parameters.&nbsp;<br></li></ul><p><strong>Applications</strong><br>The&nbsp;Grundfos GIDPC&nbsp;is a versatile controller suitable for various applications in residential, institutional, and light-industrial settings. Examples include:&nbsp;<br></p><ul><li>Water supply:&nbsp;Tank filling and water transfer.<br></li><li>Wastewater management:&nbsp;Tank emptying nd drainage.<br></li><li>Pressure boosting:&nbsp;Managing hydro-pneumatic systems.&nbsp; &nbsp;<br></li></ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'dbe45e39-cf3d-480a-94e3-e28ce21d32d5.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-26 00:47:08', '2025-09-26 00:47:08', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(187, 'bypass-comfort-valve-grundfos', 'Bypass/Comfort Valve Grundfos', 1, 4, 65, NULL, '<p>The Grundfos GIDPC (Digital Pump Controller) is&nbsp;a control panel designed to manage and protect single-phase pumps up to 15A. It can be used for a variety of domestic and light commercial applications, including water transfer, drainage, and pressure-boosting systems.<br></p><p><strong>Key features</strong><br></p><ul><li>Pump protection:&nbsp;The panel includes multiple protective functions to extend the life of your pump. These include protection against:<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Dry running (with or without a float switch)<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Overload<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Motor stalling<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Over and undervoltage<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;- Transient power surges<br></li><li>Built-in intelligence:&nbsp;It is a programmable device with an LCD screen that displays real-time pump running status, voltage, current, and fault information.<br></li><li>Operational flexibility:<br>- Multiple applications:&nbsp;DIP switches allow the user to easily configure the panel for different operating scenarios, such as water supply, drainage, or pressure-boosting.<br>- Auto/Manual mode:&nbsp;A switch allows you to run the pump either automatically, controlled by level sensors or a pressure switch, or manually.<br>- Power recovery:&nbsp;The panel has a memory function that allows it to resume its previous operating state after a power outage.<br></li><li>Alarm system:&nbsp;The system provides both visual and audio alarms to indicate faults.<br></li><li>Monitoring and communication:&nbsp;The GIDPC logs the last five fault records and can store the total running hours of the pump. It also has RS-485 Modbus communication for integration with other systems.<br></li><li>Easy setup:&nbsp;The panel features "one-touch" or push-button calibration for pump parameters.&nbsp;<br></li></ul><p><strong>Applications</strong><br>The&nbsp;Grundfos GIDPC&nbsp;is a versatile controller suitable for various applications in residential, institutional, and light-industrial settings. Examples include:&nbsp;<br></p><ul><li>Water supply:&nbsp;Tank filling and water transfer.<br></li><li>Wastewater management:&nbsp;Tank emptying nd drainage.<br></li><li>Pressure boosting:&nbsp;Managing hydro-pneumatic systems.&nbsp; &nbsp;<br></li></ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '3d0e1d43-a236-46a9-a28f-d7f553028569.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-26 00:50:35', '2025-09-26 00:50:35', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(188, 'grundfos-unilift-apg.40.10.3', 'Grundfos UNILIFT APG.40.10.3', 1, 4, 57, NULL, '<p>The Grundfos UNILIFT APG.40.10.3 is&nbsp;a single-stage submersible pump specifically designed for pumping domestic wastewater under pressure. It is equipped with a professional grinder system that macerates solids and particles into small pieces, allowing the pump to transport sewage over long distances through small-diameter pipes.&nbsp;<br></p><p><strong>Key specifications</strong><br></p><ul><li>Application: Pumping domestic wastewater, including blackwater from toilets, from single-family homes or low-rise residential buildings. This is useful for properties located below the sewer level or in areas without a gravity-fed sewer system.<br></li><li>Grinder system: A powerful grinder based on Grundfos'' commercial SEG pump range shreds solids to prevent clogging in smaller pipe systems.<br></li><li>Electrical data:<br>- Phase: 3-phase<br>- Voltage: 380 V (in India) or 400 V (in Australia and Europe)<br>- Power: 1.1 kW input (P1) / 1 kW output (P2)<br>- Frequency: 50 Hz<br>Performance:<br></li><li>Maximum static head: 26 meters<br></li><li>Maximum flow: 12.8 m³/h<br></li><li>Materials:<br>- Pump housing: Cast iron (EN-GJL-200)<br>- Impeller: Composite (PPE-PS-GF30)<br>- Motor housing: Stainless steel (EN 1.4301 / AISI 304)<br></li><li>Installation: The pump is suitable for submerged installation up to 7 meters and can be fitted with an auto-coupling system for easy maintenance. It can also be installed as a standalone unit in a pit.<br></li><li>Dimensions and weight: Weighs approximately 24.8 kg.&nbsp;<br></li></ul><p><strong>Applications</strong><br>The&nbsp;UNILIFT APG.40.10.3&nbsp;is used in various domestic settings for:<br></p><ul><li>Internal lifting stations: Installed in a sump or pit inside a basement or other areas below sewer level.<br></li><li>External pumping stations: Placed in an outdoor pumping station that transports sewage to the public sewer system.<br></li><li>Standalone solutions: Used in a pit for properties requiring a single-pump solution.<br></li><li>Pressurized systems: Pumps blackwater and other domestic sewage from residential buildings, especially in rural areas.&nbsp;</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'd2cb6219-ad45-46c0-9dec-6f8e2bf7c48b.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-26 00:56:29', '2025-10-12 01:54:54', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(189, 'grundfos-comfort-15-14-b-tdt', 'GRUNDFOS COMFORT 15-14 B TDT', 1, 4, 52, NULL, '<p>The Grundfos COMFORT 15-14 B TDT is&nbsp;an energy-efficient hot water recirculation pump designed for residential use in homes with a dedicated return line. It is a smart pump that helps save water and energy by providing instant hot water and avoiding the waste of running the tap while waiting for the water to heat up.&nbsp;<br></p><p><strong>Key features</strong><br></p><ul><li>Combined timer and temperature control (TDT):&nbsp;This pump offers a combination of two control modes for maximum efficiency.<br>- Timer mode:&nbsp;Allows you to program the pump to operate during specific times of day that match your household''s routine, ensuring hot water is available when needed.<br>- Temperature control mode:&nbsp;During the scheduled operating times, a built-in sensor monitors the water temperature and automatically activates the pump only when the temperature drops below a set level. This prevents continuous running and reduces energy loss.<br></li><li>High efficiency:&nbsp;The pump features a permanent magnet (ECM) motor with low power consumption (5–7 W), contributing to significant energy savings.<br></li><li>Potable water approved:&nbsp;The pump housing is made of corrosion-resistant brass, making it safe for use with drinking water.<br></li><li>Spherical motor design:&nbsp;This wear-resistant, shaftless motor is lubricated by the pumped liquid, requiring no external shaft seal. This design prevents limescale buildup and eliminates the risk of leaks.<br></li><li>Dry-running protection:&nbsp;The pump is protected against damage if the system runs out of water.<br></li><li>Easy maintenance:&nbsp;The pump head can be easily removed for cleaning and descaling, even with very hard water.<br></li><li>User-friendly interface:&nbsp;An operating panel with LED indicators and push-buttons allows for intuitive setup and programming of the pump''s control modes.&nbsp;<br></li></ul><p><strong>Benefits</strong><br></p><ul><li>Instant hot water:&nbsp;No more waiting for hot water at taps, showers, and other fixtures.<br></li><li>Water conservation:&nbsp;Eliminates the waste of water that would otherwise go down the drain while waiting for it to get hot.<br></li><li>Energy savings:&nbsp;The smart control modes reduce heat loss from the pipes and limit the pump''s run time, saving a significant amount of energy compared to continuously running circulators.<br></li><li>Reduced noise:&nbsp;The ECM motor provides quiet operation.<br></li><li>Longevity:&nbsp;The robust, wearless design of the motor ensures a long service life.&nbsp;</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '51b72d60-4765-4acf-b1e5-c480e2de3ed9.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-26 01:01:52', '2026-01-19 08:39:18', '47460', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(190, 'grundfos-alpha2-25-60-180', 'GRUNDFOS ALPHA2 25-60 180', 1, 4, 52, NULL, '<p>The Grundfos ALPHA2 25-60 180 is a&nbsp;highly energy-efficient circulator pump for residential and light commercial heating and air-conditioning systems. It features an intelligent AUTOADAPT function that automatically adjusts pump performance to match a system''s actual demand.&nbsp;<br></p><p><strong>Key features</strong><br></p><ul><li>AUTOADAPT control:&nbsp;This is the ALPHA2''s most significant feature. When enabled, the pump automatically analyzes the heating system and adjusts its settings to meet the current heat demand, ensuring optimal comfort with minimal energy consumption.<br></li><li>High energy efficiency:&nbsp;With an Energy Efficiency Index (EEI) of 0.17, the ALPHA2 25-60 180 exceeds strict EU energy-efficiency standards. Its advanced motor and hydraulics significantly reduce energy costs.<br></li><li>Compact design:&nbsp;The pump''s design, with its integrated electronics, allows for easy installation even in tight or confined spaces.<br></li><li>Robust startup:&nbsp;To prevent seizing after periods of inactivity, the pump''s "robust start" feature continuously attempts to restart at the highest possible torque.<br></li><li>Self-venting:&nbsp;This feature automatically removes trapped air from the pump, which prevents noise and improves operational efficiency.<br></li><li>Intuitive display:&nbsp;An LED display shows the pump''s real-time power consumption in watts, allowing you to monitor its efficiency.<br></li><li>Night setback:&nbsp;An integrated function automatically reduces pump performance at night to further decrease energy usage when demand is low.<br></li><li>Easy installation:&nbsp;The pump comes with an ALPHA plug for quick and simple electrical connections. Insulation shells are also included to minimize heat loss.&nbsp;<br></li></ul><p><strong>Technical specifications</strong><br></p><ul><li>Pump applications:&nbsp;Suitable for single- or two-pipe radiator systems, underfloor heating, and systems with constant or variable flow temperatures. The stainless-steel version (ALPHA2 N) is also suitable for domestic hot-water systems.<br></li><li>Connections:&nbsp;The 180 indicates a port-to-port length of 180 mm. The 25 indicates a nominal pipe connection size of DN 25, or 1 1/2-inch external thread.<br></li><li>Performance:&nbsp;The 60 indicates a maximum head of 60 dm, or 6 meters. It can deliver a maximum flow rate of 3.1 to 3.4 m³/h.<br></li><li>Materials:&nbsp;The standard model has a cast-iron pump housing.<br></li><li>Liquid temperature:&nbsp;The pump can handle liquid temperatures ranging from 2°C to 110°C.&nbsp;</li></ul><p>Difference between ALPHA2 and ALPHA3<br>While the ALPHA3 shares the same core features as the ALPHA2, it offers additional functionality. The ALPHA3 can be controlled by the Grundfos GO Remote app, which enables installers to perform quick and accurate hydraulic balancing for both radiator and underfloor heating systems.&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '55a3827b-b3b5-4088-9f69-cad2cbfdf971.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-26 01:06:01', '2026-07-13 23:21:50', '94920', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(191, 'swimming-pool-and-spa-accessories', 'Swimming Pool & SPA Accessories', 1, 6, 73, NULL, '<p>Sigma Technologies is a company dedicated to&nbsp;distributing high-quality equipment and accessories for swimming pools and spas. We acquire advanced technology from Europe and provide reliable and certified products at competitive prices. Our products have been carefully designed to guarantee comfort and security for the end users. Our products are easy to install, require minimum maintenance, and provide long-term pool and spa care.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '60d3b3b0-8534-4109-b423-bef4444c1cbb.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-26 01:14:54', '2025-09-26 01:14:54', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(192, 'pipex-pex-a-pert-pipe-and-push-fittings', 'PIPEX  PEX-A,  Pert Pipe and Push Fittings', 1, 6, 28, NULL, '<p>Pipex refers to several companies involved in different piping products. The most relevant company for PEX, PERT, and push fittings is likely&nbsp;Pipex (Auray Managing S.L.), a European manufacturer specializing in plastic piping systems. This European manufacturer creates flexible piping solutions used for plumbing, radiant heating, and other applications.&nbsp;<br></p><p><strong>PEX Pipe</strong><br>PEX, or cross-linked polyethylene, is a durable and flexible plastic piping material. Pipex manufactures PEX-a pipes with a high degree of crosslinking, giving them enhanced temperature and pressure resistance compared to other PEX pipes.&nbsp;<br></p><p><strong>Key features:</strong><br></p><ul><li>Manufactured using the peroxide method for superior strength.<br></li><li>Available with or without an EVOH oxygen barrier, which prevents oxygen from entering the system and corroding metal components.<br></li><li>Highly flexible for fast and easy installation.<br></li><li>Used for hot and cold water distribution, radiant heating, and snow-melting systems.&nbsp;<br></li></ul><p><strong>PERT Pipe</strong><br>PERT, or polyethylene of raised temperature resistance, is a non-cross-linked form of polyethylene that is less elastic than PEX but still highly flexible. Pipex PERT pipes often feature an EVOH oxygen barrier.&nbsp;<br></p><p><strong>Key features:</strong><br></p><ul><li>Flexible and easy to install, often used for underfloor heating.<br></li><li>Excellent resistance to corrosion and scaling.<br></li><li>Can tolerate temperatures up to 60°C and short-term temperatures up to 110°C.<br></li><li>Utilizes the same types of connection systems as PEX.&nbsp;<br></li></ul><p><strong>Push fittings</strong><br>Pipex produces a variety of fittings for its piping systems, including push-fit options that allow for tool-free connections.&nbsp;<br></p><ul><li>How they work:&nbsp;The fitting contains an internal ring of metal teeth that grips the pipe and an O-ring that creates a watertight seal.<br></li><li>Advantages:<br>- Ease of installation:&nbsp;Push fittings are very fast and easy to use, especially in tight spaces.<br>- Compatibility:&nbsp;They work with both PEX and PERT pipes.<br>- Versatility:&nbsp;Pipex offers a range of fittings, including connectors, elbows, and tees, in materials like PPSU and brass.&nbsp;</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1e14d09a-c386-4950-b6a9-f996aa66e0b4.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-26 01:24:46', '2025-10-12 02:11:25', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(193, 'infrared-patio-heater-im-ih-1500-h', 'Infrared Patio Heater(IM-IH-1500-H)', 1, 3, 14, NULL, '<p>The Hanging-Type Infrared Patio Heater is a stylish and efficient solution for outdoor heating, perfect for patios, balconies, or gazebos. Unlike traditional heaters that warm the air, this unit uses infrared technology to directly heat objects and people, providing a cozy and consistent warmth similar to the sun.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'b8fa9eb7-132b-4feb-9ab3-b91c46d16eba.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-26 01:34:47', '2025-10-07 03:34:12', '13560', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1),
(194, 'skid-mounted-packaged-heat-pump-systems', 'Skid-Mounted Packaged Heat Pump Systems', 1, 6, 58, NULL, '<p><strong>Skid-Mounted Packaged Heat Pump Systems - Plug &amp; Play hot water-pre-piped, pre-wired, ready to perform.</strong><br>Sigma Technologies offers advanced skid-mounted packaged heat pump systems for domestic hot water, manufactured by Innmotek LLP, India. These plug-and-play solutions integrate high-efficiency heat pumps with storage tanks, fully pre-piped and pre-wired on a single skid. Designed for quick installation and hassle-free operation, the systems deliver reliable hot water while optimizing space, energy efficiency, and performance. With robust engineering and ready-to-use design, they minimize on-site labour, reduce installation time, and ensure consistent quality. Ideal for residential, commercial, and institutional projects, Sigma Technologies provides sustainable, cost-effective hot water solutions tailored to modern needs with Innmotek’s trusted technology.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'c8324048-3828-432f-84e8-6b67d54ecad3.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-26 01:37:56', '2025-09-26 01:37:56', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(195, 'pv-solar-water-heater', 'PV Solar Water Heater', 1, 6, 17, NULL, '<p>A PV solar water heater is a system that uses photovoltaic (PV) panels to generate electricity, which then powers an electric heating element inside a water tank.<br>This differs from a traditional solar thermal water heater, which uses flat-plate collectors or evacuated tubes to absorb the sun''s heat directly to warm a fluid.<br>The main advantage of this system is its simplicity and flexibility, as you don''t need pipes running from the solar panels to the water tank. The components are the PV panels, a cable to carry the electricity, and a water tank with a built-in heating element.<br></p><p>When the PV voltage is within the working range of the controller, the solar heating is given priority. When the PV voltage drops below the working range of the controller, the utility power starts to heat. During this process, if the PV voltage is restored, the utility power stops heating.<br>When the PV voltage is within the working range of the controller, the solar heating is given priority. When the PV voltage drops below the working range of the controller, it will switch to the AC heating until the water temperature reaches the highest setting, and the water temperature stops heating<br></p><ul><li>PV and Grid combined heating hot water, intelligent switching<br></li><li>Hot water output rate &gt;70% <br></li><li>Advanced MPPT solar water heating controller, efficiency&gt;99%<br></li><li>Easy installation, reducing the waterway installation<br></li><li>Leakage protection and over-temperature protection, safe and reliable</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '26b8f95d-ae37-4253-891f-108cf3343ccf.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-09-26 01:43:12', '2025-09-26 01:43:12', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(196, 'sauna', 'Sauna', 1, 15, 72, NULL, '<p>Explore a variety of sauna types from Harvia, including Traditional Finnish Saunas, either electric or wood burning, or a combination of electric &amp; wood, Infrared Saunas, Steam Saunas, and Combination Saunas. With a wide variety of indoor or outdoor saunas, bathroom saunas, sauna controllers, and complete accessories, Harvia stood as a leader and inventor.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'fb318bcb-5fcf-4b28-b881-0df5fd71b283.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-10-08 00:08:12', '2025-10-12 02:01:35', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(197, 'steam-generators-and-rooms', 'Steam Generators & Rooms', 1, 15, 72, NULL, '<p>Transform your wellness routine with our steam generators, steam rooms, and steam showers. Experience soothing steam that promotes relaxation and detoxification, whether in a dedicated steam room or a modern steam shower. Elevate your spa experience and embrace the ultimate in rejuvenation and comfort.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'b9da352c-0cea-4e7f-bea4-afa575f2493b.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-10-08 00:19:18', '2025-10-12 02:13:47', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(198, 'jacuzzi-bath-tubs-and-cold-plunges', 'Jacuzzi, Bath Tubs and Cold Plunges', 1, 15, 72, NULL, '<p>Indulge in relaxation with our Jacuzzis and luxurious bathtubs, designed for ultimate comfort and hydrotherapy benefits. Enhance your wellness routine with invigorating cold plunges, promoting recovery and circulation. Elevate your spa experience at home with these essential elements for rejuvenation and soothing tranquility.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '5a1fcec8-821d-4bb6-957d-eaf7f6a69ab6.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-10-08 00:26:30', '2025-10-08 00:26:30', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(199, 'spa-accessories', 'Spa Accessories', 1, 15, 72, NULL, '<p>Enhance your wellness space with our spa and massage chairs, beds, and tables, crafted for comfort and support. Perfect for professionals or home use, they provide the ideal setting for relaxation and rejuvenation, ensuring every treatment is a luxurious experience for your clients or yourself.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '9ff0b9ae-87e3-4170-9ca3-933d887f81a6.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-10-08 00:33:52', '2025-10-12 02:06:47', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(200, 'diy-drinking-water-filter', 'DIY (Drinking Water Filter)', 1, 7, 68, NULL, '<p>Over-the-counter/wall-mounted drinking water filter with faucet fittings and tubing. Easy to install and does not require any drilling or expertise.</p><ul><li>All-in-One Stage cartridge: Carbon Block Technology</li><li>Filter cartridge model: AP Easy Complete<br></li><li>Efficient removal rating at 0.5micron<br></li><li>Efficient capacity at 2,800 liters*<br></li><li>Flow rate at 2.0LPM<br></li><li>Select VOCs: reduction for Atrazine, Benzene, Carbofuran, Dichlorobenzene,&nbsp;Lindane, Toxophene<br></li><li>Sanitary Quick Change (SQC) design<br></li><li>NSF 42,53 certified and FDA CFR-21 compliant materials</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '274b984a-93b9-4481-8501-d5ecdf014dba.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-10-08 00:45:58', '2025-10-08 00:45:58', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(201, 'ctm-02-drinking-water-filter', 'CTM-02 (Drinking Water Filter)', 1, 7, 68, NULL, '<p>Counter-Top drinking water filter with faucet and tubing. Easy to install without any piping modifications.</p><ul><li>All-in-One stage cartridge: Carbon Block Technology</li><li>Filter cartridge model: AP Easy Complete</li><li>Efficient removal rating at 0.5 micron<br></li><li>Efficient capacity at 2,800 liters*<br></li><li>Flow rate at 2.0LPM<br></li><li>Select VOCs: reduction for Atrazine, Benzene, Carbofuran, Dichlorobenzene, Lindane, Toxophene<br></li><li>Sanitary Quick Change (SQC) design<br></li><li>NSF 42,53 certified and FDA CFR-21 compliant materials </li></ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '9b470001-1038-4f98-a1cb-1e969b1be856.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-10-08 00:55:31', '2025-10-08 00:55:31', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(202, 'dws160-l-drinking-water-filter', 'DWS160-L (Drinking Water Filter)', 1, 7, 68, NULL, '<p>Under-sink large drinking water filter with faucet for a large family.</p><ul><li>IMPACT Technology<br></li><li>Filter cartridge model: DWS160-L<br></li><li>Efficient removal rating at 0.2micron<br></li><li>Efficient capacity at 22,700 liters*<br></li><li>Flow rate at 9.4 LPM<br></li><li>Select VOCs: reduction for Atrazine, Benzene, Carbofuran, Dichlorobenzene, Lindane, Toxophene<br></li><li>Sanitary Quick Change (SQC) design<br></li><li>NSF 42,53 certified and FDA CFR-21 compliant materials <br></li></ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '01a3ca95-fa3d-4f14-b3d9-8e321706f3db.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-10-08 01:03:53', '2025-10-08 01:03:53', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(203, 'ias-140-drinking-water-filter', 'IAS 140 (Drinking Water Filter)', 1, 7, 68, NULL, '<p>Under-sink large drinking water filter with faucet for a large family.</p><ul><li>IMPACT Technology<br></li><li>Efficient removal rating at 0.2micron<br></li><li>Efficient capacity at 1,00,000 liters*<br></li><li>Flow rate at 7.9 LPM<br></li><li>Select VOCs: reduction for Atrazine, Benzene, Carbofuran, Dichlorobenzene, Lindane,&nbsp;Toxophene<br></li><li>Sanitary Quick Change (SQC) design<br></li><li>NSF 42,53 certified and FDA CFR-21 compliant materials </li></ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'd1967e0f-2a00-4205-84fa-d3dff644a429.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-10-08 01:09:55', '2025-10-08 01:09:55', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0);
